<graph edgedefault="undirected"><node id="&quot;HIGHER PRICED MORTGAGE LOANS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Higher Priced Mortgage Loans (HPML) are consumer-purpose loans secured by a principal dwelling with an APR higher than specified benchmarks."&lt;SEP&gt;"Higher Priced Mortgage Loans are loans that fall into a higher cost category and are subject to specific regulations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Higher Priced Mortgage Loans are a category of loans allowed within the Advantage program, subject to specific testing and compliance procedures."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-889bb036e55402548e1f5e0fcb109226&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dcbf025ce89296c2fe585617d648039b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-357b3035e037e02a3c6636835c516347</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 9}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 113}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 505}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;AVERAGE PRIME OFFER RATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Average Prime Offer Rate (APOR) is a benchmark rate published weekly by the Federal Reserve System to determine loan interest rates."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-889bb036e55402548e1f5e0fcb109226</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 8}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 103}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 464}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LOANTRAC&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Loantrac is a product mentioned in the context of closing documentation, likely referring to a system used for tracking loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loantrac is a software or tool used for managing loan applications and related documentation, including appraisal orders."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loantrac is an online service platform used for managing loans and related documentation, including ordering closing documents."&lt;SEP&gt;LOANTRAC is a digital loan management system and platform utilized in the mortgage industry. It streamlines the mortgage closing process, manages loan applications, processes, and documentation, and facilitates the submission, tracking, and management of mortgage loans. Featuring functions like tracking rates, loan statuses, and income eligibility determination through FIPS numbers, LOANTRAC is used for managing and tracking mortgage loans, processing loan registrations, and handling closing documents efficiently. It also plays a role in managing affordable housing loan requests and facilitating the Hybrid eClose process. LOANTRAC is a web-based platform used by lenders for processing escrow waiver requests and assists in ordering and processing closing documents, emphasizing efficiency and accessibility in loan transactions. Additionally, LOANTRAC is mentioned in connection with Flagstar's WBCD, indicating its significance in the loan management technology industry.&lt;SEP&gt;"Loantrac is a technological platform where orders for Jumbo Desk Reviews must be placed, facilitating the appraisal management process."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loantrac is a web-based platform used for managing loan transactions and closing documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loantrac is a web-based registration system used for managing FHA loan transactions and processes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loantrac is a software or system used for managing and tracking loan applications and appraisals in the underwriting process."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-889bb036e55402548e1f5e0fcb109226&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4849d91ba0d105495fd48b0a77c7c582&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da6a7f245e88177bac6b85d5f808ebd3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b0056b117b540a72b17dd275d006f45&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b8df18a65c5f6957ed36a347cf3c092&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db88d357021738de0f589ce49936e0e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e572c9b9bd53e500c5e02283f3230e6b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b6d8750d3b8676bc5099fb262793a7ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fe4b9e8302b8de2d8d692106e4e284ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-593f9403b246f17722c284b9fc562c85&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bde383f3ecde8888355124cd638e2e53&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-192e3f9f08a0121645e56ca36babd81b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-783c4782c02cd021bcdf3bdbcc5f3466&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e0b943be84e7ac4bbf9b166f805ef17c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-61f35bbac411a48e356ef98016ff6b33&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f11f5ef3fffef89b593ca081411d1b13&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-04a4d78a32f7dce438d7f1d06834d5ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f2378deca7fb18f0144fa8707001424&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fdba698a5ff7dd259797f2300b8f4759&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a2fe6bde08b88616e4d4932fe5f5e5c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea9eec682fb4dbe92270f8b8c48a9354&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a72060811d2de811b03ec94848dcad94&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-22d3a76e6c1f50526ac6e8ed759d2710&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-49f8738c76594c2ed9866d0e86818ca8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9a577e8766cf4f0e1ae599795cd9c6fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-45f29d1e5fffab173b878a2ce71c0888</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 9}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 114}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 510}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FHA STREAMLINE REFINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"FHA Streamline Refinance is a government-backed refinance option that allows borrowers to refinance loans with minimal lender requirements."&lt;SEP&gt;"FHA Streamline Refinance is a simplified refinance process for homeowners with existing FHA loans designed to reduce paperwork and expedite approval."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-889bb036e55402548e1f5e0fcb109226&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e78a99763ca81ea2755a9310a0e6cc85</data>
