  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"October 1, 2009, is the effective date for all mortgage applications considered as Higher Priced Mortgage Loans (HPML)."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-889bb036e55402548e1f5e0fcb109226</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;2025-08-25&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"2025-08-25 is the date on which the document titled Higher Priced Mortgage Loans (HPML) was extracted."</data>
