<node id="&quot;INTEREST RATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Interest Rate is a financial term referring to the cost of borrowing, which is detailed in the guidelines of the product."&lt;SEP&gt;"Interest Rate is a financial term that signifies the percentage of a loan charged as interest to the borrower, crucial in adjustable-rate mortgages like the 5/1 ARM."&lt;SEP&gt;"Interest Rate is the percentage charged on a loan or the return on savings, which influences loan affordability and terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Interest Rate refers to the percentage charged on the loan amount, subject to adjustments based on the type of mortgage (fixed or adjustable)."&lt;SEP&gt;"Interest Rate refers to the percentage charge on borrowed money, influencing mortgage payments significantly."&lt;SEP&gt;"Interest Rate is the percentage charged on a loan, used to calculate the cost of borrowing over time."&lt;SEP&gt;"Interest Rate is the percentage charged on the loan amount, an important detail required during loan registration."&lt;SEP&gt;"Interest Rate refers to the cost of borrowing and is a central aspect of the mortgage financing discussion."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Interest Rate is the cost of borrowing money, expressed as a percentage of the loan amount, affecting the overall cost of the mortgage."&lt;SEP&gt;"Interest rate refers to the percentage of a loan charged as interest to the borrower, which can fluctuate and affect the eligibility for the float-down policy."&lt;SEP&gt;"Interest Rate is the percentage charged on a loan or paid on deposits, which affects the cost of borrowing through products like HELOCs."&lt;SEP&gt;"Interest Rate refers to the cost of borrowing money expressed as a percentage of the loan amount, influencing the overall cost to the borrower over time."&lt;SEP&gt;"Interest Rate refers to the percentage charged on borrowed money, a key concept in financial transactions and products."&lt;SEP&gt;"Interest rate is the percentage charged on the loan amount by the lender, significant in determining loan costs."&lt;SEP&gt;"Interest rate refers to the cost of borrowing money, presented as a percentage of the loan amount, which is a critical factor in loan agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Interest Rate is the percentage charged by lenders on the borrowed amount, determining the cost of borrowing over time."&lt;SEP&gt;"Interest Rate is a key financial factor that affects the cost of borrowing and can change under various circumstances as stated in the document."&lt;SEP&gt;"Interest Rate is the percentage charged on borrowed money, which affects the cost of loans and is a significant factor in refinancing decisions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Interest Rate refers to the amount charged by lenders to borrowers for the use of money, usually expressed as a percentage of the loan amount."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9cd1c976503db6a0b9762d63aba656cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b722d926669aa7676c36ecbb75a4a233&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-889bb036e55402548e1f5e0fcb109226&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af318020d8f16430d1a60515a789d41d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b42b071e6198f2a53344eeed3e0dca2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f1b06bf2c39f8da79b3399842638c80b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eec7e8fc248456d980c970b75e0fbf41&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f08c1849f1a1e52584c06fc2286667f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-783c4782c02cd021bcdf3bdbcc5f3466&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1afd5d25f6f318da0cbe2e55f0a46af0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8df57131d49eba22a5ca15cafeb404cb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c8b4e28d440c820b5ce2e89c08cd1b75&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de34030d71ef2c627010a089db20697c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d0459e9b5b3885ad40728e4e0af01123&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c6c6dd97681ba9caa6c83d8ddf9ec59&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a72060811d2de811b03ec94848dcad94&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca3069902295dcf5b2b505753d7623f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1e89cab5ceec2e12a42293f598e5c33&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f639d102461efe890e188cbc182dba52</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 8}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 103}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 463}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 818}]</data>
</node>
