<node id="&quot;REGULATIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Regulations are the official rules that govern the loan process and the conduct of involved parties, ensuring compliance and fairness."&lt;SEP&gt;"Regulations refer to rules and guidelines established by authorities governing financial practices, particularly in the lending industry."&lt;SEP&gt;"Regulations refer to the rules and laws that govern financial transactions and lending practices within the industry."&lt;SEP&gt;"Regulations pertain to the laws and standards that govern the mortgage industry, which sellers must comply with to maintain approval status."</data>
