<node id="&quot;CLOSING COSTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Closing Costs are expenses incurred during the finalization of a real estate transaction, which can include fees for services and documentation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Closing Costs are fees and expenses incurred when finalizing a mortgage, necessary for borrowers to understand as part of the loan process."&lt;SEP&gt;"Closing Costs are the fees and expenses incurred during the closing of a real estate transaction, which are typically paid by the borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"Closing Costs refer to the expenses necessary to finalize a real estate transaction, which may be covered by contributions from interested parties."&lt;SEP&gt;Closing Costs are the fees and expenses that buyers and sellers must pay to finalize a real estate transaction. These costs can include various charges such as lender fees, escrow fees, taxes, appraisal fees, title insurance, and other transactional fees. Closing Costs are typically not financeable under certain programs, such as the One-Close Construction program. In some cases, these expenses can be covered by contributions from involved parties. Overall, Closing Costs are additional expenses beyond the property price that impact the total cost of acquiring or selling a property.&lt;SEP&gt;"Closing Costs refer to the fees and expenses associated with finalizing a mortgage transaction, which the borrower may need to cover during the refinance process."&lt;SEP&gt;"Closing Costs encompass all fees associated with finalizing a real estate transaction, affecting the total amount the borrower must provide."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-889bb036e55402548e1f5e0fcb109226&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-930f40233ddc622409d80debbd41e55f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8760dceb193fd7c5f24d24209ee5e31&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db88d357021738de0f589ce49936e0e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c2f4d692a0955d46073163734c23b26&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b42b071e6198f2a53344eeed3e0dca2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f1b06bf2c39f8da79b3399842638c80b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e01afc290e08ec0f3a536bcbc8c10f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f08c1849f1a1e52584c06fc2286667f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d3310e925ce8d483d790951bc5b7e818&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-803513d6e632c311aec48592cb79b4f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-29e2bb5014fcbf1d6e95d3ac5b1702bc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d0459e9b5b3885ad40728e4e0af01123&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71f642eb6cc44e3fc724fd1b5beeccd5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd698c420bb978f364630c455d2abf4a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca3069902295dcf5b2b505753d7623f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-25dcfc163b5b00ffab734b755ea03592&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a403e885ce18327dd600e7521b66a2e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd0c5c971a5a48bbded5da8b256a175c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-060d3305d5697520404f94c4fcd2cb85&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-437272f81cc4575a4fa57f55ce8d121c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9c57c1331aa9873de4467468c1b07505</data>
