  <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"VA Form 26-8923 is the Interest Rate Reduction Refinancing Loan Worksheet necessary for submitting applications under the IRRRL program."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c1e89cab5ceec2e12a42293f598e5c33</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 87}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 436}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;GOVERNMENT UNDERWRITING SUPPORT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Government Underwriting Support is a resource for lenders to get assistance with underwriting questions related to VA IRRRL loans."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c1e89cab5ceec2e12a42293f598e5c33</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 8}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 109}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 484}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COMPREHENSIVE LIST OF FEES - BROKER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Comprehensive List of Fees for Brokers details the various fees associated with VA loans and refinancing, including the administrative fees charged by Flagstar."&lt;SEP&gt;"The document titled 'Comprehensive List of Fees - Broker' outlines various fees applicable to loan processing and administrative tasks conducted by Flagstar Bank."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-fe4b9e8302b8de2d8d692106e4e284ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1e89cab5ceec2e12a42293f598e5c33</data>
