</node>
<node id="&quot;COMPREHENSIVE LIST OF FEES - CORRESPONDENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Comprehensive List of Fees for Correspondents provides fee details relevant to lenders participating in the VA loan program."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c1e89cab5ceec2e12a42293f598e5c33</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;VA PAMPHLET 26-7 CHAPTER 8&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Chapter 8 of VA Pamphlet 26-7 outlines the allowable fees and closing costs that can be charged to borrowers in VA loans, relevant for the IRRRL program."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c1e89cab5ceec2e12a42293f598e5c33</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;VA AGENT IDENTIFICATION NUMBER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A VA Agent Identification Number is a unique identifier for lenders approved by the VA to facilitate access to necessary VA tools and resources."&lt;SEP&gt;"VA Agent Identification Number is a unique identifier assigned to approved VA lenders, crucial for accessing specific resources and systems."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c1e89cab5ceec2e12a42293f598e5c33&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-01039c48e44ce5e4ea96c87117f23d78</data>
