  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Rate Floor is a financial term indicating the minimum interest rate that can be applied on certain loan products."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-783c4782c02cd021bcdf3bdbcc5f3466</data>
