  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"First Payment Date indicates when the borrower's first payment on the HELOC is due, typically governed by the disbursement date."&lt;SEP&gt;"First Payment Date refers to the date when the borrower is required to make their first payment on the loan following its disbursement."&lt;SEP&gt;"First Payment Date signifies when the initial payment for HELOC loans is due, which is determined by the disbursement date of the loan."</data>
