  <data key="d1">"Table 1 includes details related to extensions and pricing associated with loan delivery times in the policy document."&lt;SEP&gt;"Table 1 is a section in the document that outlines guidelines for primary residence purchase and refinancing."&lt;SEP&gt;"Table 1 on Page 10 illustrates various Loan-To-Value (LTV) ratios associated with different fixed-rate mortgage products."&lt;SEP&gt;"Table 1 presents the interest rate and adjustment cap details for the 5/1 ARM, specifying its financial characteristics in structured format."&lt;SEP&gt;"Table 1 represents a structured presentation of data regarding fixed-rate options within the Extended Lock with Float Down program."&lt;SEP&gt;"Table 1 outlines financing options for primary residences, detailing maximum loan amounts and credit score requirements for various property types."&lt;SEP&gt;"Table 1 presents residual income requirements for different family sizes across various U.S. regions, serving as a guideline for loan eligibility."&lt;SEP&gt;"Table 1 is a structural representation found on Page 1, detailing the maximum loan-to-value ratios and credit score requirements for different property types under the Home Possible program."</data>
