<node id="&quot;WBCD&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"WBCD (Web Based Closing Docs) is a service by Flagstar that allows users to order necessary documentation for closing loans effectively."&lt;SEP&gt;"WBCD refers to a tool used in the closing process for balancing financial documents and verifying accuracy related to the Closing Disclosure."&lt;SEP&gt;"WBCD stands for Web Based Closing Docs, a service provided by Flagstar for ordering closing documents."</data>
