<node id="&quot;INTEREST RATE FLOOR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Interest Rate Floor defines the minimum interest rate that can be charged on an adjustable-rate mortgage, ensuring predictability in payment fluctuations."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Interest Rate Floor is the minimum interest rate that a borrower can expect to pay, ensuring predictability in loan agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;INTEREST RATE FLOOR is the minimum allowable interest rate on a loan, ensuring it does not drop below a certain level set by the lender. It is a financial term defining the minimum interest rate applied to a variable rate loan, impacting the cost of borrowing. This concept is crucial for adjustable-rate mortgages, as it establishes the lowest possible interest rate that can be charged, regardless of market changes. The Interest Rate Floor serves as a safeguard for borrowers, preventing rates from falling below a specified level and ultimately affecting overall loan costs.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9cd1c976503db6a0b9762d63aba656cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-04a4d78a32f7dce438d7f1d06834d5ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b42b071e6198f2a53344eeed3e0dca2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a2fe6bde08b88616e4d4932fe5f5e5c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d3310e925ce8d483d790951bc5b7e818&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c977b52194d7751d347d7a9c63060b4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a72060811d2de811b03ec94848dcad94&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aade21d11a3ffb0d61652426f005667f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eec7e8fc248456d980c970b75e0fbf41&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bde383f3ecde8888355124cd638e2e53&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-49f8738c76594c2ed9866d0e86818ca8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8760dceb193fd7c5f24d24209ee5e31&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f11f5ef3fffef89b593ca081411d1b13&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-783c4782c02cd021bcdf3bdbcc5f3466&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f2378deca7fb18f0144fa8707001424&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b6d8750d3b8676bc5099fb262793a7ff</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 8}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 102}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 460}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 814}]</data>
</node>
