  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Initial Change Date marks the designated time when the interest rate for the adjustable-rate mortgage first changes after the introductory period."&lt;SEP&gt;"Initial Change Date refers to the designated date in an adjustable-rate mortgage when the first interest rate adjustment takes place after the fixed period."</data>
