<node id="&quot;FANNIE MAE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Fannie Mae is a government-sponsored enterprise that facilitates mortgage lending and ensuring funds for home loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fannie Mae is a government-sponsored enterprise that provides liquidity and stability in the U.S. housing market, referenced in connection with loan waivers."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fannie Mae is a government-sponsored enterprise that provides liquidity in the mortgage market, referenced throughout the document regarding loan eligibility criteria."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fannie Mae, officially known as the Federal National Mortgage Association, is a government-sponsored enterprise that facilitates mortgage lending and provides stability in the U.S. housing market."&lt;SEP&gt;Fannie Mae, also known as the Federal National Mortgage Association, is a government-sponsored enterprise that plays a crucial role in the secondary mortgage market in the United States. They provide liquidity and stability by purchasing and securitizing mortgages, facilitating a steady flow of funds to lenders and supporting the housing market. Fannie Mae offers various loan products like HomeReady and Community Seconds, designed to expand accessibility to affordable housing for low to moderate-income borrowers. They also provide guidelines for mortgage qualification, including cash flow analysis for self-employed individuals. Overall, Fannie Mae's goal is to promote homeownership, increase accessibility to affordable housing, and enhance the flow of credit in the housing market.</data>
  <data key="d2">&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4849d91ba0d105495fd48b0a77c7c582&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-970955acc105f7936d7b684983cc4b58&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6de80860713bbcd40afb3b3b69d1945f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b8df18a65c5f6957ed36a347cf3c092&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db88d357021738de0f589ce49936e0e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b6d8750d3b8676bc5099fb262793a7ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-92bc9ce80658e51e7fed2cac493270e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-304d9428ac3f0546fe2c83618fb493e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ae0a9048bf3b0256e59664fde5a07a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-717a880d45de770514dc0429a3dc79f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ef8667615745a5fec93f77636582f41&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-42979d97c1c73c1b28eac498c9aee682&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1418f5447a956615e29938e7c6f0f71a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fad5bfdaee64eed200866a097fc789e6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7fafde8ee8a585c55ef0976f28ab4e55&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b75506a7175a05b7c26944fe1aa93eda&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e0b943be84e7ac4bbf9b166f805ef17c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f28aa24c80be0008755d728b5169b82&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7f44da442f8034719cd2f26599196416&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-61f35bbac411a48e356ef98016ff6b33&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-29e2bb5014fcbf1d6e95d3ac5b1702bc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4e49ff67fbaa2b705ebcac9802c0c64f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f11f5ef3fffef89b593ca081411d1b13&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f2378deca7fb18f0144fa8707001424&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-75126918f0820581a7405cbda1984bbe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-73179b73b8a774ced8d562931d514540&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fdba698a5ff7dd259797f2300b8f4759&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a72060811d2de811b03ec94848dcad94&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-42d99ce4642f1e6e8c39678043a90b1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd0c5c971a5a48bbded5da8b256a175c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fbc754fc30ff722a8fee09393323a03d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed5c9771e9d7f170cab82a4f6e0fe9c6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-49f8738c76594c2ed9866d0e86818ca8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a15606c9906902e66156e783e1ffe9b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f86e09d03714d2c94d238835f0083c0e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f639d102461efe890e188cbc182dba52&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-48a2b2c8a98a031e15a7c52e9d1d96c6</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 66}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 364}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 791}]</data>
</node>
