  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"HomeReady-HomeStyle is a mortgage product offered by Fannie Mae designed to cater to diverse housing needs, allowing borrowers to purchase or refinance homes along with renovation costs."</data>
