<node id="&quot;30-YEAR FIXED&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"30-Year Fixed is a common loan product with a thirty-year term and fixed interest rates, making home buying more accessible to borrowers."&lt;SEP&gt;"30-Year Fixed refers to a fixed-rate mortgage option with a duration of 30 years, offering borrowers predictable monthly payments."&lt;SEP&gt;"30-Year Fixed refers to a type of mortgage loan term offered under the HomeReady-HomeStyle program, lasting for 30 years at a fixed rate."&lt;SEP&gt;"30-Year Fixed refers to a mortgage product with a fixed interest rate and a repayment period of 30 years, providing stability for borrowers over the long term."&lt;SEP&gt;"30-Year Fixed refers to a mortgage loan product with a fixed interest rate over a term of 30 years, offering stability in monthly payments."&lt;SEP&gt;"30-Year Fixed refers to a mortgage loan product with a fixed interest rate over a term of 30 years, one of the options under Home Possible."&lt;SEP&gt;"30-Year Fixed refers to a mortgage product with a fixed interest rate over a term of 30 years, available under the HomeReady program."&lt;SEP&gt;"30-Year Fixed refers to a mortgage loan with a fixed interest rate over a term of 30 years, offering stability in payments."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e9c058471d343cfc8ca421fef3ff552d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ef8667615745a5fec93f77636582f41&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-22d3a76e6c1f50526ac6e8ed759d2710&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e4c4e62420861ecd803f90fd967a2c1c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-61f35bbac411a48e356ef98016ff6b33&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4e49ff67fbaa2b705ebcac9802c0c64f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dcbf025ce89296c2fe585617d648039b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-45f29d1e5fffab173b878a2ce71c0888</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 3}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 61}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 341}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 790}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;20-YEAR FIXED&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"20-Year Fixed denotes a mortgage loan with a fixed interest rate spanning 20 years, balancing monthly payments with total interest paid."&lt;SEP&gt;"20-Year Fixed is a loan term that offers fixed repayments over twenty years, giving borrowers an extended period to repay their loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"20-Year Fixed is a mortgage option that spreads out repayment over 20 years, balancing monthly payment amounts and total interest paid."&lt;SEP&gt;"20-Year Fixed refers to a mortgage loan term available under the HomeReady-HomeStyle program, with a duration of 20 years at a fixed rate."&lt;SEP&gt;"20-Year Fixed is a mortgage financing option that maintains a fixed interest rate for a set term of 20 years under the Home Possible program."&lt;SEP&gt;"20-Year Fixed is a mortgage option available with a fixed rate for a duration of 20 years as part of the HomeReady offerings."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e9c058471d343cfc8ca421fef3ff552d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-22d3a76e6c1f50526ac6e8ed759d2710&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e4c4e62420861ecd803f90fd967a2c1c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-61f35bbac411a48e356ef98016ff6b33&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4e49ff67fbaa2b705ebcac9802c0c64f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-45f29d1e5fffab173b878a2ce71c0888</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 3}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 58}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 327}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 786}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;15-YEAR FIXED&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"15-Year Fixed denotes a mortgage loan term offered under the HomeReady-HomeStyle program, fixed at a 15-year duration."&lt;SEP&gt;"15-Year Fixed is a loan offering where the interest rate remains fixed for a duration of fifteen years, allowing borrowers to plan their long-term financial commitments."&lt;SEP&gt;"15-Year Fixed is a type of mortgage with a fixed interest rate that must be repaid over a 15-year period, often with lower overall interest costs."&lt;SEP&gt;"15-Year Fixed refers to a mortgage product with a fixed interest rate and a repayment period of 15 years, which allows for quicker equity gain compared to longer-term loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"15-Year Fixed is a mortgage loan program with a fixed interest rate for 15 years, typically resulting in lower overall interest costs compared to longer terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"15-Year Fixed is a lending option that provides a fixed interest rate across a 15-year term, presented in the Home Possible offerings."&lt;SEP&gt;"15-Year Fixed is a mortgage product with a fixed interest rate scheduled over 15 years, included in the HomeReady available products."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e9c058471d343cfc8ca421fef3ff552d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ef8667615745a5fec93f77636582f41&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-22d3a76e6c1f50526ac6e8ed759d2710&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e4c4e62420861ecd803f90fd967a2c1c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-61f35bbac411a48e356ef98016ff6b33&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4e49ff67fbaa2b705ebcac9802c0c64f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-45f29d1e5fffab173b878a2ce71c0888</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 3}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 58}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 327}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 786}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;10-YEAR FIXED&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"10-Year Fixed is a fixed-rate mortgage option with a duration of 10 years, generally associated with lower interest rates but higher monthly payments."&lt;SEP&gt;"10-Year Fixed is a mortgage option under the HomeReady-HomeStyle program that lasts for a duration of 10 years with a fixed interest rate."&lt;SEP&gt;"10-Year Fixed refers to a loan product with a fixed interest rate to be repaid over a period of ten years, providing stability in payments."&lt;SEP&gt;"10-Year Fixed refers to a mortgage type that offers a fixed interest rate for a term of 10 years, under the HomeReady program."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4e49ff67fbaa2b705ebcac9802c0c64f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e4c4e62420861ecd803f90fd967a2c1c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-61f35bbac411a48e356ef98016ff6b33&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-45f29d1e5fffab173b878a2ce71c0888</data>
