<node id="&quot;MINIMUM CREDIT SCORE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MATHEMATICS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Minimum Credit Score denotes the least creditworthiness threshold established by lenders, essential for loan approval."&lt;SEP&gt;"Minimum Credit Score is a benchmark credit rating that borrowers must meet to qualify for specific loans, outlined in the eligibility criteria."&lt;SEP&gt;"Minimum Credit Score is the lowest acceptable credit score required for borrowers to qualify for the financing options within the HomeReady-HomeStyle program."&lt;SEP&gt;"Minimum Credit Score is the lowest credit score required by lenders for borrowers to qualify for a particular mortgage program."&lt;SEP&gt;"Minimum Credit Score refers to the lowest credit rating a borrower must have to qualify for loans, affecting their ability to access mortgage products."&lt;SEP&gt;"Minimum Credit Score indicates the lowest score acceptable for borrowers seeking VA loans, impacting approval chances and loan conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Minimum Credit Score sets the lowest acceptable credit score for borrowers to qualify for construction loans, impacting loan approval decisions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Minimum Credit Score is a mathematical threshold required to qualify for various Home Possible mortgage products, impacting eligibility."&lt;SEP&gt;"Minimum Credit Score is a threshold score that borrowers must meet to qualify for loans, in this case established at 580 for FHA loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"Minimum Credit Score is the lowest score required by lenders for loan eligibility, impacting a borrower's ability to secure financing."&lt;SEP&gt;"Minimum Credit Score outlines the lowest acceptable score for borrowers under the Advantage program to qualify for loans."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f1b06bf2c39f8da79b3399842638c80b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-92bc9ce80658e51e7fed2cac493270e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e78a99763ca81ea2755a9310a0e6cc85&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d8141599e488921f66fe766d03ed3bf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2315e50dabd40110b33a2bac5e271cc5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb07e682734c9565708be6820699bc17&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4e49ff67fbaa2b705ebcac9802c0c64f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dcbf025ce89296c2fe585617d648039b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-060d3305d5697520404f94c4fcd2cb85&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b36f295c3826a6aa7ec78dac1c05c756&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a582fe17fe66be19c89056580dbaccc</data>
