  <data key="d1">"NEW YORK is a U.S. state included in the pricing information, indicating its economic significance."&lt;SEP&gt;"NEW YORK is a state in the United States, included in the document with specific financial statistics."&lt;SEP&gt;"New York is a U.S. state famous for its metropolitan area, particularly New York City, which is a global cultural and financial hub."&lt;SEP&gt;"New York is a U.S. state mentioned as having specific requirements for loan calculations in the context of flood insurance and real estate financing."&lt;SEP&gt;"New York is identified as a state requiring additional title updates when processing loan draws."&lt;SEP&gt;"New York is a state in the Northeast U.S. that plays a significant role in VA mortgage guidelines and is a key part of the regional breakdown."&lt;SEP&gt;"New York is a state in the Northeast U.S., listed in the VA Regional State Breakdown and relevant for VA mortgage loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"New York is a state in the United States noted in the context of mortgage lending with specific references in underwriting guidelines."&lt;SEP&gt;"New York is a state in the United States noted for its diverse economic activities, cultural significance, and multiple counties that are frequently referenced in economic documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"New York is a state in the northeastern United States known for its cultural landmarks and economic power."&lt;SEP&gt;"New York is a state known for its cultural influences and metropolitan areas, particularly New York City."&lt;SEP&gt;"New York is a state mentioned multiple times in the statistics presented."&lt;SEP&gt;"New York is known for its bustling cities and diverse culture."&lt;SEP&gt;"New York is a state in the United States, mentioned in the context of mortgage insurance coverage calculations and requirements."&lt;SEP&gt;"New York is a state mentioned in the context of mortgage insurance coverage calculation requirements and loan eligibility restrictions."&lt;SEP&gt;"New York is a state mentioned in the context of eligibility for mortgage insurance coverage requirements."&lt;SEP&gt;"New York is a state where the Fannie Mae HomeReady product is available, subject to mortgage insurance coverage calculation requirements."</data>
