  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"VIRGINIA is a U.S. state included in the pricing tables, with various monetary amounts listed."&lt;SEP&gt;"VIRGINIA is included in the appraisal pricing matrix, indicating its importance in real estate transactions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Virginia is a U.S. state located in the southeastern region, known for its historical significance and diverse geography."&lt;SEP&gt;"Virginia is a U.S. state rich in history, known as the birthplace of several U.S. presidents and significant events in American history."&lt;SEP&gt;"Virginia is a historically significant state known for its pivotal role in American history and governance."&lt;SEP&gt;"Virginia is a state located in the southeastern region of the United States, known for its historical significance and diverse geography."&lt;SEP&gt;"Virginia is referenced as a state with specific title update requirements for loan draws."&lt;SEP&gt;"Virginia is referenced in the South for VA mortgage eligibility as part of the VA Regional State Breakdown."&lt;SEP&gt;"Virginia is a state in the southeastern United States known for its historical significance and diverse geography."&lt;SEP&gt;"Virginia is a state located on the southeastern coast of the United States. It is known for its historical significance, diverse economy, and as home to numerous counties and cities that contribute to its economic landscape."&lt;SEP&gt;"Virginia is known for its rich history, including many Civil War battlefields and landscapes."</data>
