<node id="&quot;HOMEREADY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"HomeReady is a mortgage loan program designed by Fannie Mae to help low-income borrowers achieve home ownership through affordable housing loans with flexible credit requirements."&lt;SEP&gt;"HomeReady is a mortgage loan program targeted at first-time homebuyers that includes features like required homeownership education and lower down payment options."&lt;SEP&gt;"HomeReady is a mortgage product offered by Fannie Mae that helps low-to-moderate income borrowers qualify for home financing by allowing for a wider range of income sources and lower down payment requirements."&lt;SEP&gt;"HomeReady is a specific affordable housing loan product that supports borrowers in achieving homeownership and is mentioned alongside various fixed-rate options."&lt;SEP&gt;"HomeReady is a mortgage program offered by Fannie Mae designed for low- to moderate-income borrowers, enabling them to purchase homes with lower down payments."&lt;SEP&gt;"HomeReady is a mortgage product offered by Fannie Mae designed to meet the diverse needs of buyers, particularly creditworthy low to moderate-income borrowers, with expanded eligibility in low-income communities."</data>
  <data key="d2">&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e0b943be84e7ac4bbf9b166f805ef17c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b8df18a65c5f6957ed36a347cf3c092&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6de80860713bbcd40afb3b3b69d1945f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e4c4e62420861ecd803f90fd967a2c1c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-61f35bbac411a48e356ef98016ff6b33&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db88d357021738de0f589ce49936e0e1</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 68}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 372}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;HOMESTYLE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"HomeStyle is a loan product associated with renovations that allows homeowners to finance improvements or modifications to their properties."&lt;SEP&gt;"HomeStyle is a mortgage product offered by Fannie Mae that allows borrowers to finance both the purchase of a home and the cost of renovations within the same loan."</data>
