<node id="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Borrower is an individual or entity that seeks a loan from a lender, requiring an examination of their creditworthiness and financial history."&lt;SEP&gt;"Borrower is a term used to describe an individual or entity that takes out a loan and is responsible for repayment according to the loan's terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Borrower is an individual or entity that applies for a loan to purchase property, whose requests and circumstances affect the loan outcomes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Borrower is an individual who has requested changes to various aspects of their mortgage application, indicating active engagement in the mortgage process."&lt;SEP&gt;The "BORROWER" is the individual or entity who receives a mortgage loan from various institutions such as Advantage Bank, Flagstar, or Freddie Mac. They are obligated to repay the loan according to the agreement terms, which may include eSigning documents, meeting specific financial criteria, and disclosing personal information. The borrower has the right to rescind the transaction under Regulation Z if needed and must provide accurate details during the loan application and closing process. They may also incur fees for defaults or overpayments and are responsible for repaying the borrowed amount along with any applicable fees.&lt;SEP&gt;"Borrower refers to an individual or entity seeking to obtain a loan, whose eligibility is evaluated based on credit and financial history."&lt;SEP&gt;"Borrower refers to an individual or entity that is applying for a loan and needs to provide income documentation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Borrower refers to an individual who is applying for a loan and must comply with various guidelines regarding financing and documentation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Borrower refers to individuals or entities who take out loans and are responsible for repayment under the loan agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Borrower refers to the individual or entity taking out a loan who is responsible for repaying it, as mentioned in various contexts related to refinancing and transactions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Borrower refers to the individual or entity that is taking out the loan and is responsible for repayment under the loan's terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower is an individual seeking a mortgage, whose income qualifications are based on various financial criteria, including employment status and historical income."&lt;SEP&gt;"Borrower is an individual or entity that takes out a loan from Flagstar, agreeing to terms including fees and payment schedules."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b722d926669aa7676c36ecbb75a4a233&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2fbf5161dc5c6670b7fd7548d822a73&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-283d5323d92a66b703dacfb0b3c98a37&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53dcf3f3e40f27441645f474e46347d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-930f40233ddc622409d80debbd41e55f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-662a2c10d200da7291e0212d33749544&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d2fd985d041d5eb6aeccbb1d21a81c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8760dceb193fd7c5f24d24209ee5e31&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db88d357021738de0f589ce49936e0e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c2f4d692a0955d46073163734c23b26&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b42b071e6198f2a53344eeed3e0dca2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7240c801a08e04a5a9db69a7879361cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e4c4e62420861ecd803f90fd967a2c1c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9a577e8766cf4f0e1ae599795cd9c6fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-150cc6b2e7ba7007f09ed79ae5042c88&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f08c1849f1a1e52584c06fc2286667f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1418f5447a956615e29938e7c6f0f71a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-82a675c08f3177636cb84734aead2aea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a6589af60d5cd7b7c6c55232071772b8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c0a48a482a40438f89f44e8758608310&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f18d8da3052c73dc1f9fa6e9aef1a14e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c8b4e28d440c820b5ce2e89c08cd1b75&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-652c3091f21b7e8483d1309884976c82&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ec9b17609d27a36004f6e85b0cb3ecf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de34030d71ef2c627010a089db20697c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d0459e9b5b3885ad40728e4e0af01123&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dcbf025ce89296c2fe585617d648039b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd698c420bb978f364630c455d2abf4a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71f642eb6cc44e3fc724fd1b5beeccd5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-30274d85a38f031223e249148db13d86&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2292650099ea1cdf5881f79ed28d3cfc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c977b52194d7751d347d7a9c63060b4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea9eec682fb4dbe92270f8b8c48a9354&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-42d99ce4642f1e6e8c39678043a90b1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f0bf252dda6ffda0104c759447cefbb5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca3069902295dcf5b2b505753d7623f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a403e885ce18327dd600e7521b66a2e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-25a82bf13c8c6a8ef98d1a15a5361ea9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fc9e5323cf1da974f74cdcad0aebf55d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8552c190e01cd6c887d540f68372a1a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ae2131097a3957a6