<node id="&quot;MAXIMUM CONFORMING LOAN LIMITS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Maximum Conforming Loan Limits delineate the highest amount a borrower can secure using a conforming loan, which varies by property type and location."&lt;SEP&gt;"Maximum Conforming Loan Limits refer to the highest loan amounts that can be secured on conforming loans, which impact the HomeReady program eligibility."</data>
