  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"HomeReady-HomeStyle High Balance 30-Year Fixed is a loan product that combines the features of a high-balance loan with a fixed rate over thirty years, catering to borrowers in high-cost areas."</data>
