<node id="&quot;LOAN ELIGIBILITY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REQUIREMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Loan Eligibility criteria determine the qualifications required for borrowers to qualify for different loan products, including income assessments and occupancy requirements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loan Eligibility outlines the standards borrowers and originators must meet to participate in Flagstar's construction loan products."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loan Eligibility refers to the criteria that borrowers must meet to qualify for various types of loans, impacting their financing options."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loan Eligibility refers to the criteria that a borrower must meet to qualify for a mortgage loan, including income, credit history, and property type."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-71f642eb6cc44e3fc724fd1b5beeccd5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e4c4e62420861ecd803f90fd967a2c1c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca3069902295dcf5b2b505753d7623f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-25dcfc163b5b00ffab734b755ea03592</data>
