<node id="&quot;APPRAISAL GUIDELINES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"GUIDELINE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Appraisal Guidelines are specific standards and procedures required during the appraisal process to ensure accurate property valuations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Appraisal Guidelines indicate the standards that must be met for property appraisals to comply with FHA requirements, ensuring properties meet minimum standards."&lt;SEP&gt;"Appraisal Guidelines refer to the standards and requirements for evaluating property values, essential for determining loan qualifications in real estate."&lt;SEP&gt;"Appraisal Guidelines set the standards for evaluating the value and condition of properties being considered for FHA financing."</data>
