</node>
<node id="&quot;LOAN FILE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Loan File encompasses all documentation and records related to a mortgage application, including the borrower's financial information and loan details."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loan File is the collection of documentation necessary for processing a mortgage application, assuring compliance with setting requirements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loan File refers to the collection of documentation and application information required for processing a loan application."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loan File refers to the compilation of documents and information pertaining to a specific mortgage application for processing and approval."</data>
