</node>
<node id="&quot;ELIGIBLE BORROWERS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"NORMAL_ENTITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Eligible Borrowers are defined as individuals who meet specific income and occupancy criteria to qualify for loans within the program."&lt;SEP&gt;"Eligible borrowers refer to individuals who can apply for a VA loan, primarily veterans, and their spouses."&lt;SEP&gt;"Eligible Borrowers are individuals who meet specific criteria set by programs or loans to qualify for financial assistance."&lt;SEP&gt;"Eligible Borrowers are defined criteria for individuals who can qualify for home financing under the Home Possible program."&lt;SEP&gt;"Eligible Borrowers refer to individuals who qualify for loans under specific criteria outlined in the guidelines."&lt;SEP&gt;"Eligible Borrowers encompass U.S. citizens, permanent resident aliens, and non-permanent resident aliens, identified as those qualified for Home Equity Lines of Credit (HELOC)."&lt;SEP&gt;"Eligible Borrowers include U.S. citizens, permanent resident aliens, and non-permanent resident aliens who qualify for a Home Equity Line of Credit (HELOC)."</data>
  <data key="d2">&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f1b06bf2c39f8da79b3399842638c80b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d24b1a560ceedfac130cd557ad5adc3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-22d3a76e6c1f50526ac6e8ed759d2710&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-354a12aa9905401272b6367dbd3c30cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-25dcfc163b5b00ffab734b755ea03592&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7de83587d951a7ec74fcb94d81a7df71</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 10}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 127}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 543}]</data>
</node>
