<node id="&quot;TEXAS REFINANCES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Texas Refinances are specific types of refinancing loans that must meet criteria defined by Texas law, particularly under Section 50(a)(6) of the Texas Constitution."&lt;SEP&gt;"Texas Refinances refer to the process and criteria for refinancing existing mortgages under Texas state laws and regulations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Texas Refinances refers to the specific evaluation process of refinance loans in Texas according to local laws and guidelines."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6f08c1849f1a1e52584c06fc2286667f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e01afc290e08ec0f3a536bcbc8c10f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d0459e9b5b3885ad40728e4e0af01123</data>
