<node id="&quot;COMMUNITY SECOND PROGRAMS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Community Second Programs are specific offerings aimed at providing second mortgage options to assist homeowners in financing their properties."&lt;SEP&gt;"Community Second Programs refer to financial programs providing assistance from local authorities or nonprofits to support homebuyers with their purchasing costs."&lt;SEP&gt;"Community Second Programs provide assistance to borrowers in the form of funds from local or municipal authorities to aid in home purchasing."</data>
