<node id="&quot;TEXAS HOMESTEAD 50(A)(6) REFINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Texas Homestead 50(a)(6) Refinance is a specific type of refinance loan in Texas that meets special criteria for borrowing against a homestead property."&lt;SEP&gt;"Texas Homestead 50(a)(6) Refinance refers to a specific refinance product in Texas that adheres to state constitutional and regulatory guidelines."&lt;SEP&gt;"Texas Homestead 50(a)(6) Refinance refers to a distinct process under Texas law that governs the refinancing of homestead properties."</data>
