<node id="&quot;FLOOD INSURANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Flood Insurance covers properties against flood risks, as specified in the related product guidelines."&lt;SEP&gt;"Flood Insurance is a policy required for any loan in a flood zone, ensuring that properties are protected against flood risks."&lt;SEP&gt;"Flood Insurance is a specialized insurance policy required for homes located in flood zones, protecting property owners from water damage during floods."&lt;SEP&gt;"Flood Insurance is a type of insurance required to be included in the borrower’s escrow account even if other escrows are waived."&lt;SEP&gt;"Flood Insurance is a policy required for loans in flood zones, ensuring protection against flood damage during and after construction."&lt;SEP&gt;"Flood Insurance is a specific insurance product that protects against flood damage to property, a consideration in the debt ratio for HELOCs."&lt;SEP&gt;"Flood Insurance is additional coverage that property owners can obtain to guard against flood damage, a factor in debt calculations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Flood Insurance refers to a type of insurance that covers property damage due to flooding, relevant to the requirements for obtaining a Home Equity Line of Credit."&lt;SEP&gt;"Flood Insurance requirements are indicated as part of the disclosures for HELOC applicants, emphasizing the importance of insurance in property transactions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Flood Insurance is a coverage necessary for properties located in flood hazard areas, ensuring protection against flood-related damage.'</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4a8254e91bb361353c2efd5fd41f17e0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9cd1c976503db6a0b9762d63aba656cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2292650099ea1cdf5881f79ed28d3cfc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0908ef3e42a9d0bcd40742960e19dbf2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e01afc290e08ec0f3a536bcbc8c10f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8df57131d49eba22a5ca15cafeb404cb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-354a12aa9905401272b6367dbd3c30cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eec7e8fc248456d980c970b75e0fbf41&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9a577e8766cf4f0e1ae599795cd9c6fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-45f29d1e5fffab173b878a2ce71c0888</data>
