</node>
<node id="&quot;LENDER PAID MORTGAGE INSURANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Lender Paid Mortgage Insurance (LPMI) is mortgage insurance that is paid by the lender rather than the borrower, allowing the borrower to avoid upfront costs."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lender Paid Mortgage Insurance is a type of insurance policy that protects lenders from losses due to borrower defaults, especially in high-risk mortgage scenarios."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lender Paid Mortgage Insurance is a type of mortgage insurance that may be required based on specific loan criteria."</data>
  <data key="d2">&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-45f29d1e5fffab173b878a2ce71c0888&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d0459e9b5b3885ad40728e4e0af01123</data>
