<node id="&quot;CLOSING DOCUMENTATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Closing Documentation encompasses legal paperwork required to finalize loan transactions, outlining terms and confirming obligations of all parties involved."&lt;SEP&gt;"Closing Documentation involves the paperwork and procedures necessary for the finalization of a real estate transaction, including various forms and agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Closing Documentation refers to the necessary paperwork and requirements that must be fulfilled and submitted at the closing of a loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"Closing Documentation refers to the required paperwork necessary to finalize a mortgage transaction, detailing terms and obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Closing Documentation refers to the paperwork required to finalize the mortgage process, whereby legal ownership of the property is transferred."&lt;SEP&gt;"Closing Documentation refers to the essential papers required to finalize a loan transaction, ensuring all legal and procedural steps are met."&lt;SEP&gt;"Closing Documentation refers to the necessary paperwork and agreements to finalize a loan transaction."&lt;SEP&gt;"Closing Documentation is the set of documents required to finalize a loan, which can be ordered via Flagstar's WBCD service."&lt;SEP&gt;"Closing Documentation refers to the collection of legal documents that finalize the sale of a property or the loan transaction processed by the lender."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5b42b071e6198f2a53344eeed3e0dca2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-593f9403b246f17722c284b9fc562c85&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd0c5c971a5a48bbded5da8b256a175c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-48a2b2c8a98a031e15a7c52e9d1d96c6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f11f5ef3fffef89b593ca081411d1b13&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-04a4d78a32f7dce438d7f1d06834d5ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f2378deca7fb18f0144fa8707001424&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-45f29d1e5fffab173b878a2ce71c0888&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b6d8750d3b8676bc5099fb262793a7ff</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 9}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 114}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 509}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;STANDARD TITLE COMMITMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Standard Title Commitment is a document assuring that a title company will issue a title insurance policy on a property, typically required in real estate transactions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Standard Title Commitment is a document outlining the conditions under which a title insurance company will issue a title insurance policy."&lt;SEP&gt;"Standard Title Commitment is a document that provides a summary of the title insurance coverage being offered on a property, ensuring clear ownership."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-076af9e929f806725a98e51a239feee5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-45f29d1e5fffab173b878a2ce71c0888&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b6d8750d3b8676bc5099fb262793a7ff</data>
