  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Multi-State Condo Rider is a legal document used in conjunction with loans for condominium properties, addressing specific terms for different states."&lt;SEP&gt;"Multi-State Condo Rider is an additional document that modifies the standard mortgage terms to accommodate the specifics of condominium properties across multiple states."&lt;SEP&gt;"Multi-state Condo Rider is a specific product variation that addresses the terms for condominium properties across various states in Freddie Mac/Fannie Mae lending."</data>
