<node id="&quot;JUMBO EXPRESS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"JUMBO EXPRESS is a loan product detailed in the document, highlighting its specific loan limits and eligibility requirements."&lt;SEP&gt;"JUMBO EXPRESS is a mortgage product streamlining the loan process for qualified borrowers, emphasizing quick approval and efficient handling."&lt;SEP&gt;"Jumbo Express is a loan product that exceeds conforming thresholds and is classified as ineligible for the Extended Lock with Float-Down options."&lt;SEP&gt;"Jumbo Express is a type of loan product excluded from eligibility for the float-down renegotiation policy."&lt;SEP&gt;"Jumbo Express is a mortgage product that offers financing options for high-value loans, though it is noted to have certain restrictions."</data>
