<node id="&quot;LOCK DESK&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Lock Desk is a department within Flagstar Bank that plays a critical role in managing loan locks and coding."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lock Desk is the division within Flagstar Bank that handles all inquiries and processes related to loan locking."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Lock Desk is a department at Flagstar Bank responsible for managing loan locks and providing assistance regarding loan products and interest rates."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Lock Desk is a service contact point for inquiries regarding extended lock options and adjustments in loan processing, highlighting its operational role in mortgage services."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lock Desk is a department within Flagstar that manages requests for extensions or relocks once limits are reached."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lock Desk is a team or department responsible for managing lock pricing and relocks for loans with expired commitments."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Lock Desk is a customer service department that provides assistance regarding the float-down renegotiation policy and can be contacted via telephone."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Lock Desk is a service involved in locking the rates for HELOCs, allowing borrowers to secure their credit terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Lock Desk is a department at Flagstar Bank that handles loan locking requests and inquiries related to rate locks."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Lock Desk is a department responsible for pricing loan products and facilitating changes in interest rates or property addresses related to loans."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-fff6b81ef8a66ecc49bb49ef81869a5f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f626d237ebaf21492fcd8cbd9a81536&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b722d926669aa7676c36ecbb75a4a233&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c6c6dd97681ba9caa6c83d8ddf9ec59&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e77f9a0c774af974e032ea5bf1841d2e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c8b4e28d440c820b5ce2e89c08cd1b75&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-354a12aa9905401272b6367dbd3c30cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-780584b6e27004b17c25020078807812&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af318020d8f16430d1a60515a789d41d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1afd5d25f6f318da0cbe2e55f0a46af0</data>
