<node id="&quot;BROKER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Broker is a financial professional who facilitates the loan application process between borrowers and lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"A Broker is an intermediary who facilitates the borrowing process between lenders and borrowers, ensuring compliance with program guidelines and managing relationships with DPA providers."&lt;SEP&gt;"The term Broker refers to the entity or individual that facilitates mortgage transactions, often representing the interests of either the borrower or lender in negotiating loan terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Broker refers to an entity or individual who arranges transactions between a buyer and a seller for a commission."&lt;SEP&gt;"Broker refers to a type of relationship that sellers can have with Flagstar, indicating a business arrangement for selling mortgage products."</data>
