<node id="&quot;ONE-CLOSE CONSTRUCTION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"One-Close Construction is a financial product that allows for a single close loan to cover both construction and permanent financing, streamlining the borrowing process."&lt;SEP&gt;"One-Close Construction is a loan product allowing for a single closing process for financing construction and is aimed at both primary residences and second homes."&lt;SEP&gt;"One-Close Construction is a type of loan program provided by Flagstar Bank that allows for interest-only payments during construction, with the possibility of financing certain soft costs."&lt;SEP&gt;"One-Close Construction is a unique loan program offered by Flagstar Bank that simplifies financing for construction projects by allowing interest-only payments during the construction phase."&lt;SEP&gt;"One-Close Construction is a type of loan that allows clients to finance both the purchase of a lot and the construction of a home in one closing process."&lt;SEP&gt;"One-Close Construction refers to a process whereby construction and permanent financing are combined in a single closing event to streamline the borrowing process."&lt;SEP&gt;"One-Close Construction refers to a type of loan program that includes various terms and conditions for financing construction projects, providing options for conforming loan amounts and durations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-71f642eb6cc44e3fc724fd1b5beeccd5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d97d5fa1f48d7b9516a9e1f71b87048e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-27bd5ad2c70145086339257520820a41&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1418f5447a956615e29938e7c6f0f71a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-060d3305d5697520404f94c4fcd2cb85&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0908ef3e42a9d0bcd40742960e19dbf2</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 9}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 117}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 523}]</data>
</node>
