<node id="&quot;LOAN PURCHASE AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Loan Purchase Agreement includes terms and conditions under which Flagstar purchases loans from approved sellers, ensuring adherence to established standards."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loan Purchase Agreement includes the terms under which Flagstar purchases loans and remains effective, outlining the obligations and representations of all parties involved."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loan Purchase Agreement is a contract between the Seller and Flagstar outlining the terms under which the Mortgage Loans are sold."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loan Purchase Agreement is the formal contract between Flagstar and the Seller detailing the terms under which mortgage loans are purchased."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Loan Purchase Agreement is a contract between Flagstar and a Seller that outlines the terms and conditions under which the Seller sells mortgage loans to Flagstar."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Loan Purchase Agreement is a formal contract signed between Flagstar and the Seller, outlining the terms under which the Seller will sell Mortgage Loans to Flagstar."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Loan Purchase Agreement outlines the terms and conditions under which Flagstar purchases mortgage loans and sets forth the obligations of the Seller."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Loan Purchase Agreement outlines the terms under which a mortgage loan is sold or transferred, including the responsibilities of all parties involved."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loan Purchase Agreement is the contractual framework under which Flagstar purchases loans from sellers, outlining terms and conditions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-71f642eb6cc44e3fc724fd1b5beeccd5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2fbf5161dc5c6670b7fd7548d822a73&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fc9e5323cf1da974f74cdcad0aebf55d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8552c190e01cd6c887d540f68372a1a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f214a47f3746b540cbee12f81aa5bc1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a40aeeabaca2a4a97b1dd8ad35ab142e</data>
