<node id="&quot;LTV RESTRICTIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"NORMAL_ENTITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"LTV Restrictions refer to limitations placed on the loan-to-value ratios that borrowers must adhere to when seeking certain types of mortgage loans."</data>
