<node id="&quot;OPTION 2 - THIRD PARTY EXPENSE RATIO&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"NORMAL_ENTITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Option 2 - Third Party Expense Ratio refers to an alternative method for calculating income for loan qualifications and its own specific guidelines."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-bb07e682734c9565708be6820699bc17</data>
