<node id="&quot;ADVANTAGE BANK STATEMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Advantage Bank Statements are guidelines or documents utilized for verifying income and financial statements for self-employed borrowers and others, included in mortgage applications."&lt;SEP&gt;"Advantage Bank Statements is a financial product designed for self-employed borrowers, offering various loan options including a 30-Year Fixed, a 40-Year Fixed, and ARMs with interest-only terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Advantage Bank Statements refer to guidelines or documents utilized for verifying income and financial statements for self-employed borrowers and others, included in mortgage applications."&lt;SEP&gt;"Advantage Bank Statements refer to specific bank statement guidelines for borrowers applying for loans, detailing requirements for income verification."&lt;SEP&gt;"Advantage Bank Statements refer to the product guidelines related to assessing asset documentation for mortgage applications."&lt;SEP&gt;"Advantage Bank Statements refer to the program used for qualifying income based on bank statements rather than traditional documentation, catering to self-employed borrowers."&lt;SEP&gt;"Advantage Bank Statements refers to a set of financial product guidelines outlining requirements for borrowers concerning income verification and other eligibility criteria."&lt;SEP&gt;"Advantage Bank Statements refers to bank statements specifically from Advantage Bank, involved in the process of verifying borrower financials for loan applications."&lt;SEP&gt;"Advantage Bank Statements is another specific type of loan product that cannot participate in the float-down renegotiation policy."&lt;SEP&gt;"Advantage Bank Statements refers to a specific type of lock extension related to bank statements with its own fee schedule."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f18d8da3052c73dc1f9fa6e9aef1a14e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-652c3091f21b7e8483d1309884976c82&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-780584b6e27004b17c25020078807812&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-930f40233ddc622409d80debbd41e55f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2315e50dabd40110b33a2bac5e271cc5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-357b3035e037e02a3c6636835c516347&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d2fd985d041d5eb6aeccbb1d21a81c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb4e4bbf1091286e7015a8784c37cbc2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af318020d8f16430d1a60515a789d41d</data>
