<node id="&quot;RATE/TERM REFINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"RATE/TERM REFINANCE describes a process of refinancing a mortgage which could involve changing the interest rate or term while using the Home Possible product."&lt;SEP&gt;"RATE/TERM REFINANCE is the process of refinancing a loan to change its interest rate or loan terms without cashing out equity."&lt;SEP&gt;"Rate/Term Refinance is a type of refinancing where the borrower adjusts the loan terms, often to obtain better interest rates without taking cash out."&lt;SEP&gt;"Rate/Term Refinance is a type of refinancing that replaces an existing mortgage with a new one with better terms and rates, important for homeowners seeking improved loan conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Rate/Term Refinance is a specific type of refinancing to change the interest rate or term of a mortgage without taking out additional cash."&lt;SEP&gt;"Rate/Term Refinance is a financial event allowing homeowners to refinance their existing mortgage under favorable terms and conditions as part of the Home Possible product."&lt;SEP&gt;"Rate/Term Refinance refers to refinancing options that allow borrowers to change the terms of their mortgage without taking cash out."&lt;SEP&gt;"Rate/Term Refinance describes the refinancing process of existing loans under similar or modified rate structures, without withdrawing equity from the property."&lt;SEP&gt;"Rate/Term Refinance is a financial event where a borrower refinances an existing loan to obtain better rates or terms without changing the loan amount significantly."&lt;SEP&gt;"Rate/Term Refinance refers to a mortgage refinance option where the interest rate or terms are adjusted, relevant under the HomeReady program."&lt;SEP&gt;"Rate/Term Refinance is a type of refinancing that alters the interest rate or loan term without taking additional cash out from the property."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-92bc9ce80658e51e7fed2cac493270e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e07a33c29f8d16a498a486fa35e048c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e0b943be84e7ac4bbf9b166f805ef17c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d8141599e488921f66fe766d03ed3bf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-357b3035e037e02a3c6636835c516347&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-61f35bbac411a48e356ef98016ff6b33&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ab83fcb34a1963a254e2dbce808acb9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d0459e9b5b3885ad40728e4e0af01123&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fad5bfdaee64eed200866a097fc789e6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a582fe17fe66be19c89056580dbaccc</data>
