  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Self-Employed Borrowers are individuals who operate their own businesses, often facing unique financial documentation challenges for loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"Self-employed Borrowers are individuals who operate their own businesses and must adhere to specific guidelines for income verification."&lt;SEP&gt;"Self-employed borrowers are individuals who operate their own businesses and must adhere to specific guidelines for income verification."&lt;SEP&gt;"Self-Employed Borrowers are individuals who own their own business and must provide specific documentation to qualify for loans."</data>
