</node>
<node id="&quot;80% LTV&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"NORMAL_ENTITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"80% LTV indicates a loan-to-value ratio that allows borrowers to finance a maximum of 80% of their property's appraised value."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-357b3035e037e02a3c6636835c516347</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 3}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 59}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 330}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 787}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;10-YEAR IO&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"10-Year IO refers to a specific interest-only loan term allowing borrowers to pay only interest for the first ten years."&lt;SEP&gt;"10-Year IO refers to an interest-only mortgage where no principal is paid for the first 10 years, affecting long-term costs."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-dcbf025ce89296c2fe585617d648039b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-357b3035e037e02a3c6636835c516347</data>
