  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"DACA borrowers are individuals under the Deferred Action for Childhood Arrivals program who are noted as ineligible for some borrowing guidelines."&lt;SEP&gt;"DACA borrowers refer to individuals who are part of the Deferred Action for Childhood Arrivals program but are not eligible for the loans according to the stated guidelines."</data>
