</node>
<node id="&quot;PAYMENT SHOCK&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Payment Shock refers to the increase in housing payment that first-time homebuyers may experience when moving into new housing, as compared to their previous rental cost."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2315e50dabd40110b33a2bac5e271cc5</data>
