<node id="&quot;RESIDUAL INCOME WORKSHEET&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Residual Income Worksheet is a document used to determine a borrower's remaining income after expenses, critical for loan applicants with a higher DTI ratio."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Residual Income Worksheet is a financial assessment tool used to determine the disposable income left over for a borrower after all necessary expenses have been paid."</data>
