<node id="&quot;30 YEAR FIXED&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"30 Year Fixed is a mortgage product where the interest rate remains constant over 30 years, allowing for predictable payment amounts."&lt;SEP&gt;"30 Year Fixed is a type of mortgage loan with a fixed interest rate over a period of 30 years, providing predictability in payments for borrowers."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2315e50dabd40110b33a2bac5e271cc5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f28aa24c80be0008755d728b5169b82</data>
