<node id="&quot;7/6 ARM&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"7/6 ARM is a mortgage product where the interest rate is fixed for the first seven years and then adjusts every six months."&lt;SEP&gt;"7/6 ARM is another adjustable-rate mortgage product with a fixed rate for 7 years, after which it adjusts annually, part of the Home Possible selections."&lt;SEP&gt;"7/6 ARM refers to an adjustable-rate mortgage with specific interest rate adjustments and terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"7/6 ARM, or Adjustable Rate Mortgage, is a loan product where the interest rate is fixed for the first seven years and then adjusted every six months thereafter."&lt;SEP&gt;"7/6 ARM is an adjustable-rate mortgage where the interest rate is fixed for the first 7 years, followed by adjustments every 6 months."&lt;SEP&gt;"7/6 ARM is an adjustable-rate mortgage with a fixed rate for the first seven years, after which the rate can adjust every six months."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7c977b52194d7751d347d7a9c63060b4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-22d3a76e6c1f50526ac6e8ed759d2710&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a403e885ce18327dd600e7521b66a2e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2315e50dabd40110b33a2bac5e271cc5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f11f5ef3fffef89b593ca081411d1b13&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dcbf025ce89296c2fe585617d648039b</data>
