</node>
<node id="&quot;FIRST TIME HOME BUYERS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"First Time Home Buyers are individuals or families who are purchasing a home for the first time, subject to specific eligibility and lending criteria."&lt;SEP&gt;"First Time Home Buyers refers to individuals purchasing a home for the first time, who are noted as not allowed in the Advantage program."</data>
