  <data key="d1">"Appraisal Requirements are a set of guidelines that dictate how appraisal on properties should be conducted, crucial in the loan acquisition process."&lt;SEP&gt;"Appraisal Requirements refer to the standards and guidelines necessary for valuating properties during the loan application process."</data>
