<node id="&quot;CO-OPS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Co-ops refer to cooperative housing arrangements where residents own shares in a corporation that owns the building, subject to specific financing criteria."&lt;SEP&gt;"Co-ops, or cooperative housing, are mentioned as eligible property types that must meet FNMA requirements for financing."&lt;SEP&gt;"Co-ops, or cooperative housing, involve ownership shares in a corporation that manages the property, qualifying under specific guidelines in NYC."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f0bf252dda6ffda0104c759447cefbb5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-25dcfc163b5b00ffab734b755ea03592&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f28aa24c80be0008755d728b5169b82</data>
