  <data key="d1">"Environmental Hazards refer to potential risks affecting health and safety related to property locations, which can impact eligibility for loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"Environmental hazards refer to potential risks like toxic contamination that could affect property and are addressed through title insurance endorsements."</data>
