<node id="&quot;H3 VISA&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"H3 Visa is a temporary visa for individuals who are invited to receive training in the U.S. and is mentioned as ineligible for borrowing."</data>
