  <data key="d1">"The text references the broader context of regulations and guidelines in the financial and mortgage industry, indicating a systemic aspect rather than a specific geographic location."&lt;SEP&gt;"Washington is a U.S. state located in the Pacific Northwest, known for its forests and tech industry."&lt;SEP&gt;"Washington is known for its natural beauty and strong tech industry."&lt;SEP&gt;"Washington is known for its natural beauty, tech industry, and iconic landmarks like Mount Rainier."&lt;SEP&gt;"Washington is mentioned as part of the West in the VA Regional State Breakdown concerning loan qualifications."&lt;SEP&gt;"Washington is a state in the Pacific Northwest of the United States, known for its natural beauty and technology industry."&lt;SEP&gt;"Washington is known for its natural beauty and cultural landmarks."&lt;SEP&gt;"WASHINGTON is a U.S. state featured in the pricing matrix with associated financial values."&lt;SEP&gt;"WASHINGTON is featured with specific fees in the appraisal pricing, highlighting its relevance in the real estate industry."</data>
