  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Donor refers to an individual providing gift funds to the borrower, with conditions set to ensure eligibility for financing."&lt;SEP&gt;"Donor refers to individuals who provide gift funds to the borrower and must be related to the borrower under the guidelines."</data>
