<node id="&quot;FAMILY MEMBER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Family Member can refer to individuals who might assist in income verification for borrowers applying for mortgages."&lt;SEP&gt;"Family Member denotes relatives who are permitted to provide gift funds to a borrower for down payments or closing costs."&lt;SEP&gt;"Family Member refers to individuals related to the Borrower, encompassing spouses, children, and others connected by blood or legal ties, important in transaction disclosures."&lt;SEP&gt;"Family Member is defined in the context of loans as someone related to the Borrower, impacting terms in family transactions and eligibility for certain loan arrangements."</data>
