<node id="&quot;HUD-1&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"HUD-1 is a settlement statement that outlines the fees and costs associated with real estate transactions."&lt;SEP&gt;"HUD-1 refers to a document that outlines the costs associated with the purchase of a property, including details related to gift funds and equity."&lt;SEP&gt;"HUD-1 is a standard form used in real estate transactions to itemize services and fees charged to the Buyer and Seller, important during the closing process."&lt;SEP&gt;"HUD-1 refers to a standardized document that outlines all closing costs and disclosures associated with a property transaction."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5b42b071e6198f2a53344eeed3e0dca2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca3069902295dcf5b2b505753d7623f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c977b52194d7751d347d7a9c63060b4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-930f40233ddc622409d80debbd41e55f</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 40}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 276}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EQUITY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Equity in the context of loans refers to the value of an owner's interest in their property after all debts against that property are subtracted."&lt;SEP&gt;"Equity is the value of an owner's interest in a property, which may be gifted from a seller under specified conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Equity represents the difference between the market value of a property and the amount owed on any liens against it, indicating the ownership interest in the property."&lt;SEP&gt;"Equity refers to the difference between the market value of a property and the amount owed on the mortgage, representing the owner's stake in the property."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-fd698c420bb978f364630c455d2abf4a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b42b071e6198f2a53344eeed3e0dca2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-930f40233ddc622409d80debbd41e55f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d3f42cc9266dff615db2fd5cb59e3109</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 40}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 274}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CASH RESERVES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FINANCIAL CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Cash Reserves refer to the liquid assets that borrowers must have available to secure a mortgage."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-930f40233ddc622409d80debbd41e55f</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 32}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 257}]</data>
