<node id="&quot;VERIFICATION OF MORTGAGE (VOM)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Verification of Mortgage (VOM) is a document used to confirm a borrower's loan status and mortgage payments, necessary for evaluating refinance applications."&lt;SEP&gt;"Verification of Mortgage (VOM) is a document used to verify existing loan details and statuses."&lt;SEP&gt;"Verification of Mortgage (VOM) is a process through which lenders confirm a borrower's mortgage payment history."&lt;SEP&gt;"Verification of Mortgage is a document required to confirm a borrower's mortgage payment history as part of the verification process for loan applications."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5b42b071e6198f2a53344eeed3e0dca2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c977b52194d7751d347d7a9c63060b4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-150cc6b2e7ba7007f09ed79ae5042c88&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-930f40233ddc622409d80debbd41e55f</data>
