  <data key="d1">"A Business Account is a type of bank account used by businesses to manage their finances, which can be tapped for mortgage-related expenses."&lt;SEP&gt;"Business Account refers to financial accounts held by a business that can be leveraged for personal financing under certain conditions."</data>
