<node id="&quot;TITLE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The title refers to the legal right of ownership over a property in real estate, which is protected by title insurance."&lt;SEP&gt;"Title refers to legal ownership of a property, crucial in determining rights and responsibilities in transactions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Title refers to the legal right of ownership of property, often verified in real estate transactions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Title refers to the legal right of ownership over a property, crucial in determining the position of any liens impacting the property during loan proceedings."&lt;SEP&gt;"Title refers to the legal right of ownership for a property, which must be verified through documentation in the context of transactions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Title refers to the legal right of ownership of a property, which is a critical aspect in loan transactions and refinancing."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5c2f4d692a0955d46073163734c23b26&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b42b071e6198f2a53344eeed3e0dca2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c977b52194d7751d347d7a9c63060b4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9351b24bca225d97ff2d45b46310a878&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb4e4bbf1091286e7015a8784c37cbc2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9c57c1331aa9873de4467468c1b07505</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 15}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 162}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 628}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;WRITTEN EXPLANATIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Written Explanations are necessary documents provided by borrowers to clarify any significant derogatory events in their financial history, such as bankruptcies or judgments."&lt;SEP&gt;"Written Explanations are required from borrowers for significant derogatory events such as housing events and bankruptcies."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-cb4e4bbf1091286e7015a8784c37cbc2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7240c801a08e04a5a9db69a7879361cf</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 90}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 447}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DELINQUENT CREDIT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Delinquent Credit refers to any overdue debt that affects a borrower's loan eligibility and must be addressed prior to loan closure."&lt;SEP&gt;"Delinquent Credit refers to unpaid past-due debts that can affect a borrower's credit history and eligibility for loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"Delinquent credit refers to any unpaid debts that are overdue, which can significantly affect individuals' credit ratings and ability to secure loans."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-cb4e4bbf1091286e7015a8784c37cbc2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7240c801a08e04a5a9db69a7879361cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-150cc6b2e7ba7007f09ed79ae5042c88</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 19}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 191}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 694}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LOAN MODIFICATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Loan Modification involves altering the terms of an existing loan, often due to the borrower's financial difficulties."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loan Modification involves changing the terms of an existing mortgage agreement to prevent foreclosure, classified as a Housing Event."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loan Modification is a change made to the terms of an existing loan, which may include adjustments to the interest rate, loan duration, or payment schedule."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2f2378deca7fb18f0144fa8707001424&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb4e4bbf1091286e7015a8784c37cbc2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-150cc6b2e7ba7007f09ed79ae5042c88</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 19}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 193}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 702}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BANK STATEMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Bank Statements are financial documents detailing all transactions in an account, used for income verification when applying for loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"Bank Statements are financial documents that reflect a borrower's banking transactions and are used to verify income for mortgage application purposes."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-652c3091f21b7e8483d1309884976c82&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb4e4bbf1091286e7015a8784c37cbc2</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 32}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 253}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TITLE TRANSFER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Title Transfer is the process of transferring ownership rights of a property from one party to another, typically required in financial transactions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Title Transfer refers to the legal process of transferring ownership of property, often required in conjunction with financial agreements like divorces."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-cb4e4bbf1091286e7015a8784c37cbc2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7240c801a08e04a5a9db69a7879361cf</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 19}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 191}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 694}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DIVORCE DECREE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Divorce Decree is a legal document that finalizes a divorce and outlines the terms agreed upon by both parties, including financial responsibilities."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-cb4e4bbf1091286e7015a8784c37cbc2</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 19}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 191}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 693}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SEPARATION AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Separation Agreement is a contract between spouses outlining the terms of their separation, including financial obligations like debts and assets."&lt;SEP&gt;"A Separation Agreement is a legal document outlining the terms and conditions of a couple's separation, often related to financial and custody matters."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-cb4e4bbf1091286e7015a8784c37cbc2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7240c801a08e04a5a9db69a7879361cf</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 19}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 191}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 693}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DELINQUENT TAXES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Delinquent Taxes refer to overdue tax obligations that can impact a borrower's credit profile and loan approval process."&lt;SEP&gt;"Delinquent Taxes refer to property taxes that remain unpaid past their due date, which can lead to liens and affect property transactions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Delinquent Taxes refer to unpaid property taxes that can affect mortgage lending and title insurance during loan processes."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-cb4e4bbf1091286e7015a8784c37cbc2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7240c801a08e04a5a9db69a7879361cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-150cc6b2e7ba7007f09ed79ae5042c88</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 19}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 191}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 695}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;HOMEOWNERS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Homeowners are individuals who own a residential property and may be involved in refinancing or facing housing events impacting their property ownership."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-cb4e4bbf1091286e7015a8784c37cbc2</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 15}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 162}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 630}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;HOA&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"HOA, or Homeowners Association, is an organization in a community that creates and enforces rules for the properties within its jurisdiction, affecting homeowners' responsibilities."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-cb4e4bbf1091286e7015a8784c37cbc2</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 15}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 162}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 628}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PROPERTY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Property refers generally to the subject of transactions discussed in terms of buying, selling, and refinancing."&lt;SEP&gt;"Property refers to the real estate owned by an individual, often discussed in terms of mortgage applications, refinancing, and housing events."&lt;SEP&gt;"Property refers to the physical land or structure that is subject to mortgage and title insurance, which may have defects or encumbrances."&lt;SEP&gt;"Property refers to land and any structures on it, which can be residential or commercial and is subject to ownership, leasing, or use."&lt;SEP&gt;"Property refers to the real estate or asset being transferred in the closing process, which is subject to various conditions and agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Property refers to the real estate asset being financed by the mortgage loan, which serves as collateral for the lender."&lt;SEP&gt;"Property refers to the real estate that is secured through a mortgage loan, which is subject to legal and regulatory requirements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Property refers to real estate that is subject to appraisal and mortgage considerations, specifically in the context of borrowing."&lt;SEP&gt;"Property refers to the real estate being financed or rented, which is subject to financial transactions, guidelines, and evaluations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5c2f4d692a0955d46073163734c23b26&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2292650099ea1cdf5881f79ed28d3cfc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-283d5323d92a66b703dacfb0b3c98a37&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8552c190e01cd6c887d540f68372a1a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9351b24bca225d97ff2d45b46310a878&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb4e4bbf1091286e7015a8784c37cbc2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-82a675c08f3177636cb84734aead2aea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9c57c1331aa9873de4467468c1b07505&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a6589af60d5cd7b7c6c55232071772b8</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 15}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 162}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 628}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LENDERS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Lenders are financial entities or individuals that provide loans to borrowers, expecting repayment with interest according to the terms agreed upon."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-cb4e4bbf1091286e7015a8784c37cbc2</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 12}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 152}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 616}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RENTAL PAYMENT HISTORY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Rental Payment History is a record of a tenant's rental payments, which is crucial for assessing a borrower's creditworthiness during loan applications."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-cb4e4bbf1091286e7015a8784c37cbc2</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 12}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 152}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 618}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;JUDGMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Judgments are court decisions that may affect a borrower's credit and must be resolved before closing a loan, particularly if they impact title."&lt;SEP&gt;"Judgments refer to court decisions against an individual that can affect property ownership and title insurance claims."&lt;SEP&gt;"Judgments are court-ordered decisions regarding debt that impact a borrower's credit standing and loan eligibility."&lt;SEP&gt;"Judgments are legal decisions made by a court that confirm a debtor owes a specific amount to a creditor, affecting the debtor's financial standing."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9351b24bca225d97ff2d45b46310a878&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb4e4bbf1091286e7015a8784c37cbc2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7240c801a08e04a5a9db69a7879361cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-150cc6b2e7ba7007f09ed79ae5042c88</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 19}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 191}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 691}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LIENS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Liens are legal claims against a property until a debt owed by the property owner is satisfied, essential to consider during the loan process."&lt;SEP&gt;"Liens are legal claims or rights against a property that must be resolved before a title insurance policy can be effectively issued."&lt;SEP&gt;"Liens are legal claims against property to secure payment of a debt, which must be settled before selling or refinancing the property."&lt;SEP&gt;"Liens are legal rights or claims against assets that secure the payment of a debt, affecting the borrower's title and loan approval."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9351b24bca225d97ff2d45b46310a878&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb4e4bbf1091286e7015a8784c37cbc2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7240c801a08e04a5a9db69a7879361cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-150cc6b2e7ba7007f09ed79ae5042c88</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 19}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 191}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 692}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COLLECTIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Collections refer to debts that have been passed on to collection agencies due to nonpayment, impacting borrower evaluations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Collections refer to overdue debts that have been handed over to a collection agency, impacting a borrower's financial evaluations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Collections refer to the efforts undertaken by creditors or collection agencies to recover outstanding debts from borrowers."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-cb4e4bbf1091286e7015a8784c37cbc2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7240c801a08e04a5a9db69a7879361cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-150cc6b2e7ba7007f09ed79ae5042c88</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 19}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 191}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 691}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BANKRUPTCY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Bankruptcy is a legal process that allows individuals to eliminate or repay their debts, requiring specific seasoning periods for borrowers in relation to loan applications."&lt;SEP&gt;"Bankruptcy is a legal process that individuals or businesses undergo when they are unable to repay their outstanding debts."&lt;SEP&gt;"Bankruptcy is a legal process that provides relief to individuals who cannot repay their debts, influencing their eligibility for loans."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-cb4e4bbf1091286e7015a8784c37cbc2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7240c801a08e04a5a9db69a7879361cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-150cc6b2e7ba7007f09ed79ae5042c88</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 90}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 447}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DELINQUENT CREDIT BELONGING TO EX-SPOUSE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Delinquent Credit Belonging to Ex-Spouse refers to debts that are attributable to an ex-spouse, which may be excluded from credit evaluations under certain conditions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-cb4e4bbf1091286e7015a8784c37cbc2</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 19}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 191}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 693}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DEPARTURE RESIDENCE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"NORMAL_ENTITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Departure Residence refers to the previous home that a borrower has vacated, which is relevant to mortgage applications and refinancing."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-cb4e4bbf1091286e7015a8784c37cbc2</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RENT-FREE SITUATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Rent-Free Situation describes a living arrangement where an individual does not pay rent, which may impact their eligibility for borrowing."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-cb4e4bbf1091286e7015a8784c37cbc2</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 15}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 162}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 628}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INSTITUTIONAL VERIFICATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Institutional Verification denotes the process of formally confirming a borrower's financial history through documents such as VOM and VOR."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-cb4e4bbf1091286e7015a8784c37cbc2</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 12}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 152}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 618}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CANCELED CHECKS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Canceled Checks are checks that have been processed and marked by the bank, used as proof of payment for various obligations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-cb4e4bbf1091286e7015a8784c37cbc2</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 32}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 253}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BANK RECORDS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Bank Records are documents that detail the transactions and balances of an individual's or organization's bank account."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-cb4e4bbf1091286e7015a8784c37cbc2</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 32}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 253}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MECHANICS LIENS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Mechanics Liens are claims made by contractors or suppliers for unpaid work performed on a property, impacting its title and sale."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mechanics Liens are legal claims against a property by a contractor or supplier who has not been paid for work or materials, affecting the property's title."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-cb4e4bbf1091286e7015a8784c37cbc2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7240c801a08e04a5a9db69a7879361cf</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 19}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 191}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 695}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SINGLE HOUSING EVENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Single Housing Event refers to a classification of housing-related occurrences that are recorded as one significant event for the purpose of credit evaluation."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-cb4e4bbf1091286e7015a8784c37cbc2</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 19}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 193}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 702}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;120+ DAYS DELINQUENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"120+ Days Delinquent indicates a mortgage or loan payment that has not been made for over 120 days, classified as a negative financial event."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-cb4e4bbf1091286e7015a8784c37cbc2</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 19}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 193}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 699}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FORBEARANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Forbearance is a temporary postponement of mortgage payments granted to borrowers facing financial difficulties, often highlighted during housing events."&lt;SEP&gt;"Forbearance refers to a temporary postponement of mortgage payments that the Borrower may request in times of financial difficulty."&lt;SEP&gt;"Forbearance is a temporary postponement of mortgage payments, utilized as an alternative to foreclosure, part of managing a Housing Event."&lt;SEP&gt;"Forbearance refers to a temporary postponement or reduction of mortgage payments, which affects how borrowers are assessed for refinancing."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5c2f4d692a0955d46073163734c23b26&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2fbf5161dc5c6670b7fd7548d822a73&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb4e4bbf1091286e7015a8784c37cbc2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-150cc6b2e7ba7007f09ed79ae5042c88</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 19}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 193}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 699}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LOAN APPLICATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Loan Application is the formal request made by a borrower to a lender for a loan, detailing their financial situation and property information."&lt;SEP&gt;"A loan application is a formal request submitted by a borrower to a lender, detailing financial information and credit history in order to secure a mortgage."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loan Application is the formal process in which a borrower submits a request for a loan, providing necessary documentation to back their eligibility."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loan Application is the formal request submitted by the borrower to initiate the process for obtaining a mortgage loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loan Application is a formal request submitted by a borrower to obtain a loan, requiring the submission of financial and personal documentation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loan Application is the formal process initiated by a Borrower to request financing, containing personal and financial information necessary for evaluation."&lt;SEP&gt;"The loan application is a formal request made by borrowers seeking to obtain financing or credit, starting from its application date."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-fe4b9e8302b8de2d8d692106e4e284ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd698c420bb978f364630c455d2abf4a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b42b071e6198f2a53344eeed3e0dca2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb4e4bbf1091286e7015a8784c37cbc2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-150cc6b2e7ba7007f09ed79ae5042c88&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1418f5447a956615e29938e7c6f0f71a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7240c801a08e04a5a9db69a7879361cf</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 33}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 259}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FINANCIAL OBLIGATIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Financial Obligations are the commitments to repay borrowings or fulfill payment agreements that impact the borrower's creditworthiness."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-cb4e4bbf1091286e7015a8784c37cbc2</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 19}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 193}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 702}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PROPERTY RESOLUTION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Property Resolution refers to the completion of legal or financial obligations related to property ownership, significant during loan applications."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-cb4e4bbf1091286e7015a8784c37cbc2</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 90}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 447}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;THREE CONSECUTIVE TIMELY PAYMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Three Consecutive Timely Payments are the required number of punctual payments a borrower must have made in order to qualify for certain refinancing options."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-cb4e4bbf1091286e7015a8784c37cbc2</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 90}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 447}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SIX CONSECUTIVE TIMELY PAYMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Six Consecutive Timely Payments refer to the number of punctual payments needed for borrowers applying for cash-out refinancing, ensuring financial credibility."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-cb4e4bbf1091286e7015a8784c37cbc2</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BUSINESS NARRATIVE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Business Narrative is a required form that self-employed borrowers must provide, detailing the business size, scope, and operating profile essential for the loan application process."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f18d8da3052c73dc1f9fa6e9aef1a14e</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 19}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 194}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 703}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PPP FUNDS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"PPP funds refer to funds from the Paycheck Protection Program, which are considered ineligible for analysis when determining business income."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f18d8da3052c73dc1f9fa6e9aef1a14e</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 29}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 240}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TAX PROFESSIONAL&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Tax Professional is an expert such as a CPA or Enrolled Agent responsible for certifying business expenses and ownership percentages for borrowers."&lt;SEP&gt;"A Tax Professional provides necessary documentation and validation of a business's existence and ownership, crucial for loan applications."</data>
