<node id="&quot;OPTION 1&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"NORMAL_ENTITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Option 1 outlines a specific set of criteria for tradelines required for loan qualification, focused on active accounts with 12-month histories."&lt;SEP&gt;"Option 1 refers to the Fixed Expense Ratio calculation methodology which uses a standard 50% expense factor for evaluating borrowers."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5d2fd985d041d5eb6aeccbb1d21a81c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cfcbc01d9662fc8a4930eb1a9dd46384</data>
