<node id="&quot;OPTION 2&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"NORMAL_ENTITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Option 2 describes an alternative combination of tradelines required for loan qualification, allowing for specific variations in credit history requirements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Option 2 involves the Third Party Expense Ratio, which requires a reasonable expense factor to be applied based on the business type."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5d2fd985d041d5eb6aeccbb1d21a81c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cfcbc01d9662fc8a4930eb1a9dd46384</data>
