  <data key="d1">"Income-Driven Payment Plan refers to a repayment option for student loans based on income levels, important for qualifying borrowers."&lt;SEP&gt;"Income-driven Payment Plan refers to a repayment plan for student loans that adjusts the borrower's monthly payment based on their income level."</data>
