</node>
<node id="&quot;CUMULATIVE CHARGE OFF BALANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Cumulative Charge Off Balance represents the total amount of loans deemed uncollectible and removed from financial records, impacting borrower's credit status."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cumulative Charge Off Balance tracks the total of loans that have been written off as losses, affecting mortgage qualification decisions."</data>
