</node>
<node id="&quot;INCOME DOCUMENTATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Income Documentation involves all necessary paperwork that borrowers must provide to validate their income for mortgage applications."&lt;SEP&gt;"Income Documentation refers to the necessary verification of a borrower’s income sources as stipulated by underwriting guidelines to qualify for a loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"Income Documentation refers to the collection of financial records necessary to verify a borrower's income for loan qualification."&lt;SEP&gt;"Income documentation refers to the necessary records that verify a borrower's earnings over a specific period, essential for loan applications."</data>
