  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Fannie Mae/Freddie Mac Uniform Security Instrument is a type of legal document used in fixed-rate loans, designed to secure repayments."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Fannie Mae/Freddie Mac Uniform Security Instrument is a standardized document used in mortgage transactions to secure the loan with the property."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Fannie Mae/Freddie Mac Uniform Security Instrument is a standardized document used in the mortgage industry to secure loans on residential properties."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Fannie Mae/Freddie Mac Uniform Security Instrument is a standard legal document used in mortgage transactions."</data>
