<node id="&quot;GIFT OF EQUITY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FINANCIAL CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Gift of Equity allows a seller to give a portion of their home's equity as a gift to the buyer, impacting financing options."&lt;SEP&gt;"Gift of Equity describes a financial arrangement in family transactions where the transfer of property value is treated as a gift, requiring proper documentation for loan processing."&lt;SEP&gt;"Gift of Equity is a financial concept where a family member provides a gift related to the equity of a property involved in a transaction."</data>
