</node>
<node id="&quot;INTEREST RATE ADJUSTMENT CAPS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Interest Rate Adjustment Caps are limitations imposed on how much the interest rate on an adjustable-rate mortgage can change during adjustment periods."&lt;SEP&gt;"Interest Rate Adjustment Caps are limitations on how much an interest rate can rise or fall during adjustment periods in an adjustable-rate mortgage."&lt;SEP&gt;"Interest Rate Adjustment Caps refer to the limits placed on how much an interest rate can increase or decrease during adjustment periods for adjustable-rate mortgages."&lt;SEP&gt;"Interest Rate Adjustment Caps set limits on how much interest rates can adjust in adjustable-rate mortgages."&lt;SEP&gt;"Interest Rate Adjustment Caps are limits on how much the interest rate on an adjustable-rate mortgage can increase at each adjustment period."&lt;SEP&gt;"Interest Rate Adjustment Caps are the limits placed on how much the interest rate on an adjustable-rate mortgage can increase or decrease at each adjustment period."&lt;SEP&gt;"Interest Rate Adjustment Caps are limits put in place to restrict how much an interest rate can increase during each adjustment period, providing borrowers with stability."&lt;SEP&gt;"Interest Rate Adjustment Caps are limits set on how much the interest rate can increase or decrease at each adjustment period, protecting borrowers from extreme fluctuations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Interest Rate Adjustment Caps refer to the limits on how much an interest rate can change during an adjustment period for adjustable-rate mortgages."&lt;SEP&gt;"Interest Rate Adjustment Caps refer to predefined limits on how much interest rates can change on adjustable-rate loans, ensuring borrower's rates do not fluctuate excessively."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6a2fe6bde08b88616e4d4932fe5f5e5c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c977b52194d7751d347d7a9c63060b4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-29e2bb5014fcbf1d6e95d3ac5b1702bc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-49f8738c76594c2ed9866d0e86818ca8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8760dceb193fd7c5f24d24209ee5e31&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f11f5ef3fffef89b593ca081411d1b13&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f2378deca7fb18f0144fa8707001424&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-48a2b2c8a98a031e15a7c52e9d1d96c6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b6d8750d3b8676bc5099fb262793a7ff</data>
