  <data key="d0">"INDUSTRY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Texas Refinance Loans refer to loan transactions that undergo specific evaluations against the Texas constitutional guidelines for home equity."&lt;SEP&gt;"Texas refinance loans are financial products for refinancing existing loans under specific regulations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Texas refinance loans are specific mortgage products available under Texas regulations for refinancing existing loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"Texas refinance loans follow specific regulations unique to the state for refinancing existing mortgages."&lt;SEP&gt;"Texas Refinance Loans refers to specific regulations and guidelines governing refinance transactions for properties located in Texas."</data>
