<node id="&quot;MARKET VALUE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Market Value is the estimated price a property would sell for in a competitive real estate market under normal conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Market Value refers to the estimated amount that an asset would sell for on the open market, relevant for determining collateral for mortgage loans and income qualification."&lt;SEP&gt;"Market Value refers to the estimated value of a property in the market, which may be impacted by non-arm’s length transactions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Market Value refers to the estimated worth of a property on the open market, which can be influenced by non-arm’s length transactions in mortgage evaluations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5b42b071e6198f2a53344eeed3e0dca2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca3069902295dcf5b2b505753d7623f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed5c9771e9d7f170cab82a4f6e0fe9c6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c977b52194d7751d347d7a9c63060b4</data>
