<node id="&quot;TITLE COMMITMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"NORMAL_ENTITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Title Commitment is a legal document that outlines the terms under which a title insurance company agrees to provide title insurance, typically to protect against potential defects in property title."&lt;SEP&gt;"Title Commitment is a document provided by a title company that outlines the terms under which a title insurance policy will be issued."&lt;SEP&gt;"Title Commitment is a document provided by a title company outlining the conditions under which a title to property will be insurable."</data>
