  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Fannie Mae and Freddie Mac are government-sponsored enterprises that play a crucial role in the U.S. mortgage market by providing liquidity and promoting stability."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fannie Mae and Freddie Mac are government-sponsored enterprises that provide liquidity to the mortgage market and their instruments are referenced in various loan documents."</data>
