<node id="&quot;FIXED RATE LOANS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"NORMAL_ENTITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Fixed Rate Loans are loans with an interest rate that remains the same throughout the life of the loan, providing stability for borrowers."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fixed Rate Loans are mortgage products with a set interest rate for the duration of the loan, providing borrowers with consistent monthly payments."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fixed Rate Loans refer to loans with a fixed interest rate that do not change over time, providing stable repayment amounts."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2f2378deca7fb18f0144fa8707001424&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b42b071e6198f2a53344eeed3e0dca2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-076af9e929f806725a98e51a239feee5</data>
