</node>
<node id="&quot;ADJUSTABLE RATE LOANS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FINANCIAL PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Adjustable Rate Loans are financial products with interest rates that can change over time based on market conditions, including 5/6, 7/6, and 10/6 ARM variants."&lt;SEP&gt;"Adjustable Rate Loans are loans with an interest rate that may change periodically based on changes in a corresponding financial index."&lt;SEP&gt;"Adjustable Rate Loans are mortgage products where interest rates can change based on market conditions, offering initial lower rates but with potential for variability."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f11f5ef3fffef89b593ca081411d1b13&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b42b071e6198f2a53344eeed3e0dca2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-076af9e929f806725a98e51a239feee5</data>
