</node>
<node id="&quot;INTEREST-ONLY PERIOD FIXED RATE NOTE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Interest-Only Period Fixed Rate Note allows borrowers to pay only the interest for a set period, after which they must begin paying the principal."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-076af9e929f806725a98e51a239feee5</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 73}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 376}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MULTISTATE INTEREST-ONLY FIXED/ADJUSTABLE RATE NOTE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Multistate Interest-Only Fixed/Adjustable Rate Note is a financial instrument that permits interest-only payments for a certain period on a fixed or adjustable rate loan."</data>
