<node id="&quot;CONDO RIDER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Condo Rider is a specific mortgage product form utilized by Fannie Mae/Freddie Mac to address guidelines and restrictions relevant to condominium loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Condo Rider is an addendum to a loan document that specifies terms and conditions applicable to condominium properties."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Condo Rider is a specific mortgage document used in the transaction of condominium properties, helping to address unique aspects of condo financing."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a15606c9906902e66156e783e1ffe9b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-076af9e929f806725a98e51a239feee5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-49f8738c76594c2ed9866d0e86818ca8</data>
