<node id="&quot;PUD RIDER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"PUD Rider is another mortgage product offered by Fannie Mae/Freddie Mac tailored for Planned Unit Developments, clarifying terms and conditions applicable to these properties."&lt;SEP&gt;"The PUD Rider is an attachment to a loan that addresses the special characteristics and requirements of planned unit developments."&lt;SEP&gt;"The PUD Rider is a mortgage document that applies to properties within planned unit developments (PUDs), outlining specific terms related to such properties."&lt;SEP&gt;"The PUD Rider is a document related to loans secured by Planned Unit Developments (PUDs), specifying terms and conditions relevant to properties in such developments."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a72060811d2de811b03ec94848dcad94&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a15606c9906902e66156e783e1ffe9b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-076af9e929f806725a98e51a239feee5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-49f8738c76594c2ed9866d0e86818ca8</data>
