</node>
<node id="&quot;1-4 FAMILY RIDER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"1-4 Family Rider is a mortgage product form utilized by Fannie Mae/Freddie Mac for financing homes that can accommodate 2 to 4 families, including investment properties."&lt;SEP&gt;"The 1-4 Family Rider is a document that provides additional stipulations regarding mortgage loans secured by properties containing one to four family units."&lt;SEP&gt;"The 1-4 Family Rider is a specialized mortgage document that addresses financing for properties that are designed to house one to four families."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a15606c9906902e66156e783e1ffe9b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-076af9e929f806725a98e51a239feee5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-49f8738c76594c2ed9866d0e86818ca8</data>
