<node id="&quot;FIXED RATE NOTE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Fixed Rate Note is a loan instrument that guarantees a fixed interest rate for the duration of the loan period, stabilizing monthly payments for borrowers."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fixed Rate Note is a financial product offered by Freddie Mac, allowing borrowers to secure a loan with a constant interest rate over the life of the loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Fixed Rate Note is a financial instrument that establishes the terms of a fixed-rate loan agreement between a borrower and lender."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a72060811d2de811b03ec94848dcad94&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a15606c9906902e66156e783e1ffe9b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-076af9e929f806725a98e51a239feee5</data>
