<node id="&quot;MANUFACTURED HOME&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"NORMAL_ENTITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A manufactured home is also deemed ineligible under the FHA $100 HUD Repo program, restricting loan applications for such properties."&lt;SEP&gt;"Manufactured Home refers to a type of residential structure noted in the pricing matrix, with specific fee estimates for appraisal services."&lt;SEP&gt;"Manufactured Home refers to factory-built housing that meets specified construction standards, often requiring unique financing criteria in mortgage guidelines."&lt;SEP&gt;"Manufactured Home refers to prefabricated homes built in a factory and transported to the site for assembly, mentioned in various financing contexts."&lt;SEP&gt;"Manufactured Home, in this context, refers to a double-wide structure that qualifies for Home Possible loans with a maximum loan-to-value ratio of 95%."&lt;SEP&gt;"Manufactured Home refers to homes that are built off-site and then transported to a specific location for use, often referred to as mobile homes."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-92bc9ce80658e51e7fed2cac493270e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7fafde8ee8a585c55ef0976f28ab4e55&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e78a99763ca81ea2755a9310a0e6cc85&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a2da58e198e6dc88d0d9086df75b4d30&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f5d10b59eabaab0b4bdac98f88233ce6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a582fe17fe66be19c89056580dbaccc</data>
