<node id="&quot;PURCHASE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"PURCHASE refers to the act of acquiring real estate, involving negotiation, financing, and closing processes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Purchase refers to the process of acquiring a property through a mortgage agreement, where the financial responsibility is shared between the borrower and the lender."&lt;SEP&gt;"PURCHASE relates to the act of buying a home utilizing the Home Possible mortgage product."&lt;SEP&gt;"Purchase refers to the transaction process when acquiring a property, involving the financing structures outlined in the mortgage information."&lt;SEP&gt;"Purchase refers to the event of buying a property, often associated with mortgage loan applications."&lt;SEP&gt;"Purchase refers to the act of acquiring property through a mortgage, central to real estate financing and investment."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e07a33c29f8d16a498a486fa35e048c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-92bc9ce80658e51e7fed2cac493270e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-304d9428ac3f0546fe2c83618fb493e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d8141599e488921f66fe766d03ed3bf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ab83fcb34a1963a254e2dbce808acb9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a582fe17fe66be19c89056580dbaccc</data>
