</node>
<node id="&quot;INVESTMENT PROPERTY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An Investment Property refers to any real estate purchased for the purpose of generating income or profit, often under different lending criteria compared to primary homes."&lt;SEP&gt;"INVESTMENT PROPERTY refers to real estate acquired primarily for generating income, investment returns, or appreciation in value."&lt;SEP&gt;"Investment Property is a type of residential property that is purchased primarily for rental income or investment purposes rather than for personal use."&lt;SEP&gt;"Investment Property refers to a residential property purchased for the purpose of generating rental income or for investment, rather than for personal residence."&lt;SEP&gt;"Investment property refers to real estate purchased with the intention of earning a return on the investment through rental income or appreciation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Investment Property is a term used to describe real estate purchased to generate rental income or profit, significant in discussions on real estate investment."&lt;SEP&gt;"Investment Property is defined as real estate that is purchased with the intent of earning a return on investment, whether through rental income or appreciation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Investment Property refers to real estate purchased for generating income and potentially capital appreciation, often considered in mortgage contexts."&lt;SEP&gt;"Investment Property refers to real estate purchased for the purpose of generating income, either through rent or resale."&lt;SEP&gt;"Investment Property refers to real estate purchased primarily for financial gain, either from rental income or price appreciation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Investment Property is a term referring to various mortgage options available for properties purchased with the intent to earn rental income or profit."&lt;SEP&gt;"Investment Property refers to real estate acquired specifically for generating rental income or for resale at a profit."&lt;SEP&gt;"Investment Property refers to real estate owned by an individual for generating income, impacting mortgage eligibility differently from primary residencies."&lt;SEP&gt;"Investment Property refers to real estate purchased primarily for generating rental income or profit, with its own set of loan conditions mentioned in the document."&lt;SEP&gt;"Investment Property refers to the acquisition of real estate for generating income, posing specific challenges and requirements for financing."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b75506a7175a05b7c26944fe1aa93eda&lt;SEP&gt;&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-92bc9ce80658e51e7fed2cac493270e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ef8667615745a5fec93f77636582f41&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4849d91ba0d105495fd48b0a77c7c582&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd0c5c971a5a48bbded5da8b256a175c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7f44da442f8034719cd2f26599196416&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ab83fcb34a1963a254e2dbce808acb9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-42979d97c1c73c1b28eac498c9aee682&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-150cc6b2e7ba7007f09ed79ae5042c88&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-48a2b2c8a98a031e15a7c52e9d1d96c6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-94010f4bdf2ece06575cf539272b8b45&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fad5bfdaee64eed200866a097fc789e6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7fafde8ee8a585c55ef0976f28ab4e55</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 3}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 64}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 356}]</data>
</node>
