  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Real Estate Transactions encompass the buying, selling, or refinancing of properties, governed by various legal and financial requirements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Real Estate Transactions encompass the processes and negotiations involved in the buying, selling, and financing of property, as well as the regulatory framework governing these activities."&lt;SEP&gt;"Real Estate Transactions refer to the processes of buying, selling, or leasing properties, subject to various legal and financial regulations."</data>
