<node id="&quot;HIGH BALANCE LOANS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"High Balance Loans are mortgage loans that exceed the standard conforming loan limits, with specific eligibility criteria outlined by Fannie Mae."&lt;SEP&gt;"High Balance Loans are types of mortgage loans that exceed conforming loan limits, designed to cater to the higher-cost housing markets."</data>
