<node id="&quot;CONFORMING LOANS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Conforming Loans are loans that meet the criteria set by government-sponsored enterprises, making them eligible for purchase and standard underwriting practices."&lt;SEP&gt;"Conforming Loans are mortgage loans that adhere to the guidelines set by Fannie Mae and Freddie Mac, enabling broader access to affordable financing."&lt;SEP&gt;"Conforming Loans are mortgages that adhere to guidelines set by Fannie Mae and Freddie Mac for funding, allowing them to be easily bought and sold in the market."&lt;SEP&gt;"Conforming Loans are traditional mortgages that adhere to guidelines set by government-sponsored enterprises like Fannie Mae and Freddie Mac, facilitating their purchase in the secondary market."&lt;SEP&gt;"Conforming Loans are traditional loans that meet specific guidelines set by government-sponsored enterprises (GSEs) such as Fannie Mae and Freddie Mac."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-fe4b9e8302b8de2d8d692106e4e284ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ef8667615745a5fec93f77636582f41&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da6a7f245e88177bac6b85d5f808ebd3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6de80860713bbcd40afb3b3b69d1945f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7f44da442f8034719cd2f26599196416</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 66}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 364}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 792}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MORTGAGE LOAN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Mortgage Loan is a loan secured by a first or second lien on a property, typically a residential dwelling, where the borrower is obligated to repay the loan under specified terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"A Mortgage Loan is a specific type of loan used to purchase real estate, secured by the property itself, which can vary in terms and conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"A mortgage loan is a type of loan used to purchase real estate, backed by the property itself, and involves considerations for title insurance."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mortgage Loan is a type of loan specifically used to purchase real estate, secured by the property being purchased."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mortgage Loan is a financial product sold by Flagstar and subject to repurchase and indemnity obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mortgage Loan is a financial product that represents a loan secured by real property, which Flagstar manages and sells in the mortgage market."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mortgage Loan refers to the loan provided to the Borrower for purchasing property, under specific agreements and guidelines established by Flagstar."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Mortgage Loan is a financial product secured by property, which requires compliance with various laws and insurance standards."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Mortgage Loan is a financial product that represents a loan secured by real estate, with specific terms and conditions outlined in the legal documents."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b2fbf5161dc5c6670b7fd7548d822a73&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2292650099ea1cdf5881f79ed28d3cfc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c8b4e28d440c820b5ce2e89c08cd1b75&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ef8667615745a5fec93f77636582f41&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fc9e5323cf1da974f74cdcad0aebf55d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8552c190e01cd6c887d540f68372a1a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-132b3969367ecce54c6730fb570430ea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9351b24bca225d97ff2d45b46310a878&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a40aeeabaca2a4a97b1dd8ad35ab142e</data>
