</node>
<node id="&quot;LOAN GUIDELINES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"NORMAL_ENTITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Loan Guidelines refer to the comprehensive rules and protocols set for processing and approving loans, crucial for lenders and borrowers."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loan Guidelines refer to the criteria lenders use to evaluate the eligibility of borrowers and the terms of various mortgage products."</data>
