<node id="&quot;SECONDARY MARKET&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"INDUSTRY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Secondary Market is a marketplace where Mortgage Loans are bought and sold after the initial loan is originated, often involving private investors and agencies."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Secondary Market refers to the marketplace where existing loans and securities are bought and sold, primarily involving mortgage-backed securities."&lt;SEP&gt;"Secondary Market refers to the marketplace where existing mortgage loans are bought and sold, influencing liquidity and availability of mortgage credit."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6ef8667615745a5fec93f77636582f41&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2fbf5161dc5c6670b7fd7548d822a73&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d3f42cc9266dff615db2fd5cb59e3109</data>
