</node>
<node id="&quot;INTEREST RATES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Interest Rates refer to the amount charged by lenders to borrowers for the use of money, expressed as a percentage of the principal, influencing mortgage costs."&lt;SEP&gt;"Interest Rates refer to the percentage charged on a loan or paid on savings, influencing mortgage payments and borrowing costs."&lt;SEP&gt;"Interest rates represent the cost of borrowing money expressed as a percentage of the loan amount, influencing mortgage affordability and decision-making for borrowers."&lt;SEP&gt;"Interest Rates refer to the costs incurred by borrowers for borrowing funds, critical in determining loan affordability."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-fd698c420bb978f364630c455d2abf4a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ef8667615745a5fec93f77636582f41&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4849d91ba0d105495fd48b0a77c7c582&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-25dcfc163b5b00ffab734b755ea03592</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 8}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 108}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 482}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TEXAS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Texas is a location referenced in relation to specific administrative fees for loans underwritten by Flagstar, specifically for loans with properties located there."&lt;SEP&gt;TEXAS is a U.S. state renowned for its large size, diverse landscapes, cultural influences, and significant contributions to various industries. It is known for its oil industry, vast open spaces, and strong economy. Texas is the largest state in the U.S. by area and the second-largest state known for its diverse geography and cultural diversity. It is mentioned in the context of mortgage loans, refinancing criteria, and specific regulations regarding refinance loans outlined in the Texas Constitution. Texas has specific provisions regarding mortgage endorsements, including the Texas Section 50(a)(6) loan and T-30 endorsement. Additionally, Texas is subject to certain eligibility restrictions for financial products offered by Flagstar Bank and specific regulatory considerations for products such as the Fannie Mae HomeReady loan. Loan underwriting procedures, administrative fees, and appraisal fees in Texas are detailed, with restrictions on certain loans like the Texas Section 50(a)(6) loans.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9cd1c976503db6a0b9762d63aba656cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b4bffe67af21dcc27a55a8935b91a11c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da6a7f245e88177bac6b85d5f808ebd3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-970955acc105f7936d7b684983cc4b58&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-49a151d65e3cdee194b3d907f4671668&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f463e80705c368f56db31d1f00a4efe7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fe4b9e8302b8de2d8d692106e4e284ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-91b01e6032a7e839d53d9b23f3a2949c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-593f9403b246f17722c284b9fc562c85&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eec7e8fc248456d980c970b75e0fbf41&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bde383f3ecde8888355124cd638e2e53&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f08c1849f1a1e52584c06fc2286667f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d3310e925ce8d483d790951bc5b7e818&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d0459e9b5b3885ad40728e4e0af01123&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-04a4d78a32f7dce438d7f1d06834d5ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a72060811d2de811b03ec94848dcad94&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd0c5c971a5a48bbded5da8b256a175c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f86e09d03714d2c94d238835f0083c0e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-48a2b2c8a98a031e15a7c52e9d1d96c6</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 16}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 173}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 660}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ADJUSTABLE RATE MORTGAGE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Adjustable Rate Mortgage refers to a mortgage with an interest rate that can change at predetermined times, affecting monthly payments."&lt;SEP&gt;"An Adjustable Rate Mortgage (ARM) features interest rate adjustments after an initial fixed-rate period, impacting monthly payments over time."</data>
