</node>
<node id="&quot;LENDER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Lender is a financial institution or individual that provides funds to borrowers, evaluating their qualifications based on established criteria."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lender is the financial institution or entity that provides the mortgage loan to the borrower, often requiring title insurance to secure its investment."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Lender is the financial institution or entity that provides the loan to the borrower for purchasing a property."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Lender refers to the financial entity that provides credit in the transaction, which must comply with the Right of Rescission guidelines."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lender refers to the financial institution or individual that provides the loan to the Borrower, expecting repayment with interest."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lender refers to the financial institution or entity that provides the loan to the borrower, responsible for evaluating loan requests and compliance."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lender is a financial institution or entity that provides loans to Borrowers, responsible for assessing eligibility and processing applications."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5b42b071e6198f2a53344eeed3e0dca2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc8b7db5bf49f6eb8f1e8daa83b6b361&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-970955acc105f7936d7b684983cc4b58&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de34030d71ef2c627010a089db20697c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f08c1849f1a1e52584c06fc2286667f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f639d102461efe890e188cbc182dba52&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-48a2b2c8a98a031e15a7c52e9d1d96c6</data>
