<node id="&quot;CONVERSION OPTION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Conversion Option describes an option within certain loan products that allows the borrower to convert an adjustable-rate mortgage to a fixed-rate mortgage at a later date."&lt;SEP&gt;"Conversion Option is a feature in certain mortgage agreements that allows borrowers to change their adjustable-rate mortgage to a fixed-rate mortgage under specified conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Conversion Option refers to the conditions under which a borrower may convert an adjustable-rate loan to a fixed-rate loan, providing flexibility in loan management."</data>
