</node>
<node id="&quot;ASSUMPTION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Assumption involves taking over someone's existing mortgage, which is subject to specific conditions and fees."&lt;SEP&gt;"Assumption refers to the process whereby a buyer takes over the seller's existing mortgage and its payment obligations, subject to the lender's approval."&lt;SEP&gt;"Assumption refers to the agreement that allows a new borrower to take over the payments of an existing mortgage under specified conditions."</data>
