<node id="&quot;CALIFORNIA&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"California is a U.S. state contained in the appraisal pricing matrix, showing various fee estimates for appraisal services."&lt;SEP&gt;"California is a U.S. state known for its diverse geography, entertainment industry, and cultural influence."&lt;SEP&gt;"California is a U.S. state where specific laws regarding escrow waivers allow waivers up to a 90% LTV, indicating regional regulatory variations."&lt;SEP&gt;"California is included in the West for VA mortgage eligibility in the VA Regional State Breakdown."&lt;SEP&gt;"California is noted for its entertainment industry, cultural diversity, and natural beauty, including beaches and mountains."&lt;SEP&gt;"California is renowned for its entertainment industry (Hollywood), diverse culture, and natural beauty."&lt;SEP&gt;"California is a U.S. state where the California Housing &amp; Finance Agency operates to support affordable housing initiatives."&lt;SEP&gt;"California is a cultural and economic powerhouse known for its film industry."&lt;SEP&gt;"California is a state in the western United States, known for its diverse geography, rich cultural heritage, and economic significance, offering a wide range of attractions from beaches to mountains."&lt;SEP&gt;"California is a state known for its diverse geography and high real estate prices, impacting mortgage limits and market dynamics."&lt;SEP&gt;"California is a state located on the West Coast of the United States, known for its diverse geography and economy."&lt;SEP&gt;"California is a state on the West Coast of the United States known for its diversity and economic power."&lt;SEP&gt;"California is a state located on the western coast of the United States, known for its diverse geography, sprawling cities, and a significant role in the pricing market across various industries."&lt;SEP&gt;"California is a state located on the western coast of the United States, mentioned in relation to pricing."</data>
  <data key="d2">&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d3310e925ce8d483d790951bc5b7e818&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-91b01e6032a7e839d53d9b23f3a2949c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-13f5bfa76be42aa009ba16638227f047&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a2da58e198e6dc88d0d9086df75b4d30&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bde383f3ecde8888355124cd638e2e53&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7de83587d951a7ec74fcb94d81a7df71&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-49f8738c76594c2ed9866d0e86818ca8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9a577e8766cf4f0e1ae599795cd9c6fa</data>
