<node id="&quot;CORRESPONDENT LOANS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"NORMAL_ENTITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Correspondent Loans are types of mortgages that are originated by correspondents who sell them to lenders after closing."&lt;SEP&gt;"Correspondent Loans refer to loans processed through a correspondent lender, which may have specific pricing adjustments for escrow waivers."&lt;SEP&gt;"Correspondent Loans refer to loans that are originated and funded by a lender before being sold to another lender, implicating logistical and regulatory considerations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4f5452ea8c1afd9252c54573e518675e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9a577e8766cf4f0e1ae599795cd9c6fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-25a82bf13c8c6a8ef98d1a15a5361ea9</data>
