<node id="&quot;VA FIXED-RATE AND ADJUSTABLE-RATE MORTGAGE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The VA Fixed-Rate and Adjustable-Rate Mortgage is a loan program offered by the Veterans Administration that allows veterans and active duty personnel to purchase or refinance homes under favorable terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"VA Fixed-Rate and Adjustable-Rate Mortgage encompasses various loan types designed for veterans, with specific eligibility and property type requirements."&lt;SEP&gt;"VA Fixed-Rate and Adjustable-Rate Mortgage is a loan option available to veterans offering fixed and adjustable rates."&lt;SEP&gt;"VA Fixed-Rate and Adjustable-Rate Mortgage is a type of mortgage designed for veterans, offering both fixed-rate and adjustable-rate options, along with specific terms for closing costs."&lt;SEP&gt;"VA Fixed-Rate and Adjustable-Rate Mortgage refers to a mortgage product available for veterans that offers various interest rate options over time."&lt;SEP&gt;"VA Fixed-Rate and Adjustable-Rate Mortgage refers to mortgage options designed for veterans, providing fixed and variable interest rates."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-bde383f3ecde8888355124cd638e2e53&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f1b06bf2c39f8da79b3399842638c80b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d3310e925ce8d483d790951bc5b7e818&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-01039c48e44ce5e4ea96c87117f23d78</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 8}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 109}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 483}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;VETERANS ADMINISTRATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Veterans Administration is a government agency that oversees the loan program enabling veterans and active duty personnel to obtain mortgages with benefits like no down payment."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f1b06bf2c39f8da79b3399842638c80b</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 8}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 109}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 484}]</data>
