</node>
<node id="&quot;1 TO 4-UNIT PROPERTIES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PROPERTY TYPE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"1 to 4-unit Properties refer to the types of residential properties eligible for funding through various mortgage programs."&lt;SEP&gt;"1 to 4-unit properties refer to residential properties that can qualify under the VA mortgage guidelines, typically single-family homes or duplexes through quadplexes."&lt;SEP&gt;"1 to 4-unit properties are real estate types eligible for financing under certain loan programs, including HomeReady, and encompass single-family homes to small multi-family units."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4849d91ba0d105495fd48b0a77c7c582&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f1b06bf2c39f8da79b3399842638c80b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e0b943be84e7ac4bbf9b166f805ef17c</data>
