</node>
<node id="&quot;ADJUSTABLE-RATE MORTGAGE (ARM)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Adjustable-Rate Mortgage (ARM) is a loan product that offers lower initial rates which adjust after a specific period, affecting the monthly payments based on market rates."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f1b06bf2c39f8da79b3399842638c80b</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 8}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 101}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 458}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MINIMUM UNDERWRITING ENGINE&quot;&amp;&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Minimum Underwriting Engine refers to the software systems utilized to assess borrowers' eligibility for loans based on their financial histories and credit scores."</data>
