  <data key="d1">"Loan Amounts Section refers to a designated part of the document that outlines the various loan amounts applicable for different property types."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Loan Amounts Section provides critical information regarding the maximum and minimum borrowing limits for various property types under the VA program."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Loan Amounts section provides guidance and rules regarding the maximum loan amounts available under different conditions for borrowers under the VA loan program."</data>
