<node id="&quot;DU (DESKTOP UNDERWRITER)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"DU (Desktop Underwriter) is an automated underwriting system used by lenders to evaluate loan applications and determine borrower eligibility."&lt;SEP&gt;"Desktop Underwriter (DU) is an automated underwriting system developed by Fannie Mae to evaluate and assess the risk associated with mortgage applications."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f1b06bf2c39f8da79b3399842638c80b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd0c5c971a5a48bbded5da8b256a175c</data>
