<node id="&quot;JUMBO LOAN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Jumbo Loan is a type of mortgage that exceeds conforming loan limits, typically used for high-value properties and detailed in the loan programs comparison."&lt;SEP&gt;"A Jumbo Loan is a type of mortgage that exceeds the conforming loan limit and is not eligible for purchase by government-sponsored entities, often carrying higher interest rates."&lt;SEP&gt;"A Jumbo Loan is a type of mortgage that exceeds the conforming loan limits set by the FHFA and is not eligible for purchase by government-sponsored entities."&lt;SEP&gt;"A Jumbo Loan is a type of mortgage that exceeds the conforming loan limits set by Fannie Mae and Freddie Mac, typically used for high-value properties."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f1b06bf2c39f8da79b3399842638c80b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e78a99763ca81ea2755a9310a0e6cc85&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-42979d97c1c73c1b28eac498c9aee682&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d3f42cc9266dff615db2fd5cb59e3109</data>
