  <data key="d1">"Product Guidelines refer to the detailed terms and conditions governing the Home Equity Line of Credit and its various offerings."&lt;SEP&gt;"Product Guidelines refer to the rules and stipulations surrounding the issuance and management of mortgage products under the VA loan program."&lt;SEP&gt;"Product Guidelines refers to the set of rules and standards established for qualifying for different mortgage products as indicated in the document."&lt;SEP&gt;"Product Guidelines refer to the set standards and procedures outlined for various financial products, including Home Equity Lines of Credit, detailing eligibility and requirements."</data>
