</node>
<node id="&quot;APPROVAL PROCESS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Approval Process encompasses the steps undertaken by lenders to evaluate and decide on mortgage applications, including credit checks and documentation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Approval Process refers to the steps necessary for reviewing and authorizing down payment assistance applications, including underwriting and eligibility checks."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Approval Process is the series of steps taken by lenders to evaluate and approve loan applications based on various requirements."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6f08c1849f1a1e52584c06fc2286667f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f1b06bf2c39f8da79b3399842638c80b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-437272f81cc4575a4fa57f55ce8d121c</data>
