</node>
<node id="&quot;LOAN TERMS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Loan Terms define the conditions under which a loan agreement is made, such as the duration, repayment schedule, and interest rates."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loan Terms refer to the conditions and stipulations under which a loan is issued, including interest rates, repayment schedules, and penalties."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loan Terms refer to the specific conditions and parameters under which a loan is provided, including payment schedules, interest rates, and borrower responsibilities."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loan Terms refer to the specific financial conditions outlined in a loan agreement, which may not be changed post-closing if they affect the loan's integrity."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4f5452ea8c1afd9252c54573e518675e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f2378deca7fb18f0144fa8707001424&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b42b071e6198f2a53344eeed3e0dca2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f1b06bf2c39f8da79b3399842638c80b</data>
