</node>
<node id="&quot;CASH-IN-HAND&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Cash-in-Hand refers to the amount of cash a borrower can receive through a cash-out refinance after paying off the existing mortgage."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cash-in-Hand refers to the funds available to the borrower at the close of a purchase or refinancing transaction, impacting the amount borrowed under a loan."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f1b06bf2c39f8da79b3399842638c80b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8760dceb193fd7c5f24d24209ee5e31</data>
