<node id="&quot;VA LOAN PROGRAM&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The VA Loan Program is a government-backed initiative providing veterans and active military members access to favorable mortgage loan options."&lt;SEP&gt;"The VA Loan Program is a government-backed initiative that provides favorable mortgage terms for veterans and active duty military personnel, enabling them to secure home financing with benefits such as no down payment and competitive interest rates."</data>
  <data key="d2">&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f1b06bf2c39f8da79b3399842638c80b</data>
