<node id="&quot;NON-CONFORMING LOANS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Non-Conforming Loans are loans that do not adhere to the guidelines set by government-sponsored entities and typically involve higher risks and interest rates."&lt;SEP&gt;"Non-Conforming Loans are loans that do not meet the criteria set by GSEs, often having different underwriting standards and requirements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Non-conforming Loans are loans that do not meet the guidelines set by the purchaser, with associated fees like the Early Loan Payoff Fee."&lt;SEP&gt;"Non-Conforming Loans are loans that do not meet conventional lending requirements, affecting the appraisal process and Jumbo Desk Reviews."&lt;SEP&gt;"Non-conforming Loans are a category of loans offered by Flagstar that do not fall within traditional lending criteria, also subject to early payoff fees."&lt;SEP&gt;"Non-conforming Loans refer to loans that do not meet the conventional buyer standards, possibly leading to higher risks and different underwriting fees."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-fe4b9e8302b8de2d8d692106e4e284ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bf2d9f6b5b471373ca78f75c11d02725&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f1b06bf2c39f8da79b3399842638c80b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da6a7f245e88177bac6b85d5f808ebd3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-662a2c10d200da7291e0212d33749544&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-192e3f9f08a0121645e56ca36babd81b</data>
