  <data key="d1">"AUS or Automated Underwriting System is a software system mortgage lenders use to evaluate risk and make automated credit decisions on mortgage applications."&lt;SEP&gt;"AUS stands for Automated Underwriting System, a software tool used in the mortgage industry to assess the risk of a loan application automatically."&lt;SEP&gt;"AUS stands for Automated Underwriting System, a technological tool used by lenders to assess loan applications and streamline the approval process."&lt;SEP&gt;"AUS, or Automated Underwriting System, is a technology used by lenders to evaluate loan applications quickly and efficiently based on predetermined criteria."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-fbc754fc30ff722a8fee09393323a03d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-94010f4bdf2ece06575cf539272b8b45&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-060d3305d5697520404f94c4fcd2cb85&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6de80860713bbcd40afb3b3b69d1945f</data>
