</node>
<node id="&quot;INTEREST-ONLY PAYMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"NORMAL_ENTITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Interest-Only Payments are a type of loan payment structure where only the interest is paid in the initial phase of the loan, relevant during the construction period."&lt;SEP&gt;"Interest-only payments refer to a payment structure in which the borrower pays only the interest during the construction phase, before regular amortizing payments begin."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1418f5447a956615e29938e7c6f0f71a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0908ef3e42a9d0bcd40742960e19dbf2</data>
