</node>
<node id="&quot;CLOSING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Closing is the final step in a real estate transaction where the property is formally transferred, requiring compliance with title insurance and loan requirements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Closing is the final step in the mortgage process where all legal documents are signed and funds are disbursed."&lt;SEP&gt;"Closing is the process in real estate transactions where the title is transferred, which involves ensuring that the necessary title insurance is in place."&lt;SEP&gt;"Closing refers to the final step in a real estate transaction where ownership is formally transferred and all financial obligations are settled."&lt;SEP&gt;"Closing is the final step in the mortgage loan process where the transaction is completed, and ownership is transferred to the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"Closing refers to the final step in the mortgage process where all documents are signed, the loan is funded, and ownership is transferred to the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"Closing refers to the significant moment when a Borrower signs the necessary documentation, including the Note, to finalize a Mortgage Loan."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b2fbf5161dc5c6670b7fd7548d822a73&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e91d1878db3c593f090cf301ec4048a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fc9e5323cf1da974f74cdcad0aebf55d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9351b24bca225d97ff2d45b46310a878&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f08c1849f1a1e52584c06fc2286667f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1418f5447a956615e29938e7c6f0f71a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a40aeeabaca2a4a97b1dd8ad35ab142e</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 21}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 210}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 735}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ESCROWS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Escrows are funds set aside for future expenses such as taxes and insurance, collected at the time of closing in the lending process."&lt;SEP&gt;"Escrows refer to accounts established for taxes and insurance in conjunction with mortgage loans, although they are not permitted with HELOCs as per the guidelines."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-eec7e8fc248456d980c970b75e0fbf41&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1418f5447a956615e29938e7c6f0f71a</data>
