<node id="&quot;CONTINGENCY FUNDS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Contingency Funds are reserve funds required during construction to address unexpected costs, ensuring that the project can be completed financially."&lt;SEP&gt;"Contingency Funds are reserves set aside to cover unexpected costs during a construction project, usually a percentage of total costs."&lt;SEP&gt;"Contingency Funds are reserves set aside to cover unexpected costs during construction, typically required based on the total cost of improvements."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1418f5447a956615e29938e7c6f0f71a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0908ef3e42a9d0bcd40742960e19dbf2</data>
