</node>
<node id="&quot;TAXES AND INSURANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Taxes and Insurance represent regular costs incurred by property owners, which are often included in the escrow process of mortgage payments."</data>
