  <data key="d0">"NORMAL_ENTITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Interest Reserve Accounts are accounts used to cover interest payments during a construction phase, which are not eligible in certain contexts according to the guidelines."&lt;SEP&gt;"Interest Reserve Accounts are funds set aside to cover the interest payments during the construction period, though not eligible in this case."</data>
