<node id="&quot;LTV RATIO&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"LTV Ratio (Loan-to-Value Ratio) is a financial term used to assess the risk of a loan, calculated as the loan amount divided by the appraised value of the property."</data>
