</node>
<node id="&quot;SWEAT EQUITY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Sweat Equity refers to the non-monetary investment a borrower makes in a property through physical labor or improvements, which is not accepted as part of the acquisition calculation."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1418f5447a956615e29938e7c6f0f71a</data>
