  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Doc Prep Fee for Mechanics Lien is a specific fee charged for the preparation of documentation related to mechanics' liens in construction lending."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1418f5447a956615e29938e7c6f0f71a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BORROWER'S ACKNOWLEDGMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Borrower's Acknowledgment is a document confirming that the borrower has understood and agreed to the terms and conditions presented in the loan documentation."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1418f5447a956615e29938e7c6f0f71a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CONSTRUCTION LOAN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Construction Loan is a short-term loan used to finance the construction of a property, which later converts to a permanent mortgage."&lt;SEP&gt;"Construction Loan is a short-term loan used to fund the building of a home, which must undergo specific title insurance endorsements once permanent financing is secured."&lt;SEP&gt;"Construction Loan refers to financing specifically structured for funding the construction of new properties or renovations, with various requirements outlined."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f86e09d03714d2c94d238835f0083c0e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-970955acc105f7936d7b684983cc4b58&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0908ef3e42a9d0bcd40742960e19dbf2</data>
