</node>
<node id="&quot;INTEREST RATE MODIFICATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"NORMAL_ENTITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Interest Rate Modification refers to the adjustments in loan interest rates that can occur at the completion of construction, following specific requests."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0908ef3e42a9d0bcd40742960e19dbf2</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 11}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 139}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 576}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CONSTRUCTION PERIOD&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"NORMAL_ENTITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Construction Period refers to the timeframe during which construction of a property is actively taking place, impacting loan payment structures and requirements."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0908ef3e42a9d0bcd40742960e19dbf2</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 9}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 118}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 525}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CREDIT DOCUMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"NORMAL_ENTITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Credit Documents are financial records required to be dated within a specific timeframe to support loan approvals, crucial for the closing process."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0908ef3e42a9d0bcd40742960e19dbf2</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 9}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 118}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 524}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TITLE INSURANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Title Insurance is a financial product that protects lenders and borrowers against financial loss from defects in title to real property and the invalidity or unenforceability of mortgage loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"Title Insurance is a form of indemnity insurance that protects lenders and homebuyers from financial losses related to property title issues."&lt;SEP&gt;"Title Insurance is a policy that protects against losses from disputes over the title of a property, mandatory for construction loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"Title insurance is a type of insurance that protects against financial loss from defects in title to real estate, which can include exceptions related to surveys."&lt;SEP&gt;"Title Insurance protects lenders and buyers from losses due to defects in a property title, necessary in certain states for financing."&lt;SEP&gt;"Title Insurance is a form of indemnity insurance that protects lenders and owners against losses from defects in a title to a property."&lt;SEP&gt;"Title Insurance protects lenders and homeowners from financial loss due to defects in the title of a property."&lt;SEP&gt;"Title Insurance is a type of insurance that protects lenders and homebuyers from defects in titles to real property."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9cd1c976503db6a0b9762d63aba656cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e91d1878db3c593f090cf301ec4048a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca3069902295dcf5b2b505753d7623f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-970955acc105f7936d7b684983cc4b58&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d3f42cc9266dff615db2fd5cb59e3109&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9351b24bca225d97ff2d45b46310a878&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7240c801a08e04a5a9db69a7879361cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0908ef3e42a9d0bcd40742960e19dbf2</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 15}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 164}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 636}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REO ENTRIES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"NORMAL_ENTITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"REO Entries are records related to real estate owned properties, mentioned in relation to underwriting loan cases."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0908ef3e42a9d0bcd40742960e19dbf2</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 89}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 443}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CLOSING DISCLOSURES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"NORMAL_ENTITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Closing Disclosures are documents outlining the final terms and conditions of a loan, prepared prior to the closing date."&lt;SEP&gt;"Closing Disclosures are documents typically provided for loans, but HELOCs are exempt from providing these, changing standard communication processes."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-354a12aa9905401272b6367dbd3c30cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0908ef3e42a9d0bcd40742960e19dbf2</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 9}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 114}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 509}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LOAN PURPOSE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Loan Purpose describes the reason for obtaining a loan, such as purchasing a home, refinancing, or investment purposes, which influences underwriting criteria."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loan Purpose pertains to the reason the borrower is seeking a loan, which is essential for processing the application."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loan Purpose refers to the specified reason a loan is being taken out, which is crucial when applying for financing and must be accurately communicated in documentation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loan Purpose refers to the reason the borrower is requesting the loan, and is a required detail during registration."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loan Purpose refers to the intended use of the loan, including categories such as purchase or rate/term refinance."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loan Purpose refers to the specific reasons buyers take out loans, such as purchasing primary residences, second homes, or investment properties."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loan Purpose specifies the reason for acquiring the loan, which must be disclosed during the registration process."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b722d926669aa7676c36ecbb75a4a233&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d97d5fa1f48d7b9516a9e1f71b87048e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6de80860713bbcd40afb3b3b69d1945f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fbc754fc30ff722a8fee09393323a03d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7f44da442f8034719cd2f26599196416&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c6c6dd97681ba9caa6c83d8ddf9ec59&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0908ef3e42a9d0bcd40742960e19dbf2</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 17}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 186}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 678}]</data>
</node>
