  <data key="d1">"Loan Closing is the final step in the loan process where the Borrower signs documents, and funds are transferred, formally finalizing the loan agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loan Closing refers to the final step in the mortgage process where all documents are signed, fees are paid, and ownership of the property is transferred."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loan Closing refers to the finalization process of a loan agreement where all necessary documents are signed and executed."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loan closing refers to the finalization of a property purchase transaction where the loan is officially recorded and signed, which is part of the FHA financing process."</data>
