  <data key="d1">"Escrow involves holding funds or documents by a third party until specified conditions are met in a loan or real estate transaction."&lt;SEP&gt;"Escrow plays a vital role during the Closing Appointment to ensure that all financial transactions are securely handled."&lt;SEP&gt;"Escrow refers to a financial arrangement where a third party holds funds or documents until certain conditions are met in the context of real estate transactions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Escrow refers to an agreement where a third party temporarily holds funds or documents until certain conditions of the mortgage agreement are fulfilled."&lt;SEP&gt;"Escrow is a financial arrangement where a third party holds funds or assets on behalf of the buyer and seller during a transaction."</data>
