  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Schedule A is part of the title insurance policy that details the specifics of the insurance coverage related to the mortgage."&lt;SEP&gt;"Schedule A provides transaction information relevant to the lender, borrower, property, and coverage details required for processing title insurance."</data>
