  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 23}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 228}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EASEMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Easements are legal rights to use another person's land for a specific purpose, which may affect title insurance coverage and exclusions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9351b24bca225d97ff2d45b46310a878</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 23}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 228}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ENCROACHMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Encroachments are instances where structures or improvements intrude onto adjacent properties or easements, and their management is a key focus in title insurance policies."&lt;SEP&gt;"Encroachments refer to instances where a structure intrudes on another person's property, which may be a concern in title insurance assessments."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9351b24bca225d97ff2d45b46310a878&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e4823f54b9e7afeaec0c69de7747fd4e</data>
