</node>
<node id="&quot;COMMUNICATIONS WITH WASHINGTON&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Communications with Washington involves interactions with governing bodies concerning policies affecting title insurance and real estate transactions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9351b24bca225d97ff2d45b46310a878</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;POTENTIAL ACCESS ISSUES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Potential access issues involve challenges or obstacles in reaching a property, which can impact the title and insurance requirements."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9351b24bca225d97ff2d45b46310a878</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DEEDS OF TRUSTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Deeds of Trusts are legal documents that secure a loan with real property, relevant in the context of title insurance and financial transactions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9351b24bca225d97ff2d45b46310a878</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 15}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 166}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 647}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DELINQUENT TAX BILLS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Delinquent tax bills are unpaid property taxes that can create liens against a property, impacting its marketability and insurance coverage."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9351b24bca225d97ff2d45b46310a878</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 15}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 166}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 647}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CREDITOR'S RIGHTS EXCLUSION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Creditor's rights exclusion is specific language in title insurance that protects against claims from creditors for previous debts affecting ownership."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9351b24bca225d97ff2d45b46310a878</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 15}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 164}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 635}]</data>
</node>
