<node id="&quot;TRUSTEE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A trustee is an individual or organization that holds and manages property or assets for the benefit of another, relevant in real estate transactions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Trustee is a legally designated person responsible for managing a trust on behalf of the beneficiaries, particularly in the context of mortgage loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Trustee is an appointed individual responsible for overseeing the execution of a deed of trust and managing the process of foreclosure if necessary."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8552c190e01cd6c887d540f68372a1a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9351b24bca225d97ff2d45b46310a878</data>
