<node id="&quot;TITLE INSURANCE POLICY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Title Insurance Policy is a legal document that protects against losses from defects in title to the property being mortgaged."&lt;SEP&gt;"Title Insurance Policy is a legal document that outlines the coverage provided by title insurance and any exceptions that may apply."&lt;SEP&gt;"Title Insurance Policy is an insurance policy that protects against losses due to defects in the title to real property."</data>
