<node id="&quot;SETTLEMENT AGENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Settlement Agent is a professional responsible for closing real estate transactions and managing the disbursement of funds during loan transactions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Settlement Agent is an individual or entity responsible for facilitating the final transaction in the mortgage process, including payment of property taxes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Settlement Agent is an individual who conducts the closing with the borrower, coordinating the finalization of the loan process."&lt;SEP&gt;"Settlement Agents are vendors responsible for coordinating the closing of HELOC transactions and managing the associated title and settlement fees."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Settlement Agent is a person or entity responsible for closing the transaction, ensuring that all necessary fees and documents are processed correctly for a HELOC."&lt;SEP&gt;"The settlement agent is a neutral third party who facilitates the closing of the real estate transaction and ensures the proper execution of documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Settlement Agent is responsible for managing the closing process, ensuring that all documents are in order and all parties meet their obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Settlement Agent is a party involved in the mortgage process, responsible for handling the closing of a real estate transaction, influencing fees due to their actions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Settlement Agent refers to an entity responsible for managing the closing process of a loan, ensuring compliance with various regulations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4a8254e91bb361353c2efd5fd41f17e0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-25a82bf13c8c6a8ef98d1a15a5361ea9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eec7e8fc248456d980c970b75e0fbf41&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-662a2c10d200da7291e0212d33749544&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a39b79f6d626310fd702e88ad4acda2b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-faf7af26dea16d8bcfcc9a3324ded2bc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f639d102461efe890e188cbc182dba52&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e572c9b9bd53e500c5e02283f3230e6b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a6589af60d5cd7b7c6c55232071772b8</data>
