  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Underwriting Standards are the benchmarks used by insurers to assess the acceptability of risks associated with mortgage applications."&lt;SEP&gt;"Underwriting Standards are the criteria that must be met for loan approval, including credit score, debt-to-income ratio, and appraisal requirements for HELOCs."&lt;SEP&gt;"Underwriting Standards are the established criteria used by lenders to evaluate a Borrower’s creditworthiness and eligibility for a loan."</data>
