  <data key="d1">"Closing Date is the date on which a real estate transaction is finalized and funds are transferred, requiring compliance with all title insurance stipulations."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Closing Date is the specific date when all closing documents must be signed by the borrower, marking the finalization of the loan process."&lt;SEP&gt;"Closing Date marks the final point in a loan's transaction where funds are disbursed and ownership is transferred, triggering various fee assessments."</data>
