<node id="&quot;RATE &amp; TERM REFINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Rate &amp; Term Refinance allows homeowners to refinance their existing loans under specific guidelines to potentially lower payments or adjust terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Rate &amp; Term Refinance is a mortgage refinancing option that enables borrowers to change the interest rate or term of their existing loan without taking cash out."&lt;SEP&gt;"Rate &amp; Term Refinance is a type of refinancing that allows borrowers to change the interest rate and/or term of their loan without taking cash out."&lt;SEP&gt;"Rate &amp; Term Refinance is an event in which a borrower refinances their mortgage to adjust the interest rate or loan term without taking cash out."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9b0056b117b540a72b17dd275d006f45&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4849d91ba0d105495fd48b0a77c7c582&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e78a99763ca81ea2755a9310a0e6cc85&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8760dceb193fd7c5f24d24209ee5e31</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 8}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 108}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 482}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CREDIT SCORE VALIDATION REQUIREMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Credit Score Validation Requirements are criteria outlining the minimum credit scores needed from borrowers to ensure their eligibility for loans, including HomeReady."&lt;SEP&gt;"Credit Score Validation Requirements are the criteria that determine the acceptable benchmark credit scores needed for mortgage loan qualification."&lt;SEP&gt;"Credit Score Validation Requirements are the standards that lenders use to determine the minimum acceptable credit scores for borrowers."</data>
