<node id="&quot;SINGLE FINANCED MORTGAGE INSURANCE (SFMI)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Single Financed Mortgage Insurance (SFMI) is a type of insurance policy designed for financing multiple properties under a single policy."&lt;SEP&gt;"Single Financed Mortgage Insurance is a type of mortgage insurance that can be financed directly into the mortgage loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"Single Financed Mortgage Insurance (SFMI) is a type of mortgage insurance designed to protect lenders in case of borrower default, consolidating coverage into a single premium."&lt;SEP&gt;"Single Financed Mortgage Insurance (SFMI) is a type of mortgage insurance that involves coverage for individual loans and is a requirement for specific financing options."&lt;SEP&gt;"Single Financed Mortgage Insurance is a specific type of mortgage insurance mentioned in eligibility discussions for financing options."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-304d9428ac3f0546fe2c83618fb493e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ca1bd5008b14dffd1f24d89ce07116f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd0c5c971a5a48bbded5da8b256a175c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fbc754fc30ff722a8fee09393323a03d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f08c1849f1a1e52584c06fc2286667f</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 11}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 137}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 573}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LENDER PAID MORTGAGE INSURANCE (LPMI)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Lender Paid Mortgage Insurance (LPMI) is a form of mortgage insurance where the lender pays the insurance premium, allowing borrowers to avoid upfront costs and sometimes making the loan more accessible for home purchasing."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lender Paid Mortgage Insurance (LPMI) is a method where the lender pays the mortgage insurance premium instead of the borrower, usually resulting in a higher interest rate."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lender Paid Mortgage Insurance is a form of mortgage insurance paid by the lender on behalf of the borrower, often resulting in a higher interest rate."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lender Paid Mortgage Insurance (LPMI) is an insurance policy that protects lenders against loan defaults, typically funded by the lender rather than the borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lender Paid Mortgage Insurance (LPMI) is an insurance policy that protects the lender against default by the borrower, and is paid for by the lender rather than the borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lender Paid Mortgage Insurance (LPMI) is mortgage insurance that is paid by the lender rather than the borrower, allowing the borrower to avoid upfront costs."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lender Paid Mortgage Insurance is a type of mortgage insurance where the lender pays the premium instead of the borrower, affecting the loan's terms."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-304d9428ac3f0546fe2c83618fb493e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ca1bd5008b14dffd1f24d89ce07116f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd0c5c971a5a48bbded5da8b256a175c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6de80860713bbcd40afb3b3b69d1945f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fbc754fc30ff722a8fee09393323a03d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7f44da442f8034719cd2f26599196416&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f08c1849f1a1e52584c06fc2286667f</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 11}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 137}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 573}]</data>
</node>
