  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Federal Housing Finance Agency (FHFA) is a U.S. government agency responsible for overseeing the housing finance system, including setting annual limits for high-cost areas."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Federal Housing Finance Agency (FHFA) is a U.S. government agency responsible for overseeing the housing finance system, including setting annual limits for high-cost areas."</data>
