<node id="&quot;INVESTOR GUIDELINES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Investor Guidelines are specific instructions and requirements set by investors that lenders must follow to ensure compliance in loan programs."&lt;SEP&gt;"Investor Guidelines are the rules and criteria that govern how mortgage-backed securities and similar investments are structured and offered."&lt;SEP&gt;"Investor Guidelines are standards that govern the sale and management of mortgage loans, ensuring compliance during transactions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Investor Guidelines are the standards and requirements that Mortgage Loans must comply with to be considered acceptable investments by private investors or agencies."&lt;SEP&gt;"Investor Guidelines refer to the policies and procedures that govern the registration, underwriting, closing, and sale of Mortgage Loans to Flagstar, ensuring compliance with relevant standards."&lt;SEP&gt;"Investor Guidelines refer to the principles and standards set forth for the underwriting and servicing of mortgage loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"Investor Guidelines refer to the standards set by investors for underwriting and servicing mortgage loans, ensuring compliance and risk assessment."&lt;SEP&gt;"Investor Guidelines refers to the specific criteria and standards that govern mortgage loans and related transactions, ensuring compliance and risk management."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b2fbf5161dc5c6670b7fd7548d822a73&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2292650099ea1cdf5881f79ed28d3cfc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fc9e5323cf1da974f74cdcad0aebf55d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8552c190e01cd6c887d540f68372a1a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-29e2bb5014fcbf1d6e95d3ac5b1702bc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a40aeeabaca2a4a97b1dd8ad35ab142e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fdba698a5ff7dd259797f2300b8f4759</data>
