<node id="&quot;GIFT/GRANT PROGRAMS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Gift or Grant programs provide funds for down payments without the need for repayment; they are typically issued by government agencies or nonprofit organizations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-437272f81cc4575a4fa57f55ce8d121c</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 12}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 149}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BELOW MARKET RATE PROGRAMS (BMR)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Below Market Rate Programs are loans reviewed similarly to Community Seconds, generally involving non-monetary notes and mortgages."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-437272f81cc4575a4fa57f55ce8d121c</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 12}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 144}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 585}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 834}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INDIVIDUAL DEVELOPMENT ACCOUNT (IDA)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Individual Development Accounts are grant programs that may or may not have recapture provisions, affecting their categorization as Community Seconds."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-437272f81cc4575a4fa57f55ce8d121c</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 12}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 149}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DOWN PAYMENT ASSISTANCE PROGRAMS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Down Payment Assistance Programs are designed to help individuals obtain funding for down payment and closing costs associated with home purchases."&lt;SEP&gt;"Down Payment Assistance Programs are initiatives designed to offer support to borrowers in financing their down payments on homes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Down Payment Assistance Programs are initiatives that provide financial assistance to homebuyers for covering down payments and closing costs for their mortgages."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7de83587d951a7ec74fcb94d81a7df71&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-437272f81cc4575a4fa57f55ce8d121c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fdba698a5ff7dd259797f2300b8f4759</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 12}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 144}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 586}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;HOUSING PROGRAM&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Housing Program refers to initiatives designed to assist individuals in securing affordable housing through various forms of assistance."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-437272f81cc4575a4fa57f55ce8d121c</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 12}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 148}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 599}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DPA&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"DPA stands for Down Payment Assistance, which refers to funds provided to cover the initial costs of purchasing a home."&lt;SEP&gt;"DPA stands for Down-payment Assistance, which encompasses programs aimed at helping home buyers with the initial payment required to secure a mortgage."&lt;SEP&gt;"DPA, or Down Payment Assistance, represents a range of financial assistance solutions provided to homebuyers to lower the barrier to homeownership."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-30274d85a38f031223e249148db13d86&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-12641cd1a4c93cf93c1aa31082da47b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-437272f81cc4575a4fa57f55ce8d121c</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 12}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 147}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LENDER PARTICIPATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"NORMAL_ENTITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Lender Participation involves lenders meeting participation requirements to be approved for various down payment assistance programs, including training and agreement to guidelines."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lender Participation refers to the requirement for any lender involved in the program to obtain broker/correspondent approval."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-437272f81cc4575a4fa57f55ce8d121c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-82a675c08f3177636cb84734aead2aea</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 12}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 150}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 607}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PROGRAM UNDERWRITING GUIDELINES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Program Underwriting Guidelines refer to the rules and standards that lenders must follow when assessing applications for down payment assistance programs."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-437272f81cc4575a4fa57f55ce8d121c</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 10}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 136}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 571}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;GOVERNMENT ENTITIES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Government Entities include states, counties, cities, and agencies that can provide down payment assistance as part of their housing programs."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-437272f81cc4575a4fa57f55ce8d121c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NON-PROFIT AGENCIES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Non-Profit Agencies are verified organizations that can provide down payment assistance and require a 501(c)3 letter for verification."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-437272f81cc4575a4fa57f55ce8d121c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ELIGIBLE PROGRAM PROVIDERS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Eligible Program Providers are entities, including government organizations and verified non-profits, authorized to offer down payment assistance services."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-437272f81cc4575a4fa57f55ce8d121c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INELIGIBLE PROGRAM PROVIDERS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Ineligible Program Providers include entities such as sellers, brokers, and builders that cannot fund down payment assistance programs."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-437272f81cc4575a4fa57f55ce8d121c</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 12}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 149}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LOAN AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Loan Agreement refers to the documentation signed at closing for down payment assistance loans, which outlines terms and conditions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-437272f81cc4575a4fa57f55ce8d121c</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 11}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 142}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 582}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DEED OF TRUST/MORTGAGE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Deed of Trust or Mortgage is a legal document that secures a loan by transferring the property title to a third party until the loan is repaid."&lt;SEP&gt;"Deed of Trust/Mortgage is a legal document that secures loans against the property involved in down payment assistance programs."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-30274d85a38f031223e249148db13d86&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-437272f81cc4575a4fa57f55ce8d121c</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 12}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 151}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 611}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RETENTION AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Retention Agreement is a document filed to ensure that the borrower maintains residency in the property for a set duration, acting as a lien."&lt;SEP&gt;"A Retention Agreement is a legal document that ensures that a borrower remains in the property for a specified time as a condition of the loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"Retention Agreement pertains to clauses within certain loan programs that specify conditions under which loans may be forgiven or repaid."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-30274d85a38f031223e249148db13d86&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-437272f81cc4575a4fa57f55ce8d121c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-82a675c08f3177636cb84734aead2aea</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 32}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 257}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DOCUMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"NORMAL_ENTITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Document refers to the PDF file outlining the procedures for loan registration and locking a loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"Document refers to the written material containing guidelines for down payment assistance programs and instructions on their administration."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Document refers to the PDF titled 'SFMI and Lender Paid Mortgage Insurance (LPMI) Matrix', which contains information regarding various mortgage insurance offerings and guidelines."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b722d926669aa7676c36ecbb75a4a233&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-437272f81cc4575a4fa57f55ce8d121c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6de80860713bbcd40afb3b3b69d1945f</data>
