  <data key="d2">chunk-437272f81cc4575a4fa57f55ce8d121c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;UNDERWRITER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Underwriter is a party responsible for evaluating and approving mortgage loans based on various criteria and risk assessment."&lt;SEP&gt;"Underwriter refers to the individual responsible for assessing loan applications and ensuring guidelines compliance in down payment assistance programs."&lt;SEP&gt;"Underwriter is a professional who assesses loan applications and determines whether to approve or deny a borrower's request for financing."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2292650099ea1cdf5881f79ed28d3cfc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca3069902295dcf5b2b505753d7623f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-437272f81cc4575a4fa57f55ce8d121c</data>
