  <data key="d2">chunk-437272f81cc4575a4fa57f55ce8d121c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CASH BACK PROHIBITION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Cash Back Prohibition refers to the rule that disallows returning funds to the borrower in certain down payment assistance transactions, particularly in Community Seconds."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-437272f81cc4575a4fa57f55ce8d121c</data>
