</node>
<node id="&quot;DEED RESTRICTION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LEGAL TERM"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Deed Restriction is a legal document that restricts the ways a property can be used, often associated with down payment assistance loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"Deed Restriction refers to legally binding requirements placed upon a property that restrict its use in order to meet specific program criteria."&lt;SEP&gt;"Deed restriction refers to conditions placed on a property regarding its use, typically to ensure it remains a primary residence and to limit resale price."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7de83587d951a7ec74fcb94d81a7df71&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-75126918f0820581a7405cbda1984bbe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-437272f81cc4575a4fa57f55ce8d121c</data>
