<node id="&quot;LOAN NUMBER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"NORMAL_ENTITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Loan Number is a unique identifier assigned to each loan application, used for tracking and managing the repayment process."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loan Number is a unique identifier assigned to a loan for the purpose of tracking it within the lending system."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loan Number is a unique identifier assigned to a mortgage transaction, used to track its status throughout the underwriting process."&lt;SEP&gt;"A loan number is a unique identifier assigned to a mortgage loan, used for tracking and processing purposes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loan Number is a unique identifier assigned to each loan application for tracking and referencing purposes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loan Number is a unique identifier assigned to each loan, critical for tracking and management purposes."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c8b4e28d440c820b5ce2e89c08cd1b75&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-803513d6e632c311aec48592cb79b4f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-25a82bf13c8c6a8ef98d1a15a5361ea9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-faf7af26dea16d8bcfcc9a3324ded2bc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-33b3eb25dce726e663be548f3764d0e0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fdba698a5ff7dd259797f2300b8f4759</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 22}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 222}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RE-SUBORDINATION&quot;">
