<node id="&quot;FHA UNDERWRITING GUIDELINES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"FHA Underwriting Guidelines are the established criteria that govern how FHA-insured loans should be evaluated and processed by lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"FHA Underwriting Guidelines are the standards set for assessing the eligibility of borrowers and properties for FHA-insured loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"FHA Underwriting Guidelines detail the procedures and criteria lenders must follow when assessing loan applications for FHA insurance."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6a2fe6bde08b88616e4d4932fe5f5e5c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b0056b117b540a72b17dd275d006f45&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fdba698a5ff7dd259797f2300b8f4759</data>
