<node id="&quot;SOFT SECOND&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Soft Second refers to a mortgage financing option that allows for low-interest or forgivable second mortgages, typically used in certain regions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Soft Second refers to a type of financing that does not require repayment as long as certain conditions are met, aiding in home purchase affordability."&lt;SEP&gt;"Soft Second, similar to Affordable/Community Second, typically refers to financial assistance programs in the Eastern United States for home purchases."</data>
