<node id="&quot;EQUITY SHARE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Equity Share refers to a financial arrangement where an agency or lender shares in the appreciation or equity position of a property when a loan is paid off."&lt;SEP&gt;"Equity Share refers to the percentage of ownership interest in a property that is shared between multiple parties or stakeholders."</data>
