<node id="&quot;AGENCY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"AGENCY refers to the organizations involved in the provision of high loan amount programs, showcasing various loan types and conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Agency refers to a governmental or institutional organization involved in the oversight or securitization of Mortgage Loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"Agency refers to an unspecified entity that may make demands related to mortgage loans held by Flagstar."&lt;SEP&gt;"Agency refers to any third-party organization involved in the mortgage loan process, including but not limited to lenders, investors, or regulatory entities."&lt;SEP&gt;"An Agency in this context refers to an entity involved in providing financial assistance or support for home purchases."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b75506a7175a05b7c26944fe1aa93eda&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-30274d85a38f031223e249148db13d86&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2fbf5161dc5c6670b7fd7548d822a73&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fc9e5323cf1da974f74cdcad0aebf55d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-132b3969367ecce54c6730fb570430ea</data>
