<node id="&quot;SELLER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Seller is an individual or entity that offers a property for sale in the real estate market."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Seller is the individual or entity transferring ownership of the property and is involved in the closing transaction."&lt;SEP&gt;"Seller is a party obligated to reimburse Flagstar for losses, damages, and claims related to Mortgage Loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"Seller is an entity that has executed a Loan Purchase Agreement with Flagstar and intends to sell Mortgage Loans to Flagstar in the secondary market."&lt;SEP&gt;"Seller refers to the individual or entity providing mortgage loans and is required to comply with representations and warranties as detailed in the agreement with Flagstar."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Seller is a party involved in the mortgage loan transaction, responsible for delivering required documents and complying with loan terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Seller is an individual or entity involved in the sale of the mortgage loan to Flagstar, responsible for representing the accuracy of the information related to the loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Seller is an individual or entity that provides funds to the Borrower in exchange for loan payments and/or collateral."&lt;SEP&gt;"Seller refers to the individual or entity who is selling a property, playing a crucial role in property transactions and financing."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5c2f4d692a0955d46073163734c23b26&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-30274d85a38f031223e249148db13d86&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2fbf5161dc5c6670b7fd7548d822a73&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2292650099ea1cdf5881f79ed28d3cfc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fc9e5323cf1da974f74cdcad0aebf55d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8552c190e01cd6c887d540f68372a1a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-132b3969367ecce54c6730fb570430ea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f639d102461efe890e188cbc182dba52&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a6589af60d5cd7b7c6c55232071772b8</data>
