<node id="&quot;HOME POSSIBLE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Home Possible is Freddie Mac's community lending program that offers flexibility and options to meet various borrowers' home financing needs."&lt;SEP&gt;"Home Possible is a loan program designed to provide affordable mortgage options to qualifying borrowers."&lt;SEP&gt;"Home Possible is a mortgage product designed for primary residence purchases and rate/term refinancing, offering varying loan-to-value ratios depending on property type."&lt;SEP&gt;"Home Possible is a mortgage product designed to assist buyers by providing options for lower down payments and flexible sources of funds in compliance with Freddie Mac guidelines."&lt;SEP&gt;"Home Possible is a mortgage product designed to help low-to-moderate income borrowers achieve homeownership, with specific eligibility criteria."&lt;SEP&gt;"Home Possible is a mortgage product offered by Freddie Mac, designed to help first-time homebuyers qualify for loans with lower down payments and income requirements."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-fd698c420bb978f364630c455d2abf4a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a72060811d2de811b03ec94848dcad94&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-22d3a76e6c1f50526ac6e8ed759d2710&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a403e885ce18327dd600e7521b66a2e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d0459e9b5b3885ad40728e4e0af01123&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a582fe17fe66be19c89056580dbaccc</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 75}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 383}]</data>
</node>
