<node id="&quot;MORTGAGE FILE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"NORMAL_ENTITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Mortgage File is the collection of documents, agreements, and information maintained by lenders during the mortgage lending process."&lt;SEP&gt;"The mortgage file contains all pertinent documentation and information related to a borrower's application, including financial statements and the credit report."</data>
