<node id="&quot;TLTV&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MATHEMATICS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"TLTV, or Total Loan-to-Value ratio, incorporates all loans secured by a property and is an important measure for assessing the risk of the mortgage."</data>
