<node id="&quot;HTLTV&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MATHEMATICS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"HTLTV, or Home Equity Loan-to-Value ratio, measures the total of all loans that a borrower has against their home and is used to determine borrowing eligibility."</data>
