  <data key="d1">"Email is a communication method used to deliver price indications and updates to customers regarding mortgage products."&lt;SEP&gt;"Email is a method of communication used by the Right of Rescission Department to manage notifications and confirmations regarding loan cancellations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Email refers to the method by which borrowers receive important rate indications and notifications from Flagstar Bank."&lt;SEP&gt;"Email refers to electronic communication, specifically for customer service inquiries and support as indicated in the contact information."</data>
