<node id="&quot;INVESTMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"INDUSTRY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Investment in the document refers to properties or properties used for generating income, with specific loan terms presented."&lt;SEP&gt;"Investment indicates a sector related to financial activities involving assets like real estate described in the financial figures."&lt;SEP&gt;"Investment pertains to the sector involving financial ventures in real estate, emphasizing appraisal considerations for profitability."&lt;SEP&gt;"Investment properties are real estate assets purchased for rental income or capital appreciation, typically with stricter lending criteria."&lt;SEP&gt;"Investment refers to a mortgage product tailored for properties purchased as investments, detailing specific lending criteria and refinances."&lt;SEP&gt;"Investment refers to the sector involved in managing, buying, or selling assets with the expectation of generating a return, relevant in the context of purchase and refinance options."&lt;SEP&gt;"Investment refers to properties purchased for rental income or resale, distinct from primary residences or second homes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Investment refers to the sector related to acquiring assets with the expectation of generating income or capital gains."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b75506a7175a05b7c26944fe1aa93eda&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc82728609090b729fd7dc0076f92990&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f28aa24c80be0008755d728b5169b82&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d8141599e488921f66fe766d03ed3bf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f463e80705c368f56db31d1f00a4efe7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-42979d97c1c73c1b28eac498c9aee682&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dcbf025ce89296c2fe585617d648039b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-94010f4bdf2ece06575cf539272b8b45</data>
