  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Expiration Date indicates the deadline after which loan commitments must either be fulfilled or undergo a relock process."&lt;SEP&gt;"Expiration Date is a crucial concept denoting the deadline by which lock extensions and relocks need to be managed."&lt;SEP&gt;"Expiration Date refers to the date by which the lock must be renegotiated, set to 30 days from the float-down event."</data>
