<node id="&quot;RELOCK&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Relock is an event that occurs when a lock commitment has expired or has reached the maximum number of extensions, requiring the borrower to re-establish a loan lock."&lt;SEP&gt;"Relock refers to the process required when a previously agreed-upon loan lock has expired, often resulting in price adjustments."</data>
