<node id="&quot;MARKETING FEE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Marketing Fee is assessed to address discrepancies between the loan approval parameters and how the loan was closed, reflecting a financial adjustment strategy."&lt;SEP&gt;"Marketing Fee is assessed to adjust discrepancies between approved loan parameters and the parameters under which the loan was actually delivered."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Marketing Fee is a charge that can be assessed if loans with unresolved issues are returned to the correspondent after the expiration period."&lt;SEP&gt;"Marketing Fee is assessed to correct discrepancies between current market price parameters relevant to loan processing."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c0a48a482a40438f89f44e8758608310&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f639d102461efe890e188cbc182dba52&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fff6b81ef8a66ecc49bb49ef81869a5f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-73179b73b8a774ced8d562931d514540</data>
