<node id="&quot;BUSINESS DAYS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Business Days are defined by Flagstar Bank, N.A. as Monday through Saturday, excluding Sundays and legal holidays, as stated for the purpose of calculating the rescission period."&lt;SEP&gt;"Business Days are the days that lenders and financial institutions operate, typically excluding weekends and holidays, affecting processing times."&lt;SEP&gt;"Business Days denotes the working days during which financial transactions and processes are considered valid for actions like loan closing."&lt;SEP&gt;"Business days refer to the timeframe in which certain loan processes must occur, affecting service setup for HELOCs."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6f08c1849f1a1e52584c06fc2286667f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-354a12aa9905401272b6367dbd3c30cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fff6b81ef8a66ecc49bb49ef81869a5f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc8b7db5bf49f6eb8f1e8daa83b6b361</data>
