  <data key="d2">chunk-fff6b81ef8a66ecc49bb49ef81869a5f</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FLOAT-DOWN RENEGOTIATION POLICY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Float-Down Renegotiation Policy is designed to help customers manage interest rate fluctuations by allowing eligible loans to renegotiate their locked rates under specific conditions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-af318020d8f16430d1a60515a789d41d</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 83}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 422}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LOCK STATUS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Lock Status is a financial term indicating the state of an interest rate being locked in for a loan, determining eligibility for renegotiation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lock status refers to the current state of a loan's interest rate being locked in, which is relevant for determining eligibility for the float-down renegotiation."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-af318020d8f16430d1a60515a789d41d</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 83}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 422}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ELIGIBLE LOANS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Eligible loans are those in valid lock status that can participate in the float-down renegotiation, subject to specific criteria including approval conditions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-af318020d8f16430d1a60515a789d41d</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 83}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 422}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FLOAT-DOWN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Float-Down is a financial technology process allowing customers to adjust their locked interest rates based on market fluctuations, enabling better financial management."&lt;SEP&gt;"Float-Down is an event where eligible loans can renegotiate their locked interest rates to potentially lower rates under specified conditions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-af318020d8f16430d1a60515a789d41d</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 83}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 420}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INTEREST RATE ENVIRONMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
