<node id="&quot;FLOAT-DOWN RENEGOTIATION EXAMPLES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Float-Down Renegotiation Examples illustrate specific scenarios that demonstrate how the float-down process works with interest rates and pricing."</data>
