  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Association Fees are charges associated with property ownership in common interest developments, included in the debt ratio for loan assessments."&lt;SEP&gt;"Association Fees are charges paid by homeowners to a homeowners' association for community services, which must be included in the debt ratio calculation for a HELOC."</data>
