  <data key="d1">"Appraisal Management is a team responsible for assigning vendors, reviewing appraisals, and ensuring the Jumbo Desk Review process is followed."&lt;SEP&gt;"Appraisal Management refers to a system used for ordering appraisals for HELOC and mortgage transactions to ensure appropriate property valuations."</data>
