  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Administrative Fee is a charge for services provided during the underwriting of loans, applicable in multiple contexts including FHA and VA loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Fee is a type of charge outlined in the HELOC context for processing transactions, noting that it is not assessed on HELOCs."</data>
