<node id="&quot;FEE SUMMARY PAGE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Fee Summary page is a document required in the HELOC process detailing the various fees associated with the loan transaction."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4a8254e91bb361353c2efd5fd41f17e0</data>
