<node id="&quot;FLOOD CERTIFICATION FEE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Flood Certification Fee is a specific fee charged for determining if a property is in a flood zone, applicable to various loan types."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Flood Certification Fee is a charge associated with certifying whether a property is located in a flood zone in connection with loan approvals."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Flood Certification Fee is a fee charged when determining if a property is located in a flood hazard area, impacting the approval of HELOCs."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Flood Certification Fee is assessed to determine whether a property is located in a designated Special Flood Hazard Area."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-fe4b9e8302b8de2d8d692106e4e284ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4a8254e91bb361353c2efd5fd41f17e0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da6a7f245e88177bac6b85d5f808ebd3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a39b79f6d626310fd702e88ad4acda2b</data>
