  <data key="d0">"FEE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Recording Fee is a cost associated with the documentation and formal registration of the mortgage/security instrument in HELOC transactions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Recording Fee pertains to the costs for recording the mortgage or security instruments related to the HELOC transaction."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4a8254e91bb361353c2efd5fd41f17e0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a39b79f6d626310fd702e88ad4acda2b</data>
