  <data key="d0">"FEE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Credit Report Fee is a charge related to obtaining a borrower's credit report, necessary for assessing eligibility for a Standalone HELOC."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Credit Report Fee may only be charged on standalone HELOCs for obtaining a credit report, which is excluded in concurrent HELOCs."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4a8254e91bb361353c2efd5fd41f17e0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a39b79f6d626310fd702e88ad4acda2b</data>
