<node id="&quot;APPRAISAL FEE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FEE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Appraisal Fee may be required for standalone HELOCs when a collateral evaluation cannot be used, contributing to the overall cost of obtaining a HELOC."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Appraisal Fee pertains to the charge for obtaining a property appraisal needed in the evaluation for a HELOC."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4a8254e91bb361353c2efd5fd41f17e0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a39b79f6d626310fd702e88ad4acda2b</data>
