<node id="&quot;PROCESSING FEE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Processing Fee is a charge imposed by the lender for handling the administrative tasks associated with setting up and managing a loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Processing Fee is the cost associated with processing services performed by an independent third-party firm in a Standalone HELOC transaction."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Processing Fee may be charged for services performed by third-party firms not affiliated with the customer originating the HELOC."&lt;SEP&gt;"Processing Fee refers to charges incurred during the handling of loans and associated invoices, typically assessed per invoice as part of administrative costs."</data>
