<node id="&quot;HELOCS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"HELOCs, or Home Equity Lines of Credit, are equity-based loans that have specific terms and penalties if paid off early within 180 days of initial disbursement."&lt;SEP&gt;"HELOCs, or Home Equity Lines of Credit, are financial products that allow homeowners to borrow against the equity in their homes, with various conditions and fees associated with their use."&lt;SEP&gt;"HELOCs, or Home Equity Lines of Credit, refer to a type of loan that allows borrowers to use their home equity as collateral, associated with various fees and administrative guidelines."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c0a48a482a40438f89f44e8758608310&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bf2d9f6b5b471373ca78f75c11d02725&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a39b79f6d626310fd702e88ad4acda2b</data>
