  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Concurrent HELOC refers to a home equity line of credit that is processed alongside another mortgage, which impacts the associated fees and appraisal requirements."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a39b79f6d626310fd702e88ad4acda2b</data>
