<node id="&quot;REGULATION Z&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Regulation Z implements the federal Truth in Lending Law, outlining consumer protection laws related to credit transactions and the Right of Rescission."&lt;SEP&gt;"Regulation Z is a federal regulation designed to protect consumers by ensuring they are informed about the costs and terms of credit, including key provisions for the Right of Rescission."&lt;SEP&gt;"Regulation Z is a federal regulation that outlines the rights of consumers regarding credit and includes provisions for the right of rescission."&lt;SEP&gt;"Regulation Z is a federal regulation that enforces the Truth in Lending Act, requiring lenders to disclose the terms and costs of loans, particularly those that pertain to high-cost loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"Regulation Z is a federal regulation that requires disclosures about the terms and costs of credit, ensuring consumers are informed about their rights."&lt;SEP&gt;"Regulation Z refers to the federal regulation that requires clear disclosures to consumers about the terms and costs of credit."&lt;SEP&gt;"Regulation Z is a federal law that outlines the requirements for disclosures and consumer protections related to lending."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-dc8b7db5bf49f6eb8f1e8daa83b6b361&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-42d99ce4642f1e6e8c39678043a90b1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-25a82bf13c8c6a8ef98d1a15a5361ea9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8552c190e01cd6c887d540f68372a1a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-faf7af26dea16d8bcfcc9a3324ded2bc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f639d102461efe890e188cbc182dba52</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 31}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 252}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FLAGSTAR BANK, N.A.&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Flagstar Bank, N.A. is a financial institution involved in processing loans, requiring specific documents and procedures for transactions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Flagstar Bank, N.A. is a financial institution involved in the processing of residential mortgage loans and handling requests for waivers of rescissions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Flagstar Bank, N.A. is a financial institution located in Troy, Michigan, providing banking services and managing loan processes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Flagstar Bank, N.A. is a financial institution that has specific requirements regarding the Notice of Right to Cancel and its procedures related to the Right of Rescission."&lt;SEP&gt;"Flagstar Bank, N.A. is a specific entity known as the bank that operates under the name Flagstar, involved in the mortgage loan industry."&lt;SEP&gt;"Flagstar Bank, N.A. is the financial institution involved in the loan process and is responsible for the final endorsement of the loan note."</data>
  <data key="d2">&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2fbf5161dc5c6670b7fd7548d822a73&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc8b7db5bf49f6eb8f1e8daa83b6b361&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-25a82bf13c8c6a8ef98d1a15a5361ea9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-faf7af26dea16d8bcfcc9a3324ded2bc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f5452ea8c1afd9252c54573e518675e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-33b3eb25dce726e663be548f3764d0e0</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 33}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 258}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NOTICE OF RIGHT TO CANCEL&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Notice of Right to Cancel is a document providing borrowers with information regarding their right to rescind a loan transaction."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Notice of Right to Cancel is a document provided to borrowers informing them of their right to rescind a loan transaction involving their primary dwelling."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-faf7af26dea16d8bcfcc9a3324ded2bc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc8b7db5bf49f6eb8f1e8daa83b6b361</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 31}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 249}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 772}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RESCISSION PERIOD&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Rescission Period is the time frame in which borrowers can exercise their Right of Rescission, specifically lasting three business days after a transaction's triggering event."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-dc8b7db5bf49f6eb8f1e8daa83b6b361</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 31}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 250}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LEGAL HOLIDAYS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Legal Holidays include days such as Christmas Day, New Year's Day, and others, which are not counted as business days during the rescission period."&lt;SEP&gt;"Legal Holidays refer to officially recognized days when business operations may be limited, impacting processing timelines for loans."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1afd5d25f6f318da0cbe2e55f0a46af0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc8b7db5bf49f6eb8f1e8daa83b6b361</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 31}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 250}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BORROWER WAIVER OF RIGHT TO RESCIND&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Borrower Waiver of Right to Rescind refers to a consumer's ability to modify or waive their right to rescind a loan under certain limited circumstances as outlined in Regulation Z."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-dc8b7db5bf49f6eb8f1e8daa83b6b361</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 31}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 251}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PERSONAL FINANCIAL EMERGENCY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"NORMAL_ENTITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Personal Financial Emergency is a situation that must be proven by the borrower to waive their right to rescind their loan, evaluated on a case-by-case basis."&lt;SEP&gt;"A personal financial emergency is a situation that triggers a need for immediate financial assistance, which may affect the borrower’s decision-making regarding loan waivers and rescissions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-faf7af26dea16d8bcfcc9a3324ded2bc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc8b7db5bf49f6eb8f1e8daa83b6b361</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 29}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 235}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CONSUMER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A consumer is an individual who borrows money from a lender, as part of obtaining a product such as a loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Consumer is the individual or entity borrowing funds who is entitled to the Right of Rescission under Regulation Z."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1afd5d25f6f318da0cbe2e55f0a46af0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc8b7db5bf49f6eb8f1e8daa83b6b361</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 2}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 43}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 288}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TRIGGERING EVENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Triggering Events are the specific instances that mark the beginning of the rescission period, which include the signing of the Note, and the receipt of the Closing Disclosure and Notice of Right to Cancel."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-dc8b7db5bf49f6eb8f1e8daa83b6b361</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 31}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 250}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 1026.23&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 1026.23 of Regulation Z outlines the specific rights and requirements related to the Right of Rescission, including the duration of the rescission period and the conditions for its validity."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-dc8b7db5bf49f6eb8f1e8daa83b6b361</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 31}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 252}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECURITY INTEREST&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Security Interest refers to the legal claim that a lender has over a borrower's assets, specifically in the context of credit transactions involving the borrower's primary dwelling."&lt;SEP&gt;"Security Interest refers to the legal claim or lien that the lender has on the Borrower's assets as collateral for the loan."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f639d102461efe890e188cbc182dba52&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc8b7db5bf49f6eb8f1e8daa83b6b361</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 2}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 43}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 288}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CLOSED-END TRANSACTIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Closed-End Transactions are credit transactions with a set repayment schedule and a specific end date, where the Right of Rescission applies as outlined by Regulation Z."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-dc8b7db5bf49f6eb8f1e8daa83b6b361</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 31}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 249}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 773}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;OPEN-END TRANSACTIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Open-End Transactions allow borrowers to repeatedly access credit, akin to revolving credit accounts, under which the Right of Rescission may also apply."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-dc8b7db5bf49f6eb8f1e8daa83b6b361</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 31}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 249}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 773}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ACKNOWLEDGMENT LINES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Acknowledgment Lines are the designated sections in the Notice of Right to Cancel where borrowers must sign and date to confirm receipt of the document."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-dc8b7db5bf49f6eb8f1e8daa83b6b361</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 31}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 249}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 772}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LIABILITY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Liability refers to the obligation of Flagstar Bank, N.A. to comply with the Right of Rescission regulations, ensuring that borrowers are informed about their rights."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-dc8b7db5bf49f6eb8f1e8daa83b6b361</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 31}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 251}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BUSINESS UNIT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Business Unit refers to a division within Flagstar Bank that collaborates on decisions regarding borrower waivers of the Right of Rescission."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-dc8b7db5bf49f6eb8f1e8daa83b6b361</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 31}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 251}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MANAGING EXECUTIVES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Managing Executives are senior management members within Flagstar who are involved in decision-making regarding borrower waivers and the application of the Right of Rescission."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-dc8b7db5bf49f6eb8f1e8daa83b6b361</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 31}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 251}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NOTICE OF RIGHT TO RESCIND&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Notice of Right to Rescind is a specific document that informs borrowers of their right to cancel a loan within a designated period."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Notice of Right to Rescind is a legal document that informs borrowers of their right to cancel a credit transaction involving their primary dwelling and outlines the procedures to exercise this right."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-faf7af26dea16d8bcfcc9a3324ded2bc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc8b7db5bf49f6eb8f1e8daa83b6b361</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 41}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 277}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CLOSING DISCLOSURE (CD)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Closing Disclosure (CD) is a standardized form that provides important details about a mortgage loan, including the loan terms, projected payments, and the total closing costs."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-dc8b7db5bf49f6eb8f1e8daa83b6b361</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 33}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 261}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;THREE BUSINESS DAYS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Three Business Days is the timeframe granted to borrowers during which they can exercise their Right of Rescission after receiving necessary disclosures related to a loan."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-dc8b7db5bf49f6eb8f1e8daa83b6b361</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 31}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 250}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TRIGGERING EVENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Triggering Event is one of the key occurrences that starts the rescission period, including the signing of the loan documents or the receipt of pertinent notices."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-dc8b7db5bf49f6eb8f1e8daa83b6b361</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 31}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 250}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CONSUMER'S PRINCIPAL RESIDENCE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Consumer's Principal Residence refers to the primary dwelling of the borrower, which is secured under the terms of the loan and is relevant in the context of the Right of Rescission."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-dc8b7db5bf49f6eb8f1e8daa83b6b361</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 31}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 250}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RESIDENTIAL MORTGAGE TRANSACTIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Residential Mortgage Transactions are types of loans specifically for the purchase or refinance of a borrower's primary residence, subject to specific regulatory guidelines."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-dc8b7db5bf49f6eb8f1e8daa83b6b361</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 31}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 249}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 773}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REFINANCE TRANSACTIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Refinance Transactions involve obtaining a new loan to pay off an existing loan, which may not always fall under the Right of Rescission in certain situations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-dc8b7db5bf49f6eb8f1e8daa83b6b361</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NON-OBLIGATED BORROWERS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Non-Obligated Borrowers are individuals who have an ownership interest in a property but are not responsible for repaying the loan, yet still retain the right to rescind."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-dc8b7db5bf49f6eb8f1e8daa83b6b361</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 31}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 249}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 773}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PROCEDURAL REQUIREMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Procedural Requirements refer to the established steps that lenders must follow to comply with the Right of Rescission, ensuring proper notification to borrowers."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-dc8b7db5bf49f6eb8f1e8daa83b6b361</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 31}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 252}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LENDER REQUIREMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Lender Requirements refer to the obligations that financial institutions must fulfill to ensure compliance with laws related to the Right of Rescission and borrower notifications."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-dc8b7db5bf49f6eb8f1e8daa83b6b361</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 31}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 251}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ACKNOWLEDGMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Acknowledgment is the formal recognition by borrowers of the receipt of the Notice of Right to Cancel, essential for validating the rescission process."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-dc8b7db5bf49f6eb8f1e8daa83b6b361</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 31}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 251}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;WAIVING RIGHT TO RESCIND&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Waiving Right to Rescind describes the actions taken by a borrower to give up their right to cancel a loan agreement under specific conditions as regulated by law."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-dc8b7db5bf49f6eb8f1e8daa83b6b361</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FINANCIAL EMERGENCY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"NORMAL_ENTITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Financial Emergency is an unforeseen situation that may compel a borrower to request immediate access to loan funds, potentially waiving the Right of Rescission."&lt;SEP&gt;"A financial emergency refers to an unexpected situation that requires immediate financial assistance, which may affect a borrower's decision to waive the right of rescission."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-faf7af26dea16d8bcfcc9a3324ded2bc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc8b7db5bf49f6eb8f1e8daa83b6b361</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 31}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 251}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TROY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Troy is a city in Michigan where Flagstar Bank's Right of Rescission Department is located, and is significant for the processing of loan rescissions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Troy is a city in Michigan, serving as the location for Flagstar Bank's offices."&lt;SEP&gt;"Troy is a city located in Michigan, serving as the address for Flagstar Bank, N.A. and relevant for loan transactions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-faf7af26dea16d8bcfcc9a3324ded2bc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-33b3eb25dce726e663be548f3764d0e0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-25a82bf13c8c6a8ef98d1a15a5361ea9</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 33}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 258}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;WAIVER OF RESCISSION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Waiver of Rescission is a process where borrowers can request a modification to their right to rescind a loan under certain circumstances."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-faf7af26dea16d8bcfcc9a3324ded2bc</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 31}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 249}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 772}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FUNDING DEPARTMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Funding Department is a division within Flagstar Bank that oversees the processing and management of funds for loan transactions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Funding Department at Flagstar Bank is responsible for processing all residential mortgage loan rescissions and ensuring compliance with related regulations."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Funding Department is a division within Flagstar Bank responsible for managing loan approvals and related inquiries."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-faf7af26dea16d8bcfcc9a3324ded2bc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-33b3eb25dce726e663be548f3764d0e0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-25a82bf13c8c6a8ef98d1a15a5361ea9</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 22}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 219}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 756}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RESCISSION DEPARTMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Rescission Department at Flagstar Bank manages the review and determination of requests related to loan rescissions, escalating issues to Legal and Compliance as necessary."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-faf7af26dea16d8bcfcc9a3324ded2bc</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 41}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 278}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EXECUTIVE AND SENIOR MANAGEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Executive and senior management at Flagstar Bank are responsible for making decisions on accepting waivers or modifications to loan agreements."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-faf7af26dea16d8bcfcc9a3324ded2bc</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 41}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 279}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MORTGAGE BROKER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Mortgage Broker is an intermediary who helps borrowers find loans and communicates decisions regarding waivers or rescissions to them."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-faf7af26dea16d8bcfcc9a3324ded2bc</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 41}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 279}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CLOSING PACKAGES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Closing packages are documentation sets that include necessary information and forms required for closing a mortgage loan transaction."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-faf7af26dea16d8bcfcc9a3324ded2bc</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 41}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 277}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;POST-CLOSING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Post-closing refers to the phase after a mortgage loan has been closed, where the documents are reviewed for compliance and accuracy."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-faf7af26dea16d8bcfcc9a3324ded2bc</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 22}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 219}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 756}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;WRITTEN REQUEST&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"NORMAL_ENTITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A written request is a formal document submitted by a borrower to exercise the right of rescission, detailing their intention to rescind the loan agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-faf7af26dea16d8bcfcc9a3324ded2bc</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 41}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 277}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;20-CALENDAR DAY TIMELINE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The 20-calendar day timeline is a regulatory requirement for creditors to fulfill their responsibilities to borrowers after a rescission is requested."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-faf7af26dea16d8bcfcc9a3324ded2bc</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 33}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 258}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EXECUTED NOTICE OF RIGHT TO CANCEL&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The executed Notice of Right to Cancel is a signed document by the borrower indicating their decision to rescind the loan, which must be submitted to the lender."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-faf7af26dea16d8bcfcc9a3324ded2bc</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 31}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 252}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RIGHT TO RESCIND&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"NORMAL_ENTITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Right to Rescind refers to the legal right of borrowers to cancel a loan transaction within a specified period, providing them with an option to reconsider the loan."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-faf7af26dea16d8bcfcc9a3324ded2bc</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 2}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 43}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 285}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 779}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RESCINDED LOAN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"NORMAL_ENTITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A rescinded loan is a loan that has been canceled by the borrower exercising their right of rescission, resulting in the cancellation of the loan agreement and its terms."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-faf7af26dea16d8bcfcc9a3324ded2bc</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 22}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 222}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RESIDENTIAL MORTGAGE LOANS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Residential mortgage loans are loans secured by real estate, typically used by individuals to purchase homes."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-faf7af26dea16d8bcfcc9a3324ded2bc</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 31}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 249}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 772}]</data>
</node>
