  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"FHA Total Mortgage Scorecard is an automated underwriting system that assesses the creditworthiness of borrowers applying for FHA loans based on various factors."&lt;SEP&gt;"FHA Total Mortgage Scorecard is an automated underwriting system used to evaluate the creditworthiness of FHA loan applicants based on various credit factors."&lt;SEP&gt;"The FHA Total Mortgage Scorecard is a system used for underwriting loan applications to evaluate the eligibility of borrowers for FHA loans."</data>
