  <data key="d1">"HUD Handbook 4000.1 contains guidelines and requirements for FHA loans, including eligibility criteria for borrowers and properties."&lt;SEP&gt;"HUD Handbook 4000.1 contains the guidelines for FHA loans and is a reference for underwriting and loan eligibility requirements."&lt;SEP&gt;"HUD Handbook 4000.1 is a guideline document for the Federal Housing Administration that outlines procedures and requirements related to loans and housing financing."&lt;SEP&gt;"HUD Handbook 4000.1 is the comprehensive guide outlining the guidelines and policies related to FHA loans and mortgage insurance."</data>
