</node>
<node id="&quot;SALES ALLOWANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Sales Allowance is contributed funds that can be used exclusively toward closing costs/prepaid expenses, repairs, or mortgage reductions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sales allowance refers to any credits or contributions provided to reduce costs associated with the closing of an FHA loan transaction."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f5d10b59eabaab0b4bdac98f88233ce6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a2fe6bde08b88616e4d4932fe5f5e5c</data>
