  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A 10-year mortgage is a fixed-rate mortgage option available under the FHA program, offering a set repayment period for borrowers."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f5d10b59eabaab0b4bdac98f88233ce6</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;15-YEAR MORTGAGE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A 15-year mortgage is one of the fixed-rate product options under the FHA loan program, providing borrowers with a medium-term financing solution."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f5d10b59eabaab0b4bdac98f88233ce6</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;20-YEAR MORTGAGE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A 20-year mortgage is a type of FHA loan that allows borrowers to repay their mortgage over a two-decade term."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f5d10b59eabaab0b4bdac98f88233ce6</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;25-YEAR MORTGAGE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A 25-year mortgage option under the FHA program provides a longer repayment period, balancing monthly payments with total interest paid."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f5d10b59eabaab0b4bdac98f88233ce6</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;30-YEAR MORTGAGE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
