  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Community Bank/Credit Union Program refers to a financial program that offers standard administrative fees for originators in community banks or credit unions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Community Bank/Credit Union Program is a loan origination program specifically tailored for community banks and credit unions to facilitate financing for their clients."</data>
