  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Tax Service Fee is a fee for services related to taxation information required for processing conforming and non-conforming loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Tax Service Fee is a charge related to servicing tax-related matters for conforming and non-conforming loans."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-fe4b9e8302b8de2d8d692106e4e284ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da6a7f245e88177bac6b85d5f808ebd3</data>
