<node id="&quot;TAXING AUTHORITY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Taxing Authority refers to the government body responsible for tax collection and penalties concerning taxes that are not paid on time."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Taxing Authority refers to government bodies responsible for collecting taxes and managing tax-related matters for properties within their jurisdiction."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Taxing Authority refers to the governmental body responsible for collecting taxes, relevant in the context of penalties incurred by Flagstar Bank."</data>
