<node id="&quot;ADVERSE ACTION LETTER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"NORMAL_ENTITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Adverse Action Letter is a document issued to inform the borrower of a decision made regarding their loan application that negatively impacts their status."&lt;SEP&gt;"An Adverse Action letter is a formal notification provided to a borrower when a loan application is denied or declined."&lt;SEP&gt;"Adverse Action Letter is a notification sent to inform an applicant of a decision adverse to their loan application, explaining the reasons for denial."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-fe4b9e8302b8de2d8d692106e4e284ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-662a2c10d200da7291e0212d33749544&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da6a7f245e88177bac6b85d5f808ebd3</data>
