<node id="&quot;EARLY LOAN PAYOFF FEE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Early Loan Payoff Fee is a fee charged when a Home Equity Line of Credit (HELOC) is closed within 180 days of disbursement, compensating the Seller."&lt;SEP&gt;"Early Loan Payoff Fee pertains to charges associated with paying off loans before the agreed period, with specific penalties for Conventional, Government, and Non-conforming loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Early Loan Payoff Fee is a charge related to the early repayment of loans, differing by loan type, and applicable during specified periods after funding."</data>
