<node id="&quot;EARLY PAYMENT DEFAULT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Early Payment Default occurs when a borrower becomes 90 days or more delinquent on the first four monthly payments of a loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"Early Payment Default refers to the situation when a borrower fails to make payments on a loan within the specified timeframe, resulting in penalties."&lt;SEP&gt;"Early Payment Default occurs when any of the borrower's first four monthly payments become 90 days or more delinquent, triggering fees for non-delegated and delegated loans."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c0a48a482a40438f89f44e8758608310&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f639d102461efe890e188cbc182dba52&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-662a2c10d200da7291e0212d33749544</data>
