<node id="&quot;LOAN DEFICIENCY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Loan Deficiency refers to circumstances where a loan fails to meet certain standards or criteria, leading to additional fees or requirements, as mentioned in exemptions by funding authorities."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loan Deficiency refers to the situation in which a loan does not meet specific criteria or guidelines set by lending institutions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loan deficiency refers to a situation where a loan falls short of the underwriting standards established by regulators, necessitating waivers or adjustments."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-42d99ce4642f1e6e8c39678043a90b1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f639d102461efe890e188cbc182dba52&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-73179b73b8a774ced8d562931d514540</data>
