<node id="&quot;EXCESSIVE CASH RECEIVED BY BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Excessive Cash Received By Borrower refers to amounts disbursed to a borrower at closing that exceed what was authorized by the lending agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Excessive Cash refers to an overpayment to the borrower at closing that exceeds the amount approved on the Flagstar commitment letter, resulting in a fee assessment."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c0a48a482a40438f89f44e8758608310&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f639d102461efe890e188cbc182dba52</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 2}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 43}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 287}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FAXED FUNDS REQUEST&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Faxed Funds Request is an event where funds are requested for a loan via fax rather than through an online funding request, which incurs an additional fee."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f639d102461efe890e188cbc182dba52</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;HOLDBACK PROCESSING FEE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Holdback Processing Fee is a charge applied to invoices where amounts need to be deducted from loans for collection purposes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Holdback Processing Fee is a processing fee per invoice where funds are required to be deducted from funding or a pipeline for collection."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c0a48a482a40438f89f44e8758608310&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f639d102461efe890e188cbc182dba52</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 2}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 48}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 301}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INITIAL PMI FEE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Initial PMI Fee is a cost related to loans that include private mortgage insurance coverage, charged at the inception of the loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"Initial PMI Fee is the upfront fee associated with Mortgage Insurance required for loans with less than a certain down payment amount."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f639d102461efe890e188cbc182dba52&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-73179b73b8a774ced8d562931d514540</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 2}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 47}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 296}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LATE REQUEST FEE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Late Request Fee is a financial penalty imposed for late submission of fund requests, specifically after a designated cut-off time."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f639d102461efe890e188cbc182dba52</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 2}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 43}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 285}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 779}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MERS SYSTEM&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"MERS System is a digital platform used for the registration and tracking of mortgage loans, as mentioned in relation to fees associated with loans not registered."&lt;SEP&gt;"The MERS System is a database that tracks mortgage loans and ownership of mortgages, facilitating easier transfers of rights and responsibilities."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f639d102461efe890e188cbc182dba52&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-73179b73b8a774ced8d562931d514540</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 2}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 45}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PAIR-OFF FEE BEST EFFORTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Pair-Off Fee Best Efforts is a financial adjustment related to the delivery of loans wherein discrepancies arise between the originally locked pricing and the final delivered pricing."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f639d102461efe890e188cbc182dba52</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MERS NON-REGISTRATION FEE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"MERS Non-Registration Fee is charged for loans not registered within the MERS system, affecting regulatory compliance."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f639d102461efe890e188cbc182dba52</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 2}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 45}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NON-MERS LOAN FEE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Non-MERS Loan Fee applies to loans closed without an assigned Mortgage Identification Number and not drawn on Mortgage Office Manager documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"Non-MERS Loan Fee is a charge for loans that are not registered under the MERS System, indicating additional administration costs."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f639d102461efe890e188cbc182dba52&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-73179b73b8a774ced8d562931d514540</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 2}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 45}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NON-MERS MEMBERSHIP FEE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Non-MERS Membership Fee is charged to accounts that have not renewed their membership in the MERS system, necessitating registration for compliance."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f639d102461efe890e188cbc182dba52</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 2}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 45}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SINGLE LOAN WAIVER FEE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Single Loan Waiver Fee is a specific charge applied when exceptions are made for a loan deficiency, approved by Fannie Mae or Freddie Mac."&lt;SEP&gt;"Single Loan Waiver Fee is a specific fee associated with exceptions approved for loans that do not meet certain criteria, helping mitigate lender risk."&lt;SEP&gt;"Single Loan Waiver Fee is imposed when a loan deficiency is acknowledged and requires an exception from Fannie Mae or Freddie Mac."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-42d99ce4642f1e6e8c39678043a90b1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f639d102461efe890e188cbc182dba52&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-73179b73b8a774ced8d562931d514540</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 66}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 365}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ADDITIONAL UNDERWRITING FEE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FINANCIAL TERM"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Additional Underwriting Fee is a charge applied to loans requiring further assessment due to discrepancies in documentation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Additional Underwriting Fee is a cost incurred for further evaluation and processing of a loan application beyond standard underwriting practices."&lt;SEP&gt;"Additional Underwriting Fee refers to the extra charge applied when loans require re-underwriting due to documentation issues with co-borrowers."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-42d99ce4642f1e6e8c39678043a90b1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f639d102461efe890e188cbc182dba52&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f1451e00f0a33296b7172a8a2f00a036</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 79}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 397}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INVOICE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An Invoice is a document issued by a seller to a buyer that outlines the goods or services provided, along with the amounts owed."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f639d102461efe890e188cbc182dba52</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 2}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 43}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 290}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FEE SCHEDULE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Fee Schedule refers to a list of all the fees applicable to the Borrower's loan, detailing the various charges associated with processing and maintaining the loan."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f639d102461efe890e188cbc182dba52</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 2}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 43}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 290}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LOAN PARAMETERS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Loan Parameters outline the specific rules and conditions under which loans are processed, including fees, interest rates, and repayment terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loan Parameters refer to the specific conditions and requirements that define how a loan should be structured, approved, and processed."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loan Parameters refer to the terms and conditions under which a loan is approved, including interest rates, repayment schedules, and applicable fees."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c0a48a482a40438f89f44e8758608310&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f639d102461efe890e188cbc182dba52&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-73179b73b8a774ced8d562931d514540</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 2}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 49}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ONLINE FUNDING REQUEST&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Online Funding Request is a digital system that allows Borrowers to request loan funds efficiently without incurring extra fees associated with fax submissions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f639d102461efe890e188cbc182dba52</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COMMITMENT LETTER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Commitment Letter is an official document from the lender that outlines the terms and conditions of the loan being offered to the Borrower."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f639d102461efe890e188cbc182dba52</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CASH AT CLOSING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Cash at Closing refers to funds that the Borrower must provide at the time of closing to cover various costs associated with the transaction."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f639d102461efe890e188cbc182dba52</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 29}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 235}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SETTLEMENT FEE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Settlement Fee is a charge paid to the settlement agent for their services in the closing of a loan or real estate transaction."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f639d102461efe890e188cbc182dba52</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 10}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 130}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 554}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MANDATORY EFFORTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Mandatory Efforts refer to the terms and conditions under which a loan is secured and delivered, ensuring compliance with lender requirements."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f639d102461efe890e188cbc182dba52</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BUYER'S MARKET&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"INDUSTRY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Buyer's Market describes a market condition where there are more properties for sale than there are buyers, leading to competitive pricing for buyers in the real estate market."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f639d102461efe890e188cbc182dba52</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MARKET PRICE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Market Price is the current price at which a property or financial product is being offered on the market, often fluctuating based on supply and demand."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f639d102461efe890e188cbc182dba52</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 2}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 49}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FEE NAME&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Fee Name is a term used to categorize various fees associated with loan processes, providing a structured way to identify the nature and application of charges."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fee Name refers to the specific designation given to each fee charged in the loan documentation, describing the type of service or penalty associated with the fee."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fee Name represents the title given to different types of charges that may apply in financial transactions or loan agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fee Name refers to the titles designated for various charges associated with loans, serving as a categorical identification for the fees listed."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c0a48a482a40438f89f44e8758608310&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-42d99ce4642f1e6e8c39678043a90b1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f639d102461efe890e188cbc182dba52&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da6a7f245e88177bac6b85d5f808ebd3</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 2}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 44}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;AMOUNT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"NORMAL_ENTITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Amount indicates the monetary value attributed to each fee category, providing essential information for understanding the costs associated with loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"Amount refers to the numerical value assigned to a fee that indicates what the Borrower must pay for specific services or penalties."&lt;SEP&gt;"Amount refers to the total sum of money which constitutes the financial aspect of different fees or loan values."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-42d99ce4642f1e6e8c39678043a90b1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f639d102461efe890e188cbc182dba52&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da6a7f245e88177bac6b85d5f808ebd3</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 2}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 44}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DESCRIPTION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"NORMAL_ENTITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Description offers a detailed explanation of what each fee entails and under what circumstances it is applied, aiding in transparency for loan processing."&lt;SEP&gt;"Description provides a detailed explanation of the fees and conditions associated with loans and financial agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Description provides further details regarding the purpose and conditions of a fee, explaining why it is charged to the Borrower."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-42d99ce4642f1e6e8c39678043a90b1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f639d102461efe890e188cbc182dba52&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da6a7f245e88177bac6b85d5f808ebd3</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 2}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 44}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DELINQUENCY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Delinquency refers to the situation where a borrower fails to make timely payments on their debts, impacting their credit history."&lt;SEP&gt;"Delinquency refers to the status of a loan that is overdue, specifically when repayment obligations are not met according to the terms of the loan agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f639d102461efe890e188cbc182dba52&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-150cc6b2e7ba7007f09ed79ae5042c88</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 19}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 193}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 699}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PERCENTAGE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MATHEMATICS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Percentage is a mathematical concept used to express a proportion of a whole, commonly employed in determining interest rates and fees associated with loans."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f639d102461efe890e188cbc182dba52</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CALCULATION FEES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Calculation Fees are charges that may be applied for the process of analyzing financial metrics and loan parameters, ensuring accurate loan management."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f639d102461efe890e188cbc182dba52</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PAYMENT SCHEDULE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Payment Schedule outlines the timeline and frequency of loan payments required from the Borrower, indicating when payments are due."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f639d102461efe890e188cbc182dba52</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;WRITTEN AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Written Agreement is a formal document that stipulates all terms and conditions agreed upon by the Borrower and the lender."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f639d102461efe890e188cbc182dba52</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 34}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NOTICE OF DEFAULT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Notice of Default is a formal notification issued to a Borrower indicating that they have failed to meet payment obligations on their loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"Notice of Default is a formal notification that a borrower has failed to meet the legal obligations of a mortgage, marking the beginning of foreclosure proceedings."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f639d102461efe890e188cbc182dba52&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-150cc6b2e7ba7007f09ed79ae5042c88</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 90}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 449}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BORROWER'S RIGHTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Borrower's Rights include protections and entitlements awarded to individuals borrowing money against a property, safeguarding against unfair practices and legal actions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Borrower's Rights refer to the legal entitlements and protections that a Borrower has under various lending laws and regulations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8552c190e01cd6c887d540f68372a1a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f639d102461efe890e188cbc182dba52</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 34}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DOCUMENT NUMBER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Document Number identifies a specific document, such as a loan agreement or fee schedule, providing a reference for tracking and processing."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f639d102461efe890e188cbc182dba52</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LOAN DEFICIENCY WAIVER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Loan Deficiency Waiver is an event where the lender agrees to overlook specific deficiencies in a loan to allow for its approval or processing."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f639d102461efe890e188cbc182dba52</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 29}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 235}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PERSONAL IDENTIFIABLE INFORMATION (PII)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Personal Identifiable Information (PII) refers to any information that can be used to identify an individual, which must be protected during the loan process."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f639d102461efe890e188cbc182dba52</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LOAN TERM&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MATHEMATICS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Loan Term refers to the duration over which the loan must be repaid, as specified in various loan products."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loan Term refers to the duration over which the loan must be repaid, often expressed in years or months."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-dcbf025ce89296c2fe585617d648039b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f639d102461efe890e188cbc182dba52</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 8}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 103}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 463}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 819}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FHA/VA LOANS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"FHA/VA Loans are government-backed loans aimed at making home financing accessible to lower-income families and veterans."&lt;SEP&gt;"FHA/VA Loans are types of government-backed loans that are highlighted in the text, involved in the underwriting process described."&lt;SEP&gt;"FHA/VA loans are types of government-backed loans in the United States, subject to specific guidelines and fees, as referenced in the text."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-42d99ce4642f1e6e8c39678043a90b1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f1451e00f0a33296b7172a8a2f00a036&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-73179b73b8a774ced8d562931d514540</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 2}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 47}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 296}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;UNAPPROVED CO-BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Unapproved Co-Borrower refers to a situation where a co-borrower on a loan is not listed on the original commitment, causing issues for loan approval."&lt;SEP&gt;"Unapproved Co-Borrower refers to a situation where additional underwriting fees are applied when a co-borrower's signatures are not on the original documentation."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-42d99ce4642f1e6e8c39678043a90b1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f1451e00f0a33296b7172a8a2f00a036</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 79}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 397}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;UNINSURABLE GOVERNMENT LOAN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Uninsurable Government Loan indicates a category of loans that cannot be insured if proper documentation is missing, suggesting risks in the lending process."&lt;SEP&gt;"Uninsurable Government Loan refers to government-backed loans that cannot be financed due to missing documentation."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-42d99ce4642f1e6e8c39678043a90b1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f1451e00f0a33296b7172a8a2f00a036</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 2}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 47}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 296}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RESCINDED LOAN FEE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Rescinded Loan Fee refers to the amount that must be refunded to a borrower following the rescission of a mortgage loan as per Regulation Z."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-42d99ce4642f1e6e8c39678043a90b1e</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 31}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 252}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LOAN WAIVER EXCEPTION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Loan Waiver Exception refers to instances where certain requirements can be waived, allowing for more flexibility in loan approval."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loan Waiver Exception refers to the specific circumstances under which a waiver for certain fees or requirements is granted for a loan, often tied to authority approvals."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-42d99ce4642f1e6e8c39678043a90b1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-73179b73b8a774ced8d562931d514540</data>
