</node>
<node id="&quot;OCTOBER 3, 2022&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"October 3, 2022 indicates the date of a document or policy review within the context of mortgage regulations and practices."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-42d99ce4642f1e6e8c39678043a90b1e</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RIGHT OF RESCISSION, DOC. #4622&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Right of Rescission, Doc. #4622 is a specific document that outlines details regarding the Right of Rescission as per Regulation Z."&lt;SEP&gt;"Right of Rescission, Doc. #4622 outlines the rules and rights of borrowers to cancel a loan transaction within a specified period."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-42d99ce4642f1e6e8c39678043a90b1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-25a82bf13c8c6a8ef98d1a15a5361ea9</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 31}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 252}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;UNINSURABLE LOANS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Uninsurable Loans are loans that cannot be insured due to missing documentation or failure to meet governmental requirements."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-42d99ce4642f1e6e8c39678043a90b1e</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 36}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 267}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FEDERAL NATIONAL MORTGAGE ASSOCIATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Federal National Mortgage Association, commonly known as Fannie Mae, is a government-sponsored enterprise that plays a critical role in the financing of mortgage loans and aims to increase the availability of affordable housing."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a40aeeabaca2a4a97b1dd8ad35ab142e</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 82}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 415}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FEDERAL HOME LOAN MORTGAGE CORPORATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Federal Home Loan Mortgage Corporation, known as Freddie Mac, is a public government chartered corporation that provides liquidity, stability, and affordability to the housing market by purchasing mortgage loans."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a40aeeabaca2a4a97b1dd8ad35ab142e</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 84}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 425}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 811}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;GOVERNMENT NATIONAL MORTGAGE ASSOCIATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Government National Mortgage Association, known as Ginnie Mae, guarantees securities backed by federally insured or guaranteed mortgages, ensuring that mortgage lenders have access to affordable funding."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a40aeeabaca2a4a97b1dd8ad35ab142e</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 82}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 415}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FEDERAL HOUSING ADMINISTRATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Federal Housing Administration (FHA) is a government agency that provides mortgage insurance on loans made by approved lenders, ensuring access to affordable housing, particularly for low to moderate-income borrowers."</data>
  <data key="d2">&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a40aeeabaca2a4a97b1dd8ad35ab142e</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 8}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 110}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 490}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DEPARTMENT OF VETERANS AFFAIRS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Department of Veterans Affairs (VA) is a government agency providing various services and benefits to veterans, including loan guarantees to help them purchase homes with favorable terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Department of Veterans Affairs (VA) provides various services and benefits to veterans, including loan guarantees to help them purchase homes with favorable terms."</data>
  <data key="d2">&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a40aeeabaca2a4a97b1dd8ad35ab142e</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 8}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 110}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 488}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NOTE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Note is a binding legal instrument that evidences a Borrower's obligation to repay a Mortgage Loan and outlines the terms of such repayment."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a40aeeabaca2a4a97b1dd8ad35ab142e</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 29}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 235}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MORTGAGED PROPERTY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"NORMAL_ENTITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Mortgaged Property is the real estate subject to a Mortgage Loan, serving as collateral for the debt incurred by the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mortgaged Property refers to the real estate associated with the Mortgage Loan, which can be foreclosed upon by Flagstar."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mortgaged Property refers to the real estate secured by a mortgage used to back a Mortgage Loan, effectively serving as collateral for the loan."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-132b3969367ecce54c6730fb570430ea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a40aeeabaca2a4a97b1dd8ad35ab142e</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 79}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 398}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PRIVATE INVESTOR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Private Investor refers to entities or individuals other than government agencies who buy Mortgage Loans from Flagstar, engaging in various financial transactions related to home finance."&lt;SEP&gt;"Private Investor is a term used to describe external financial entities involved in the mortgage loan transaction with Flagstar."&lt;SEP&gt;"Private Investor refers to an entity or entities other than an agency to whom Flagstar sells Mortgage Loans, indicating a role in the financing process."&lt;SEP&gt;"Private Investor refers to individuals or entities who invest in mortgage loans or associated securities for profit."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-132b3969367ecce54c6730fb570430ea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2fbf5161dc5c6670b7fd7548d822a73&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a40aeeabaca2a4a97b1dd8ad35ab142e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fc9e5323cf1da974f74cdcad0aebf55d</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 79}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 398}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CORRESPONDENT LEGAL GUIDE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Correspondent Legal Guide is a comprehensive document that outlines the legal and procedural guidelines for mortgage loan transactions involving Flagstar."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Correspondent Legal Guide is a comprehensive document that outlines legal requirements, warranties, and obligations related to the sale and purchase of Mortgage Loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Correspondent Legal Guide outlines the policies, procedures, and requirements of Flagstar regarding the registration, underwriting, and selling of Mortgage Loans."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b2fbf5161dc5c6670b7fd7548d822a73&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a40aeeabaca2a4a97b1dd8ad35ab142e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fc9e5323cf1da974f74cdcad0aebf55d</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 84}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 425}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 811}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;AGENCY OR AGENCIES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The term 'Agency or Agencies' refers to various federal or state organizations that deal with the purchase, insurance, or guarantee of Mortgage Loans and related securities."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a40aeeabaca2a4a97b1dd8ad35ab142e</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;APPLICABLE LAW&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Applicable Law encompasses all federal, state, and local laws and regulations that govern the origination, sale, and servicing of Mortgage Loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"Applicable Law includes the various legal norms governing the conduct of mortgage lending and the rights of borrowers and sellers."&lt;SEP&gt;"Applicable Law refers to the legal standards governing the mortgage loan process, ensuring compliance with local, state, and federal regulations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Applicable Law refers to the relevant legal standards and regulations that govern mortgage loans and related processes."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8552c190e01cd6c887d540f68372a1a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2292650099ea1cdf5881f79ed28d3cfc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a40aeeabaca2a4a97b1dd8ad35ab142e</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 82}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 413}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DISBURSEMENT DATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Disbursement Date indicates when funds are released by the settlement agent to the necessary parties during a loan closing."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Disbursement Date is the specific day on which funds are provided for a Closing, marking the completion of the financial transaction."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a40aeeabaca2a4a97b1dd8ad35ab142e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-717a880d45de770514dc0429a3dc79f8</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 21}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 210}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 738}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MORTGAGE LOAN AMOUNT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Mortgage Loan Amount refers to the total value of a Mortgage Loan as represented on the Note, reflecting the amount borrowed by the Borrower."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a40aeeabaca2a4a97b1dd8ad35ab142e</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 82}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 412}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 809}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MORTGAGE LOAN DOCUMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Mortgage Loan Documents are the legal papers associated with a Mortgage Loan, including forms that must be executed by the Borrower and Seller."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mortgage Loan Documents are the legal papers that detail the terms, rights, and obligations related to a mortgage loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mortgage Loan Documents encompass all necessary papers associated with the mortgage loan, including terms, conditions, and agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mortgage Loan Documents encompass all paperwork necessary to create and secure a Mortgage Loan, required for compliance with relevant mortgage programs and regulations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mortgage Loan Documents include all necessary legal and financial papers that a borrower must fulfill as part of obtaining a Mortgage Loan, including agreements and disclosures."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mortgage Loan Documents include all the necessary legal documents required for the execution of a mortgage loan transaction."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b2fbf5161dc5c6670b7fd7548d822a73&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2292650099ea1cdf5881f79ed28d3cfc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fc9e5323cf1da974f74cdcad0aebf55d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8552c190e01cd6c887d540f68372a1a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a40aeeabaca2a4a97b1dd8ad35ab142e</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 82}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 413}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PURCHASE DATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"NORMAL_ENTITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Purchase Date indicates the date on which the mortgage loan is formally purchased, marking the start of various obligations outlined in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Purchase Date is the date on which Flagstar pays the Seller the agreed-upon purchase price for a Mortgage Loan, transferring ownership rights."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2292650099ea1cdf5881f79ed28d3cfc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a40aeeabaca2a4a97b1dd8ad35ab142e</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 79}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 398}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FEDERAL HOUSING ADMINISTRATION (FHA)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Federal Housing Administration (FHA) is a government agency providing mortgage insurance on loans that are made by FDIC-approved lenders, aiding individuals in obtaining home financing."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a40aeeabaca2a4a97b1dd8ad35ab142e</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 82}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 412}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 809}]</data>
