<node id="&quot;DEPARTMENT OF VETERANS AFFAIRS (VA)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Department of Veterans Affairs (VA) offers a variety of services and benefits to veterans, including loans that help them purchase homes with favorable terms and conditions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a40aeeabaca2a4a97b1dd8ad35ab142e</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 82}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 412}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 809}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DEPARTMENT OF HOUSING AND URBAN DEVELOPMENT (HUD)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Department of Housing and Urban Development (HUD) is a U.S. government agency tasked with addressing America's housing needs, improving urban development, and enforcing fair housing laws."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a40aeeabaca2a4a97b1dd8ad35ab142e</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 8}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 110}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 490}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TRUTH IN LENDING ACT AND REGULATION Z (TILA)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Truth in Lending Act and Regulation Z are federal laws requiring clear disclosure of key terms of the lending arrangement and all costs associated with borrowing."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a40aeeabaca2a4a97b1dd8ad35ab142e</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 82}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 412}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 809}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EQUAL CREDIT OPPORTUNITY ACT AND REGULATION B (ECOA)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Equal Credit Opportunity Act and Regulation B are laws designed to ensure that all applicants are given an equal chance to obtain credit, prohibiting discrimination in lending."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a40aeeabaca2a4a97b1dd8ad35ab142e</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 29}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 235}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REAL ESTATE SETTLEMENT PROCEDURES ACT AND REGULATION X (RESPA)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Real Estate Settlement Procedures Act and Regulation X establish guidelines for the disclosure of loan terms, minimizing the settlement costs associated with obtaining a mortgage."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a40aeeabaca2a4a97b1dd8ad35ab142e</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 21}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 210}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 735}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FAIR CREDIT REPORTING ACT (FCRA)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Fair Credit Reporting Act (FCRA) regulates the collection, dissemination, and use of consumer credit information, ensuring fair treatment for borrowers."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a40aeeabaca2a4a97b1dd8ad35ab142e</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 29}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 235}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FLOOD DISASTER PROTECTION ACT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Flood Disaster Protection Act mandates that properties in certain areas must have flood insurance as a condition for obtaining a federally backed loan."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a40aeeabaca2a4a97b1dd8ad35ab142e</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 8}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 106}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 471}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;HOME MORTGAGE DISCLOSURE ACT AND REGULATION C (HMDA)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Home Mortgage Disclosure Act and Regulation C require lenders to maintain data on housing-related loans and report it to ensure that lender activities align with the fair housing and lending policies."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a40aeeabaca2a4a97b1dd8ad35ab142e</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 82}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 412}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 809}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SERVICING RIGHTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Servicing Rights refer to the rights of a financial entity to manage the tasks associated with a Mortgage Loan, including collection of payments and management of the loan account."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b2fbf5161dc5c6670b7fd7548d822a73</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 84}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 426}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PORTFOLIO&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Portfolio refers to a collection of Mortgage Loans held by Flagstar, representing their investments in various loans."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b2fbf5161dc5c6670b7fd7548d822a73</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 79}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 398}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;UNDERWRITING ERROR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Underwriting Error refers to any mistakes or omissions during the underwriting process that could lead to claims against Flagstar or affect the validity of a Mortgage Loan."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b2fbf5161dc5c6670b7fd7548d822a73</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 82}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 412}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 809}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MORTGAGE LOANS PORTFOLIO&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Mortgage Loans Portfolio refers to the aggregate of Mortgage Loans that Flagstar has on its books for investment purposes."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b2fbf5161dc5c6670b7fd7548d822a73</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 84}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 426}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BORROWER’S CREDIT STANDING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Borrower’s Credit Standing refers to the evaluation of the Borrower’s ability to repay the Mortgage Loan based on credit history and score."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b2fbf5161dc5c6670b7fd7548d822a73</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 88}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 440}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PRINT DATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Print Date refers to the date on which this document or guidelines were printed, as indicated in the header of the document."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b2fbf5161dc5c6670b7fd7548d822a73</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 82}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 413}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FLAGSTAR'S RIGHTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Flagstar's Rights refer to the entitlements and legal claims that Flagstar holds over the Mortgage Loans it purchases from Sellers."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b2fbf5161dc5c6670b7fd7548d822a73</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PRELIMINARY APPROVAL&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Preliminary Approval is the initial assessment provided to potential Borrowers indicating whether they qualify for a Mortgage Loan."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b2fbf5161dc5c6670b7fd7548d822a73</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 88}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 440}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SERVICER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Servicer refers to an entity responsible for managing the loan, including handling payments, customer service inquiries, and escrow accounts."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b2fbf5161dc5c6670b7fd7548d822a73</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 84}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 426}]</data>
</node>
