  <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Application Guidelines detail the requirements and processes that must be followed by Sellers when submitting Mortgage Loans to Flagstar."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b2fbf5161dc5c6670b7fd7548d822a73</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 84}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 426}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TRANSFER OF TITLE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Transfer of Title is the official process by which ownership of the Mortgaged Property is transferred from the Seller or Borrower to the final buyer."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b2fbf5161dc5c6670b7fd7548d822a73</data>
