<node id="&quot;AMERICAN LAND TITLE ASSOCIATION (ALTA)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The American Land Title Association (ALTA) is an organization setting standards for title insurance policies used in mortgage transactions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2292650099ea1cdf5881f79ed28d3cfc</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;OCC&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Office of the Comptroller of the Currency (OCC) is a regulatory body overseeing compliance and regulations in banking, involved in the mortgage loan process."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2292650099ea1cdf5881f79ed28d3cfc</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 84}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 425}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 812}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;HOME OWNERSHIP AND EQUITY PROTECTION ACT OF 1994&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Home Ownership and Equity Protection Act of 1994 is a federal law aimed at protecting borrowers from high-cost mortgages and predatory lending practices."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Home Ownership and Equity Protection Act of 1994 is legislation aimed at protecting borrowers in mortgage transactions from high cost loans and ensuring compliance with regulations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8552c190e01cd6c887d540f68372a1a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2292650099ea1cdf5881f79ed28d3cfc</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 82}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 412}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 810}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MORTGAGE PROPERTY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Mortgage Property refers to the real estate being financed through the mortgage loan, secured as collateral."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Mortgaged Property refers to the real estate that is financed through the mortgage loan, which is subject to legal agreements and regulations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8552c190e01cd6c887d540f68372a1a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2292650099ea1cdf5881f79ed28d3cfc</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 82}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 414}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FLOOD CERTIFICATION CONTRACT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Flood Certification Contract is an agreement that ensures proper insurance coverage for properties in flood-prone areas, essential for mortgage loans."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2292650099ea1cdf5881f79ed28d3cfc</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 10}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 133}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 569}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FIRST LIEN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"NORMAL_ENTITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"First Lien refers to the priority claim against a property that secures the mortgage loan, enabling the lender to recover the debt in case of default."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2292650099ea1cdf5881f79ed28d3cfc</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 84}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 425}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 812}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LIFE OF LOAN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"NORMAL_ENTITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Life of Loan refers to the duration for which a mortgage loan remains in effect, including all its terms and conditions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2292650099ea1cdf5881f79ed28d3cfc</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 82}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 412}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 809}]</data>
</node>
