<node id="&quot;FHA FIXED-RATE MORTGAGE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"FHA Fixed-Rate Mortgage is a loan product offered under specific guidelines and features for fixed-rate mortgage options."&lt;SEP&gt;"FHA Fixed-Rate Mortgage is a type of mortgage that enables borrowers to have predictable monthly payments over a specified term, available in various durations such as 10, 15, 20, 25, and 30 years."&lt;SEP&gt;"FHA Fixed-Rate Mortgage refers to a mortgage insured by the FHA that maintains a constant interest rate over the life of the loan, making monthly payments predictable."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9b0056b117b540a72b17dd275d006f45&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e78a99763ca81ea2755a9310a0e6cc85&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8760dceb193fd7c5f24d24209ee5e31</data>
