<node id="&quot;FHA ADJUSTABLE-RATE MORTGAGE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"FHA Adjustable-Rate Mortgage is a loan product that adjusts over time and is offered with traditional and jumbo loan amounts."&lt;SEP&gt;"FHA Adjustable-Rate Mortgage is a mortgage product that allows for interest rate adjustments after an initial fixed-rate period, affecting monthly payment amounts."&lt;SEP&gt;"FHA Adjustable-Rate Mortgage is a mortgage product where the interest rate may change at scheduled intervals, potentially offering lower initial payments."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9b0056b117b540a72b17dd275d006f45&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e78a99763ca81ea2755a9310a0e6cc85&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8760dceb193fd7c5f24d24209ee5e31</data>
