  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Alternative Documentation is a less rigorous method of income verification that requires only one year of income documentation for loan assessments."&lt;SEP&gt;"Alternative Documentation is a streamlined approach to mortgage application that allows borrowers to present less traditional forms of proof regarding income and assets."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7240c801a08e04a5a9db69a7879361cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f28aa24c80be0008755d728b5169b82</data>
