<node id="&quot;SIGNATURE REQUIREMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Signature Requirements are conditions that necessitate the borrower's agreement and documentation regarding funds and transactions for loan processing."&lt;SEP&gt;"Signature Requirements refers to the stipulations concerning how documents must be signed or notarized during the closing process, varying by state and loan program."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ca3069902295dcf5b2b505753d7623f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-717a880d45de770514dc0429a3dc79f8</data>
