</node>
<node id="&quot;CRYPTO CURRENCY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"CRYPTO CURRENCY refers to digital or virtual currencies that are not eligible for use as funds to close or reserves when acquiring loans."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ca3069902295dcf5b2b505753d7623f3</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 20}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 199}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 714}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 854}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SALE OF REAL ESTATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Sale of Real Estate refers to the process of transferring property ownership, which can impact financial arrangements for borrowers."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ca3069902295dcf5b2b505753d7623f3</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 20}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 206}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EARTH HOMES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PROPERTY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Earth Homes are environmentally sustainable structures built into the earth, often facing unique eligibility challenges for loans."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ca3069902295dcf5b2b505753d7623f3</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BERM HOMES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PROPERTY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Berm Homes are homes built against a hill or earth mound, which may not qualify for typical financing guidelines."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ca3069902295dcf5b2b505753d7623f3</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BASEMENT HOMES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PROPERTY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Basement Homes refer to residences with significant underground living spaces and may also have specific financing limitations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ca3069902295dcf5b2b505753d7623f3</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PROPERTIES WITH SQUARE FOOTAGE &lt; 600 FEET&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PROPERTY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Properties with square footage less than 600 feet are deemed ineligible for insurance as per the guidelines stated."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ca3069902295dcf5b2b505753d7623f3</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EARNEST MONEY DEPOSIT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Earnest Money Deposit is a sum paid to demonstrate a buyer's commitment to purchase a property, which is applied to the purchase price."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ca3069902295dcf5b2b505753d7623f3</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 29}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 235}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SOURCED FUNDS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CATEGORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Sourced Funds refer to capital that can be documented and verified, a requirement for certain financing transactions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ca3069902295dcf5b2b505753d7623f3</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 36}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 265}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 778}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SIGNED GIFT LETTER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Signed Gift Letter is a formal declaration required to prove the legitimacy of gift funds provided to the borrower."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ca3069902295dcf5b2b505753d7623f3</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 40}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 275}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BORROWER'S MINIMUM CONTRIBUTION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REQUIREMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Borrower's Minimum Contribution is a stipulation that requires the borrower to contribute a certain percentage from their own funds when acquiring a property."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ca3069902295dcf5b2b505753d7623f3</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 20}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 204}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;APPRAISAL DEPARTMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
