  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 20}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 206}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FUNDING SOURCE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Funding Source refers to the origin of financial resources used by borrowers for down payments and other costs associated with purchasing a property."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ca3069902295dcf5b2b505753d7623f3</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 29}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 235}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FINANCING GUIDELINES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"GUIDELINE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Financing Guidelines are rules set by lenders to assess how different types of properties may be financed."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ca3069902295dcf5b2b505753d7623f3</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 20}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 206}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ELIGIBILITY MATRIX&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Eligibility Matrix provides a structured overview of the criteria that determine whether a property meets financing requirements."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ca3069902295dcf5b2b505753d7623f3</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RISK ASSESSMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PROCESS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Risk Assessment is the process through which lenders evaluate the potential risks associated with financing a property."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ca3069902295dcf5b2b505753d7623f3</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 9}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 116}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 517}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DOWN PAYMENT REQUIREMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REQUIREMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Down Payment Requirement indicates the minimum amount of money a borrower must pay upfront when purchasing a property."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ca3069902295dcf5b2b505753d7623f3</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 20}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 204}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CREDIT HISTORY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Credit History encompasses all financial activity over time relevant to a borrower's credit report and ability to secure loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"Credit History is a record of a borrower's past borrowing and repayment activities, critical in determining loan eligibility."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ca3069902295dcf5b2b505753d7623f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-150cc6b2e7ba7007f09ed79ae5042c88</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 35}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 262}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DOCUMENT VERIFICATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PROCESS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Document Verification is the process lenders use to confirm the authenticity and accuracy of the information provided by borrowers."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ca3069902295dcf5b2b505753d7623f3</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RISK MITIGATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Risk Mitigation refers to the strategies and measures taken by lenders to reduce potential risks in the lending process."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ca3069902295dcf5b2b505753d7623f3</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FINANCING RESTRICTIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"GUIDELINE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Financing Restrictions outline specific limitations regarding what types of properties can be financed under certain loan products."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ca3069902295dcf5b2b505753d7623f3</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 20}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 206}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;APPRAISAL REVIEW PROCESS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PROCESS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Appraisal Review Process is the methodology employed by lenders to assess and verify property appraisals prior to loan approval."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ca3069902295dcf5b2b505753d7623f3</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 89}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 445}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INVESTMENT PROPERTY CRITERIA&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"GUIDELINE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Investment Property Criteria are specific conditions and requirements that must be met for properties purchased to generate rental income."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ca3069902295dcf5b2b505753d7623f3</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DISCLOSURE REQUIREMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"GUIDELINE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Disclosure Requirements include all necessary information that lenders must provide to borrowers throughout the loan process."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ca3069902295dcf5b2b505753d7623f3</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FUNDING COMMITMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Funding Commitment is an agreement by a lender to provide the required financing for a borrower upon meeting certain conditions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ca3069902295dcf5b2b505753d7623f3</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 33}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 259}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PRE-APPROVAL LETTER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Pre-Approval Letter is a document issued by a lender indicating that a borrower qualifies for a specific loan amount based on their financial profile."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ca3069902295dcf5b2b505753d7623f3</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LOAN ORIGINATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PROCESS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Loan Origination is the process of creating and processing a new loan, from application to closing."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ca3069902295dcf5b2b505753d7623f3</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 36}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 267}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SALE CONTINGENCY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Sale Contingency refers to a condition in a real estate contract that must be fulfilled for the sale to proceed, such as the sale of the buyer's current home."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ca3069902295dcf5b2b505753d7623f3</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;HOUSING MARKET&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Housing Market refers to the economic market for buying and selling residential properties, influenced by various factors such as pricing and availability."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ca3069902295dcf5b2b505753d7623f3</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 20}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 203}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 720}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LOAN TO VALUE RATIO&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"METRIC"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Loan To Value Ratio (LTV) is a financial term used to express the ratio of a loan to the value of an asset purchased."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ca3069902295dcf5b2b505753d7623f3</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 20}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 204}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CLOSING TIMELINE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PROCESS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Closing Timeline is the schedule that outlines the key dates and deadlines involved in the real estate closing process."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ca3069902295dcf5b2b505753d7623f3</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INSURANCE REQUIREMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"GUIDELINE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Insurance Requirements specify the types of insurance that borrowers must maintain on properties to protect against risks."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ca3069902295dcf5b2b505753d7623f3</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 15}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 164}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 637}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RISK-BASED PRICING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">|"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Risk-Based Pricing is the practice of determining the interest rate on a loan based on the perceived risk of the borrower."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ca3069902295dcf5b2b505753d7623f3</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;HOUSING EVENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Housing Event is defined as significant occurrences such as Foreclosure or Short Sale that impact a borrower's eligibility for loans and must be resolved at the time of closing."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-150cc6b2e7ba7007f09ed79ae5042c88</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 90}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 448}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ALTERNATIVE CREDIT HISTORY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Alternative Credit History refers to non-traditional methods of evaluating a borrower's credit worthiness that are not eligible according to current guidelines."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-150cc6b2e7ba7007f09ed79ae5042c88</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 35}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 262}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MINIMUM TRADELINE REQUIREMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Minimum Tradeline Requirement outlines the need for borrowers to have a specific number of active credit accounts to qualify for financing."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-150cc6b2e7ba7007f09ed79ae5042c88</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 30}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 245}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DEED IN LIEU&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Deed in Lieu is a mortgage default resolution process where a borrower voluntarily transfers ownership of their property to the lender, counted as a Housing Event."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-150cc6b2e7ba7007f09ed79ae5042c88</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 90}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 448}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RETIREMENT PLANS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Retirement Plans are financial programs designed to provide income during retirement, qualifying for specific tax benefits as outlined by the IRS."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-150cc6b2e7ba7007f09ed79ae5042c88</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 19}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 190}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 688}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 851}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;HOUSING PAYMENT HISTORY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Housing Payment History refers to the record of payments made on mortgage or rent, critical for assessing a borrower's reliability in securing loans."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-150cc6b2e7ba7007f09ed79ae5042c88</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 73}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 378}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SEASONING PERIOD&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Seasoning Period is the time required to elapse following a credit event, such as a foreclosure, before a borrower can qualify for a new loan."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-150cc6b2e7ba7007f09ed79ae5042c88</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 5}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 90}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 448}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;JUDICIAL DECISIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Judicial Decisions refer to the outcomes of court cases impacting financial obligations and borrower credit histories."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-150cc6b2e7ba7007f09ed79ae5042c88</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 19}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 191}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 692}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TIMELY PAYMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Timely Payments indicate the punctuality of financial transactions, essential for maintaining a good credit standing."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-150cc6b2e7ba7007f09ed79ae5042c88</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 19}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 193}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 702}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CREDIT GUIDELINES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Credit Guidelines are the set of rules and standards that dictate how lenders assess a borrower's creditworthiness."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-150cc6b2e7ba7007f09ed79ae5042c88</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 33}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 260}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BORROWER'S TOTAL MINIMUM REQUIRED RESERVES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Borrower's Total Minimum Required Reserves are the savings or assets a borrower must maintain to qualify for a loan, ensuring they can cover future payments."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-150cc6b2e7ba7007f09ed79ae5042c88</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 10}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 131}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 561}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;AUTHORIZED USER ACCOUNTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Authorized User Accounts are credit accounts where an individual is added to another person's credit account, which do not count toward tradeline requirements."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-150cc6b2e7ba7007f09ed79ae5042c88</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 35}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 262}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RENTAL HOUSING PAYMENT HISTORY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Rental Housing Payment History is an important record of a borrower's previous rental payments, necessary for evaluating loan eligibility."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-150cc6b2e7ba7007f09ed79ae5042c88</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COVER LETTER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Cover Letter is a document that accompanies loan applications, providing further details about the applicant's financial situation."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-150cc6b2e7ba7007f09ed79ae5042c88</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 33}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 259}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LENDER'S REQUIREMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Lender's Requirements are the specific criteria that a borrower must meet to successfully obtain financing through a loan."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-150cc6b2e7ba7007f09ed79ae5042c88</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INSURABLE TITLE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Insurable Title refers to the security of property ownership that can be legally and effectively protected against claims."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-150cc6b2e7ba7007f09ed79ae5042c88</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 19}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 191}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 692}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FORECLOSURE NOTICE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Foreclosure Notice is a formal notification sent to a borrower indicating that legal action is being taken to reclaim the property due to missed mortgage payments."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-150cc6b2e7ba7007f09ed79ae5042c88</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 19}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 193}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 699}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COMPLETENESS REQUIREMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Completeness Requirements stipulate the necessary elements that must be included in loan application files for approval."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-150cc6b2e7ba7007f09ed79ae5042c88</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 36}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 267}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PAYMENT HISTORY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Payment History refers to an account of payments made by a Borrower, which is important in assessing eligibility for refinancing and loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"Payment History tracks the payments made by the borrower, influencing their ability to gain approval for new loans."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5b42b071e6198f2a53344eeed3e0dca2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-150cc6b2e7ba7007f09ed79ae5042c88</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 73}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 378}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LOAN APPROVAL PROCESS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Loan Approval Process encompasses all steps taken by lenders to evaluate and authorize loan applications submitted by borrowers."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-150cc6b2e7ba7007f09ed79ae5042c88</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 33}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 260}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MEDICAL COLLECTIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Medical collections refer to unpaid medical bills that have been sent to collections, impacting credit records only if they exceed certain thresholds."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7240c801a08e04a5a9db69a7879361cf</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 19}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 191}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 694}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EX-SPOUSE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An ex-spouse is a former partner in a marriage, whose financial obligations may be excluded from credit evaluations under certain conditions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7240c801a08e04a5a9db69a7879361cf</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 19}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 191}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 693}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CO-SIGNER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ROLE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Co-signer is an individual who signs the mortgage or deed of trust and title, where their income and credit are being used to qualify for the loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"A co-signer is an individual who agrees to take responsibility for a loan in case the primary borrower defaults, affecting credit evaluations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4f5452ea8c1afd9252c54573e518675e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7240c801a08e04a5a9db69a7879361cf</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 33}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 261}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;IRS FORM 4506-C&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"IRS FORM 4506-C is a request for the IRS to provide a transcript of a taxpayer's return, necessary for loan qualification."&lt;SEP&gt;"IRS Form 4506-C is a document required to obtain a transcript of a borrower's tax returns from the IRS for income verification purposes."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8ec9b17609d27a36004f6e85b0cb3ecf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7240c801a08e04a5a9db69a7879361cf</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 19}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 190}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 687}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RESTRICTED STOCK UNITS (RSUS)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Restricted Stock Units are company shares given to employees as part of their compensation, which may be used as qualifying income if conditions are met."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7240c801a08e04a5a9db69a7879361cf</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 36}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 264}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;STOCK OPTIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Stock Options are contracts allowing employees to buy company shares at a set price, potentially qualifying as income for debt evaluation if criteria are satisfied."&lt;SEP&gt;"Stock Options are financial derivatives that give the holder the right to buy shares of a company at a predetermined price, influencing a Borrower's qualifying income."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ed5c9771e9d7f170cab82a4f6e0fe9c6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7240c801a08e04a5a9db69a7879361cf</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 19}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 196}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COMMISSION INCOME&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Commission Income is earnings based on sales performance, which can vary and impact a borrower's qualification for loans."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7240c801a08e04a5a9db69a7879361cf</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INCOME GUIDELINES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Income Guidelines are the criteria set for verifying and assessing a borrower's ability to repay a loan based on their income sources."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7240c801a08e04a5a9db69a7879361cf</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 38}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 269}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TWO-YEAR TRADITIONAL DOCUMENTATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Two-Year Traditional Documentation involves checking two years’ worth of income and employment history to qualify a borrower."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7240c801a08e04a5a9db69a7879361cf</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 36}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 264}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TAX TRANSCRIPT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Tax Transcript is a document provided by the IRS that summarizes a taxpayer's tax return information for lenders assessing a borrower's financial situation."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7240c801a08e04a5a9db69a7879361cf</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 19}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 190}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 687}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;JUDGMENT ACCOUNTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Judgment Accounts refer to debts that have been formally declared by a court, necessitating close attention in financial evaluations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7240c801a08e04a5a9db69a7879361cf</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 19}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 191}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 695}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CREDIT EVALUATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Credit Evaluation is the process of assessing an individual's creditworthiness based on their credit history, scores, and existing debts."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7240c801a08e04a5a9db69a7879361cf</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 35}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 263}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LOAN EVALUATIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Loan Evaluations refer to the assessments performed to determine a borrower’s qualifications for a loan based on their financial background."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7240c801a08e04a5a9db69a7879361cf</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 35}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 263}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TRADITIONAL DOCUMENTATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Traditional Documentation comprises a comprehensive collection of verifiable income and employment records submitted by a borrower."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7240c801a08e04a5a9db69a7879361cf</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BORROWER'S EMPLOYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Borrower's Employment refers to the job status and history of a borrower, which is crucial for evaluating loan applications."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7240c801a08e04a5a9db69a7879361cf</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 35}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 263}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CURRENT JOB&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Current Job indicates the present employment status of an individual, which must be established to assess loan qualifications."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7240c801a08e04a5a9db69a7879361cf</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 32}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 255}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;VESTING SCHEDULE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Vesting Schedule outlines the timeline and conditions under which stock options or RSUs become fully owned by an employee."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7240c801a08e04a5a9db69a7879361cf</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;HISTORICAL AWARDS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Historical Awards refer to past income or financial benefits that can be referenced to determine a Borrower's eligibility for future income consideration."&lt;SEP&gt;"Historical Awards refer to past instances of bonuses or stock options granted to an employee, affecting their income stability assessment."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ed5c9771e9d7f170cab82a4f6e0fe9c6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7240c801a08e04a5a9db69a7879361cf</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EMPLOYMENT GAPS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Employment Gaps are periods of time when an individual has been unemployed, which can impact their financial reliability for loans."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7240c801a08e04a5a9db69a7879361cf</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 36}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 268}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REPAYMENT PLAN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Repayment Plan is an agreement between a lender and a borrower that outlines how and when a borrower will pay back their debt, especially in bankruptcy cases."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7240c801a08e04a5a9db69a7879361cf</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 2}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 43}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 285}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 779}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ASSET VERIFICATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Asset Verification involves confirming the ownership and value of a borrower's assets to assess their financial stability for loan approval."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7240c801a08e04a5a9db69a7879361cf</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 36}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 264}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DECREE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Decree is a legal order issued by a court, particularly in divorce cases, that may influence financial responsibilities of the parties involved."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7240c801a08e04a5a9db69a7879361cf</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DEBT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Debt is an amount of money borrowed by one party from another, which is to be paid back with interest as specified in the loan agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7240c801a08e04a5a9db69a7879361cf</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 19}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 191}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 692}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;OTHER VERIFICATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Other Verification refers to the additional checks and processes that lenders may employ to assess a borrower's ability to repay a loan, beyond standard requirements."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7240c801a08e04a5a9db69a7879361cf</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 36}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 264}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INCOME QUALIFICATIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Income Qualifications are the standards set to determine whether a borrower's income is sufficient to meet the requirements for loan approval."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7240c801a08e04a5a9db69a7879361cf</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 19}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 191}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 694}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TWO-YEAR INCOME DOCUMENTATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Two-Year Income Documentation requires borrowers to provide proof of earnings for the last two years to ensure a continuous income stream."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7240c801a08e04a5a9db69a7879361cf</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 19}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 191}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 694}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PROBATIONARY EMPLOYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Probationary Employment refers to a trial period during which a new employee's performance and fit for the job are evaluated, impacting their loan considerations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7240c801a08e04a5a9db69a7879361cf</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 32}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 255}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FINANCIAL HISTORY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Financial History is the record of an individual's financial transactions, including income, debts, and repayment behavior, which influences lending decisions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7240c801a08e04a5a9db69a7879361cf</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 35}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 263}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EXCLUSION CRITERIA&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Exclusion Criteria are specific conditions under which certain debts or accounts can be disregarded in financial evaluations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7240c801a08e04a5a9db69a7879361cf</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INVESTMENT INCOME&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Investment Income refers to earnings generated from investments, which can be considered in assessing a borrower's overall financial profile."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7240c801a08e04a5a9db69a7879361cf</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CREDIT RATING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Credit Rating is an assessment of the creditworthiness of a borrower, typically indicated by a numerical score based on past credit behavior."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7240c801a08e04a5a9db69a7879361cf</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 35}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 262}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FINANCIAL PROTOCOLS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Financial Protocols are established procedures or rules that govern financial transactions and loan assessments in lending institutions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7240c801a08e04a5a9db69a7879361cf</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 35}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 263}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BORROWER'S FINANCIAL STANDING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Borrower's Financial Standing refers to the overall economic status of a borrower, including income, debts, assets, and credit score."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7240c801a08e04a5a9db69a7879361cf</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 35}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 263}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CLERGY INCOME&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"INCOME"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Clergy Income refers to payments made to ministers or members of the clergy, which can be considered for qualifying the Borrower, subject to specific documentation."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ed5c9771e9d7f170cab82a4f6e0fe9c6</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 39}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SELF-EMPLOYED&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Self-Employed describes individuals who own at least 25% of a business and have specific income verification requirements for mortgage qualification."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ed5c9771e9d7f170cab82a4f6e0fe9c6</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 42}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 283}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PROFIT AND LOSS STATEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Profit and Loss Statement is a financial report used to summarize the revenues, costs, and expenses of a business, assisting in income analysis for self-employed borrowers."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ed5c9771e9d7f170cab82a4f6e0fe9c6</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 19}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 190}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 690}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;HOUSING ALLOWANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"INCOME"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Housing Allowance is a specified amount of income received by a Borrower, typically from a religious organization, which can be documented for mortgage qualification."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ed5c9771e9d7f170cab82a4f6e0fe9c6</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 39}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RSUS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"RSUs, or Restricted Stock Units, are a form of equity compensation given to employees, used in calculating a Borrower's qualifying income based on employment history."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ed5c9771e9d7f170cab82a4f6e0fe9c6</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TAX RETURNS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Tax Returns are documents filed with the IRS that show a Borrower's income and tax obligations, critical for verifying income over the required qualification period."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tax Returns are official documents submitted to the IRS that report an individual's or business's annual income and tax obligations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8ec9b17609d27a36004f6e85b0cb3ecf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed5c9771e9d7f170cab82a4f6e0fe9c6</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 19}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 190}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 685}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;YEAR-TO-DATE BALANCE SHEET&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Year-to-date Balance Sheet provides a snapshot of a company's financial position at a specific point in time, used for income verification of self-employed borrowers."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ed5c9771e9d7f170cab82a4f6e0fe9c6</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 19}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 190}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 690}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;VOLATILE ASSETS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Volatile Assets refer to investments that may fluctuate significantly in value, affecting their consideration in mortgage qualifying processes."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ed5c9771e9d7f170cab82a4f6e0fe9c6</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 29}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 244}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CHURCH BUDGET&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Church Budget is a financial plan outlining the allocations for expenses, including housing allowance, which can be used to verify income for Borrowers associated with a church."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ed5c9771e9d7f170cab82a4f6e0fe9c6</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 42}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 281}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SIGNED FEDERAL INCOME TAX RETURNS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Signed Federal Income Tax Returns are legal documents filed with the IRS that provide a comprehensive view of a Borrower's income and tax liabilities, essential for mortgage qualification."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ed5c9771e9d7f170cab82a4f6e0fe9c6</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 19}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 190}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 685}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BUSINESS INCOME TAX RETURNS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Business Income Tax Returns are documents filed by corporations or partnerships that report income, important for self-employed individuals seeking mortgage approval."</data>
