  <data key="d1">"Primary refers to a type of mortgage product that is available for loans of various amounts with specific terms and requirements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Primary refers to the primary residence or primary home for which mortgage financing is being applied, influencing loan terms and conditions."</data>
