  <data key="d4">18.5</data>
  <data key="d5">"Loan refers to the financial agreement central to mortgage transactions, which involves borrowing funds for real estate purposes."&lt;SEP&gt;"MORTGAGE is a specific type of LOAN used for purchasing real estate."</data>
