  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LOAN&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">67.5</data>
  <data key="d5">"A LOAN is created as a contractual agreement between FLAGSTAR and the BORROWER regarding payment obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower is the individual or entity seeking the Loan, establishing a direct relationship in the loan application process."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower is the party that takes out the Loan from FLAGSTAR BANK."&lt;SEP&gt;"The borrower obtains a loan from a lender, which is their primary financial need."&lt;SEP&gt;"The loan process directly involves the borrower, who is critical in providing necessary information and documentation."&lt;SEP&gt;"The borrower is directly involved in taking out a loan, indicating a fundamental relationship in the lending process."&lt;SEP&gt;"The borrower is involved directly with obtaining the loan, making them a central entity in the loan process."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f18d8da3052c73dc1f9fa6e9aef1a14e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c8b4e28d440c820b5ce2e89c08cd1b75&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-42d99ce4642f1e6e8c39678043a90b1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de34030d71ef2c627010a089db20697c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ae2131097a3957a665d280c4ed013cb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a6589af60d5cd7b7c6c55232071772b8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
