  <data key="d4">51.5</data>
  <data key="d5">"Flagstar Bank is a financial institution that issues loans, which connects its operations closely with the loan registration process outlined in its services."&lt;SEP&gt;"Flagstar Bank provides loan services including financial solutions related to housing, which aligns with HUD's oversight of housing programs."&lt;SEP&gt;"Flagstar Bank is the financial institution that defines and offers a wide range of loan products, including One-Close Construction and Construction Loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"Flagstar Bank is the organization that utilizes the Product Guidelines to assess loan applications and eligibility."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"Flagstar Bank operates as a financial institution providing essential services, including loan eligibility assessments for second programs."&lt;SEP&gt;"Flagstar Bank is the legal and operational entity behind the financial activities, particularly in mortgage lending."&lt;</data>
