  <data key="d4">33.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The interest rate floor applies specifically to the 5/1 ARM, reinforcing their connection in loan terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"The interest rate floor for a 5/1 ARM is defined in conjunction with its margin and adjustment caps, impacting loan costs."&lt;SEP&gt;"The interest rate floor applies to the 5/1 ARM, indicating how minimum interest rates are set for that loan type."&lt;SEP&gt;"The interest rate floor is equal to the margin for the 5/1 ARM loan product, highlighting a financial relationship between the two concepts."</data>
