<edge source="&quot;FLAGSTAR&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">57.5</data>
  <data key="d5">"A Borrower refers to the individual or entity that takes out a loan from Flagstar, thus connecting them directly to the organization."&lt;SEP&gt;"FLAGSTAR determines qualifying conditions for BORROWER related to expense ratios and income verification methods."&lt;SEP&gt;"Borrower is subject to fees related to loan processing as determined by Flagstar's policies and regulations."&lt;SEP&gt;"FLAGSTAR's dealings with the BORROWER are influenced by the information and documentation provided by the SELLER."&lt;SEP&gt;"Flagstar is the lending institution that provides the Mortgage Loan to the Borrower after underwriting approval."&lt;SEP&gt;"Flagstar issues Mortgage Loans to Borrowers, engaging in a financial transaction based on a Note and Mortgage."&lt;SEP&gt;"Flagstar must refund fees to the borrower if a rescission occurs, indicating a direct financial relationship."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b2fbf5161dc5c6670b7fd7548d822a73&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-42d99ce4642f1e6e8c39678043a90b1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fc9e5323cf1da974f74cdcad0aebf55d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d2fd985d041d5eb6aeccbb1d21a81c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f639d102461efe890e188cbc182dba52&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a40aeeabaca2a4a97b1dd8ad35ab142e</data>
