  <data key="d4">41.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"FLAGSTAR guidelines state that Community Second programs are eligible for use with Fannie Mae first mortgage products."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fannie Mae collaborates with Flagstar in providing mortgage loan products and guidelines."&lt;SEP&gt;"Flagstar offers mortgage products and services, which are influenced by guidelines and liquidity provided by Fannie Mae in the mortgage market."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fannie Mae's loans must meet the parameters set by Flagstar's Conventional Underwriting Guidelines."&lt;SEP&gt;"Flagstar provides mortgage products that often involve Fannie Mae's mortgage guidelines and support."&lt;</data>
