<edge source="&quot;FLAGSTAR&quot;" target="&quot;SELLER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">33.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"FLAGSTAR is involved in the transaction and guidelines provided to the SELLER regarding the MORTGAGE LOAN."&lt;SEP&gt;"FLAGSTAR purchases mortgage loans from the SELLER, which creates a transactional relationship governed by the Loan Purchase Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Seller assigns all rights, title, and interest in a Mortgage Loan to Flagstar as part of their contractual agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Seller is obligated to reimburse Flagstar for losses, damages, and claims related to mortgage loans, indicating a legal and financial obligation."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8552c190e01cd6c887d540f68372a1a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-132b3969367ecce54c6730fb570430ea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2fbf5161dc5c6670b7fd7548d822a73&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fc9e5323cf1da974f74cdcad0aebf55d</data>
