<edge source="&quot;LTV&quot;" target="&quot;MORTGAGE INSURANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">25.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"LTV (Loan-to-Value) ratios determine the necessity and extent of mortgage insurance coverage, establishing an essential financial relationship."&lt;SEP&gt;"LTV impacts the requirement for Mortgage Insurance, where loans above a certain LTV require coverage."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mortgage insurance is typically required when the loan-to-value (LTV) ratio exceeds a certain threshold, linking these concepts."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-0e01afc290e08ec0f3a536bcbc8c10f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ca1bd5008b14dffd1f24d89ce07116f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d3f42cc9266dff615db2fd5cb59e3109</data>
