  <data key="d4">40.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Cash-out refinance guidelines specify maximum Loan-to-Value (LTV) ratios."&lt;SEP&gt;"LTV (Loan-to-Value) ratios are critical in determining the eligible amounts for Cash-Out Refinance, establishing their connection in loan assessments."&lt;SEP&gt;"The LTV (Loan-to-Value) ratio is a key factor in assessing eligibility for a Cash-Out Refinance transaction."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loan-to-Value (LTV) ratio is a critical factor in determining eligibility for Cash-Out Refinances."&lt;SEP&gt;"The LTV ratio is a crucial factor that determines the cash-out refinancing limits for borrowers."</data>
