  <data key="d4">32.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"LTV (Loan-to-Value) ratios are often contingent upon the borrower's Credit Score, which influences lending decisions."&lt;SEP&gt;"LTV requirements often connect with credit score thresholds in determining loan eligibility."&lt;SEP&gt;"The LTV ratio is used in conjunction with the credit score to determine eligibility for loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"The LTV (Loan-to-Value) ratio requirements are dependent on the minimum credit score needed for various property types."</data>
