  <data key="d4">24.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Loan Amount is the total sum of money that Borrowers apply for from lenders, impacting their financial negotiations."&lt;SEP&gt;"The BORROWER's repayment terms are based on the LOAN AMOUNT, impacting EARLY PAYMENT DEFAULT measures."&lt;SEP&gt;"The BORROWER applies for a LOAN AMOUNT that reflects their financing needs, indicating a financial relationship in the loan application process."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6ae2131097a3957a665d280c4ed013cb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b722d926669aa7676c36ecbb75a4a233</data>
