  <data key="d4">15.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Borrowers must complete a homeownership education course if they are first-time homebuyers, as indicated in the guidelines."&lt;SEP&gt;"Homeownership Education is a requirement that the Borrower must meet under Freddie Mac guidelines."</data>
