  <data key="d4">18.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower submits a Loan Application which includes their personal financial information and eligibility for Home Possible."&lt;SEP&gt;"The borrower submits a loan application to request funds for their needs."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fd698c420bb978f364630c455d2abf4a&lt;SEP&gt;</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
