  <data key="d4">15.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An unsecured loan is a type of loan that a borrower might apply for, based solely on their creditworthiness."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower may use an Unsecured Loan to support their personal funds, provided it meets Freddie Mac guidelines."</data>
