</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;TRADE LINES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The number of Trade Lines in the Borrower's Credit Report affects their eligibility for loans and financing options."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fd698c420bb978f364630c455d2abf4a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;INSTITUTIONAL ESCROW ACCOUNT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Funds for the Borrower's mortgage payments must be deposited into an Institutional Escrow Account before closing."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fd698c420bb978f364630c455d2abf4a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;DOCUMENTATION REQUIREMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">18.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower must meet specific Documentation Requirements set forth by Freddie Mac to qualify for Home Possible."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower must provide all necessary Documentation Requirements to secure their mortgage application under Freddie Mac's standards."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fd698c420bb978f364630c455d2abf4a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;MONTHLY BUDGET AND RESIDUAL ANALYSIS FORM&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Monthly Budget and Residual Analysis Form is used by the Borrower to outline their financial situation and support their application."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fd698c420bb978f364630c455d2abf4a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;ESTIMATED CASH RECEIPTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Estimated Cash Receipts assist in verifying the financial stability of the Borrower during the application process."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fd698c420bb978f364630c455d2abf4a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;SECONDARY FINANCING&quot;">
  <data key="d4">17.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Secondary Financing options, including Affordable Second programs, are available to assist the Borrower with their mortgage requirements."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower can benefit from Secondary Financing options to help with their mortgage affordability under Home Possible."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fd698c420bb978f364630c455d2abf4a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;PROPERTY TYPE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Property Type sold or mortgaged impacts the Borrower's options and eligibility under Home Possible guidelines."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fd698c420bb978f364630c455d2abf4a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;AFFORDABLE SECOND PROGRAMS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Affordable Second Programs are resources available to the Borrower for financing assistance in home purchasing."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fd698c420bb978f364630c455d2abf4a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;CONTRIBUTIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Contributions are applicable to a borrower’s mortgage financing needs, making them directly related in the context of mortgage applications."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d0459e9b5b3885ad40728e4e0af01123</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;MAXIMUM CONTRIBUTION LIMITS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Maximum contribution limits define what a borrower can receive towards their mortgage expenses, establishing a relationship in financial assistance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d0459e9b5b3885ad40728e4e0af01123</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;LOAN DELIVERY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower is responsible for ensuring Loan Delivery occurs within the stipulated timeframe."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c8b4e28d440c820b5ce2e89c08cd1b75</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;SUBSTITUTION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower may need to support the substitution process by providing necessary documentation."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c8b4e28d440c820b5ce2e89c08cd1b75</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;LOAN PRODUCT ADVISOR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A borrower uses the Loan Product Advisor tool to assess eligibility for loans."</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER PERSONAL FUNDS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.5</data>
  <data key="d5">"Borrower personal funds are a crucial source of financial assets that a borrower might use for down payments."</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;MONTHLY PAYMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"BORROWER must make MONTHLY PAYMENTS to avoid being classified under the EARLY PAYMENT DEFAULT."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6ae2131097a3957a665d280c4ed013cb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;EARLY PAYMENT DEFAULT (EPD)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"BORROWER's failure to make timely payments can lead to an EARLY PAYMENT DEFAULT (EPD) classification."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6ae2131097a3957a665d280c4ed013cb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWERS' MONTHLY PAYMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"BORROWS are responsible for ensuring their BORROWERS' MONTHLY PAYMENTS are made on time to avoid EPD classification."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6ae2131097a3957a665d280c4ed013cb</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;CLOSING&quot;">
  <data key="d4">27.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Closing formalizes the legal transfer of ownership of the Mortgage Loan from the Seller to the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"The CLOSING refers to the transaction phase where the BORROWER signs necessary documents for the MORTGAGE LOAN."&lt;SEP&gt;"The borrower is essential to the closing process, implying a direct relationship in financial transactions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6f08c1849f1a1e52584c06fc2286667f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2fbf5161dc5c6670b7fd7548d822a73&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a40aeeabaca2a4a97b1dd8ad35ab142e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;ASSETS SECTION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The assets section of a loan application details the borrower's financial capacity, establishing a direct connection."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6f08c1849f1a1e52584c06fc2286667f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;LENDER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">28.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower and Lender enter into a contractual relationship in which the Borrower has specific rights under the Right of Rescission."&lt;SEP&gt;"The lender provides the loan to the borrower, establishing a direct financial relationship."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Lender provides financing to the Borrower based on their Loan Application and financial standing."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5b42b071e6198f2a53344eeed3e0dca2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de34030d71ef2c627010a089db20697c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc8b7db5bf49f6eb8f1e8daa83b6b361</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;CLOSING DISCLOSURE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Borrowers must receive the Closing Disclosure to be informed about their terms and have the right to rescind based on this information."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-dc8b7db5bf49f6eb8f1e8daa83b6b361</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;DECLARE OF RESCISSION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The borrower holds the right to declare a rescission, terminating the transaction under the stipulated conditions in the Right of Rescission."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-dc8b7db5bf49f6eb8f1e8daa83b6b361</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;PERSONAL FINANCIAL EMERGENCY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">15.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A Personal Financial Emergency may lead a Borrower to request a waiver of their right to rescind, impacting their loan terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"The borrower's request for a waiver of rescission is evaluated based on their personal financial emergency circumstances."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-faf7af26dea16d8bcfcc9a3324ded2bc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc8b7db5bf49f6eb8f1e8daa83b6b361</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;RESCISSION PERIOD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Rescission Period provides Borrowers with the opportunity to reconsider their decision regarding a credit transaction."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-dc8b7db5bf49f6eb8f1e8daa83b6b361</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;FLAGSTAR BANK, N.A.&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The borrower must communicate their intention to rescind their loan to Flagstar Bank, N.A., detailing their request and the reason for it."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-faf7af26dea16d8bcfcc9a3324ded2bc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;RIGHT OF RESCISSION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">19.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Right of Rescission directly impacts the Borrower, as it dictates their ability to cancel a loan transaction."&lt;SEP&gt;"The borrower has the right to rescind their loan under specific conditions, highlighting their legal entitlement in the transaction."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-faf7af26dea16d8bcfcc9a3324ded2bc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-25a82bf13c8c6a8ef98d1a15a5361ea9</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;MORTGAGE BROKER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Mortgage Broker communicates the final decisions on waivers to the borrower, establishing their advisory role in the process."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-faf7af26dea16d8bcfcc9a3324ded2bc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;EXECUTED NOTICE OF RIGHT OF CANCEL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The borrower is required to provide an executed Notice of Right to Cancel when exercising their right to rescind."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-faf7af26dea16d8bcfcc9a3324ded2bc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;ORIGINATOR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Originator is involved in the initial loan process with the borrower, establishing their foundational relationship in loan agreements."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-faf7af26dea16d8bcfcc9a3324ded2bc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;SETTLEMENT AGENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Settlement Agent is responsible for facilitating the processes that involve the borrower during closing, cementing their operational link."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Settlement Agent plays a crucial role in managing the transactional aspects of loans for the Borrower."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-662a2c10d200da7291e0212d33749544&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-faf7af26dea16d8bcfcc9a3324ded2bc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;RIGHT TO RESCIND&quot;">
  <data key="d4">10.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The borrower holds the Right to Rescind within specific timelines, emphasizing their authority in the loan process."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-faf7af26dea16d8bcfcc9a3324ded2bc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;20-CALENDAR DAY TIMELINE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The borrower’s actions are time-sensitive and must be completed within the 20-calendar day timeline to effectively rescind a loan."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-faf7af26dea16d8bcfcc9a3324ded2bc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;NOTIFICATION TO FLAGSTAR BANK&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The borrower must notify Flagstar Bank regarding their intention to rescind, indicating procedural communication requirements."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-faf7af26dea16d8bcfcc9a3324ded2bc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;CO-BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"BORROWER and CO-BORROWER are both parties required for loan registration, establishing their relationship in the loan process."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b722d926669aa7676c36ecbb75a4a233</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;SELLER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">21.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower enters into a financial agreement with the Seller for the Mortgage Loan, establishing a connection between both parties."&lt;SEP&gt;"The SELLER provides information and documentation regarding the BORROWER that can affect the terms of the mortgage loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"The seller and borrower interact during the closing process, with mutual obligations concerning the transaction."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2292650099ea1cdf5881f79ed28d3cfc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a6589af60d5cd7b7c6c55232071772b8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fc9e5323cf1da974f74cdcad0aebf55d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;TITLE FEES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The borrower is responsible for reviewing and ensuring title fees are correct in the closing package."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a6589af60d5cd7b7c6c55232071772b8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;FHA&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower represents individuals seeking FHA loans for property purchases, adhering to its guidelines."&lt;</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;EARLY LOAN PAYOFF FEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Borrowers are subject to the Early Loan Payoff Fee, indicating a direct financial relationship with these fees."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-662a2c10d200da7291e0212d33749544</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER'S FIRST&quot;">
  <data key="d4">12.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower's First is likely a condition or benefit that affects primary borrowing activities and payments."&lt;SEP&gt;"The term 'Borrower's First' indicates a potential condition or guideline affecting the borrower's initial transactions and experiences."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-662a2c10d200da7291e0212d33749544</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;EARLY PAYMENT DEFAULT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Early Payment Default links a borrower's actions directly to penalties that may be incurred after defaults on payments."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-662a2c10d200da7291e0212d33749544</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;HELOC&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower can engage in a Home Equity Line of Credit (HELOC), linking their borrowing activities with this loan type."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-662a2c10d200da7291e0212d33749544</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;GOVERNMENT LOANS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower can also seek Government Loans, indicating an additional borrowing option available to them."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-662a2c10d200da7291e0212d33749544</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;NON-CONFORMING LOANS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower can secure Non-conforming Loans, which delineates their options for various loan types."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-662a2c10d200da7291e0212d33749544</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;FUNDING DATE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Funding Date is critical to the Borrower's loan process, marking when the funds are disbursed to them."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-662a2c10d200da7291e0212d33749544</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;EXCESSIVE CASH AMOUNT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower may receive an Excessive Cash Amount at closing, affecting their overall financial transaction with the lender."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-662a2c10d200da7291e0212d33749544</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;CONTINGENT FEES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">14.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Contingent Fees may affect costs incurred by the Borrower as part of their financial obligations during the loan process."&lt;SEP&gt;"Contingent fees relate to amounts refunded to the borrower in the event of a rescission, establishing a financial relationship."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-42d99ce4642f1e6e8c39678043a90b1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-662a2c10d200da7291e0212d33749544</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;SETTLEMENT AGENT FEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower pays the Settlement Agent Fee as part of the closing costs associated with their loan."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-662a2c10d200da7291e0212d33749544</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;LOAN DENIAL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Loan Denial directly impacts the Borrower, affecting their eligibility and financial options."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-662a2c10d200da7291e0212d33749544</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;WIRE TRANSFER FEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower may incur a Wire Transfer Fee when processing transactions related to their loan or payments."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-662a2c10d200da7291e0212d33749544</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;FEES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Borrowers are subject to multiple fees as part of the loan agreement and processing."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f639d102461efe890e188cbc182dba52</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER'S RIGHTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Borrowers have rights outlined in their loan agreements that protect them during the loan process."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f639d102461efe890e188cbc182dba52</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;LOAN DEFICIENCY WAIVER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A loan deficiency waiver may be granted to borrowers under specific circumstances as per lender guidelines."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f639d102461efe890e188cbc182dba52</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;CASH AT CLOSING&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The borrower is responsible for providing cash at closing as part of the loan agreement fulfillment."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f639d102461efe890e188cbc182dba52</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;REGULATION Z&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Regulation Z mandates that the borrower must be reimbursed if fees are refunded, indicating a regulatory relationship."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-42d99ce4642f1e6e8c39678043a90b1e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;FEE NAME&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The borrower is directly impacted by various fee names associated with the loan process."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-42d99ce4642f1e6e8c39678043a90b1e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;MORTGAGE AMOUNT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The mortgage amount is a crucial factor for the borrower in determining loan eligibility and costs."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-42d99ce4642f1e6e8c39678043a90b1e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;RESCINDED LOAN FEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The rescinded loan fee refers to amounts refunded to the borrower, illustrating a financial relationship."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-42d99ce4642f1e6e8c39678043a90b1e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;NOTE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">10.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower is obligated to repay the Mortgage Loan as evidenced by the Note they sign during Closing."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a40aeeabaca2a4a97b1dd8ad35ab142e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;EQUAL CREDIT OPPORTUNITY ACT AND REGULATION B (ECOA)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"ECOA guarantees that Borrowers are treated fairly and without discrimination during the lending process."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a40aeeabaca2a4a97b1dd8ad35ab142e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;FAIR CREDIT REPORTING ACT (FCRA)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"FCRA ensures that Borrowers have the right to understand and contest inaccurate information in their credit reports during the mortgage application process."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a40aeeabaca2a4a97b1dd8ad35ab142e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;FAIR HOUSING ACT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Fair Housing Act prohibits discrimination against Borrowers based on race, color, religion, sex, or national origin in the housing market."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a40aeeabaca2a4a97b1dd8ad35ab142e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;MORTGAGE LOAN&quot;">
  <data key="d4">29.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The BORROWER is directly involved in engaging MORTGAGE LOAN through applications and repayments."&lt;SEP&gt;"The BORROWER is the party that takes out the MORTGAGE LOAN for financing a property."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower is the individual or entity taking out the Mortgage Loan from Flagstar."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8552c190e01cd6c887d540f68372a1a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2fbf5161dc5c6670b7fd7548d822a73&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a40aeeabaca2a4a97b1dd8ad35ab142e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;FORBEARANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">11.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A Borrower may request forbearance for their Mortgage Loan under specific circumstances, affecting loan payment status."&lt;SEP&gt;"Forbearance allows a Borrower to temporarily pause their Mortgage Loan payments during financial hardship."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b2fbf5161dc5c6670b7fd7548d822a73</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;PRELIMINARY APPROVAL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Preliminary Approval is a step in the process that assesses the Borrower's qualifications for a Mortgage Loan."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b2fbf5161dc5c6670b7fd7548d822a73</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;MORTGAGE LOAN DOCUMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">17.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The BORROWER must sign and comply with the MORTGAGE LOAN DOCUMENTS related to the loan process."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower is required to sign all Mortgage Loan Documents during the loan origination process."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8552c190e01cd6c887d540f68372a1a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2fbf5161dc5c6670b7fd7548d822a73</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;MORTGAGE LOAN PROGRAM&quot;">
  <data key="d4">10.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower is eligible for a Mortgage Loan Program depending on their financial qualifications and creditworthiness."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b2fbf5161dc5c6670b7fd7548d822a73</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;MORTGAGE LOAN AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">17.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower enters into a Mortgage Loan Agreement that specifies the conditions under which the loan is issued."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Mortgage Loan Agreement outlines the terms and responsibilities that the Borrower must adhere to regarding the loan."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2292650099ea1cdf5881f79ed28d3cfc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;MORTGAGE INSURANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower may be required to obtain Mortgage Insurance to protect the lender in case of default on the Mortgage Loan."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2292650099ea1cdf5881f79ed28d3cfc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;DEED OF TRUST&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The BORROWER may be involved with the DEED OF TRUST as part of securing a MORTGAGE LOAN."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8552c190e01cd6c887d540f68372a1a9</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;LEGAL GUIDE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The BORROWER should refer to the LEGAL GUIDE for understanding their rights and obligations regarding the MORTGAGE LOAN."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8552c190e01cd6c887d540f68372a1a9</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;MORTGAGE LOANS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The BORROWER secures funding through various MORTGAGE LOANS to finance property acquisitions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8552c190e01cd6c887d540f68372a1a9</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;HIGH-COST LOANS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"BORROWER may be subject to terms of HIGH-COST LOANS if the loan exceeds certain thresholds as defined by law."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8552c190e01cd6c887d540f68372a1a9</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;INVESTOR GUIDELINES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The BORROWER's loan is influenced by INVESTOR GUIDELINES that set standards for mortgage lending."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8552c190e01cd6c887d540f68372a1a9</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;APPLICABLE LAW&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The BORROWER must adhere to all APPLICABLE LAW relevant to the MORTGAGE LOAN and property ownership."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8552c190e01cd6c887d540f68372a1a9</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;INSURANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The BORROWER is often required to obtain INSURANCE on the MORTGAGE PROPERTY as part of the loan conditions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8552c190e01cd6c887d540f68372a1a9</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;REAL ESTATE AGENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"REAL ESTATE AGENTS assist the BORROWER in finding suitable properties and negotiating purchase terms, influencing the mortgage loan process."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fc9e5323cf1da974f74cdcad0aebf55d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;DOCUMENTS AND INFORMATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The documents and information provided by the BORROWER are essential for processing and approving the MORTGAGE LOAN."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fc9e5323cf1da974f74cdcad0aebf55d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;REAL ESTATE DEVELOPERS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"REAL ESTATE DEVELOPERS work closely with the BORROWER to provide properties for mortgage financing."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fc9e5323cf1da974f74cdcad0aebf55d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;LOAN PURCHASE AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The LOAN PURCHASE AGREEMENT outlines the terms that govern interactions involving the BORROWER's mortgage loan."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fc9e5323cf1da974f74cdcad0aebf55d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;AGENCY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The AGENCY's regulations often guide the lending practices and terms under which the BORROWER receives the mortgage."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fc9e5323cf1da974f74cdcad0aebf55d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;MORTGAGEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">10.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The borrower and mortgagee relationship is fundamental in any mortgage transaction, establishing lender and borrower roles."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e8760dceb193fd7c5f24d24209ee5e31</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;CHANGE OF CIRCUMSTANCE REQUEST&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The borrower typically initiates the change of circumstance request related to their loan conditions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-de34030d71ef2c627010a089db20697c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;OCCUPANCY CHANGE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The borrower must report any changes in occupancy status which may affect loan eligibility and terms."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-de34030d71ef2c627010a089db20697c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;PROPERTY TYPE CHANGE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The borrower may need to provide information about property type changes that affect loan approval or terms."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-de34030d71ef2c627010a089db20697c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;RATE LOCK / LOCK EXTENSION / INTEREST RATE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The borrower must be informed about any changes to rate locks and how they impact the interest on their loan."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-de34030d71ef2c627010a089db20697c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;MORTGAGE CONSULTANT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The borrower interacts with the mortgage consultant to discuss the details and requirements of the mortgage process."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-283d5323d92a66b703dacfb0b3c98a37</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;MI PROGRAM CHANGE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The borrower is involved in requesting a change to the MI program, indicating a direct action related to their mortgage."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-283d5323d92a66b703dacfb0b3c98a37</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;ESCROW ACCOUNT SELECTION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The borrower has requested a change in the escrow account selection, showing their active participation in managing their mortgage details."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-283d5323d92a66b703dacfb0b3c98a37</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;APPLICATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The application is submitted by the borrower as part of the mortgage process, detailing their financial situation and the property involved."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-283d5323d92a66b703dacfb0b3c98a37</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;APPLICANT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The borrower is essentially the applicant in the mortgage application process, responsible for providing necessary information."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-283d5323d92a66b703dacfb0b3c98a37</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;CONSULTANT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The borrower communicates with the consultant to understand mortgage-related inquiries and decisions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-283d5323d92a66b703dacfb0b3c98a37</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;CHANGE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The borrower has the ability to request changes in their mortgage arrangements, such as adjustments to the escrow or MI program."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-283d5323d92a66b703dacfb0b3c98a37</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;CREDIT HISTORY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A borrower's credit history is vital for loan approval and affects their eligibility and terms."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ca3069902295dcf5b2b505753d7623f3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;FINANCED PROPERTIES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Limits on the number of financed properties owned by a borrower affect loan applications and approvals."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ca3069902295dcf5b2b505753d7623f3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;CREDIT REQUIREMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The BORROWER must meet specific CREDIT REQUIREMENTS outlined in the guidelines for lending."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-150cc6b2e7ba7007f09ed79ae5042c88</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;VERIFICATION OF MORTGAGE (VOM)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The BORROWER's mortgage payment history must be verified using the VERIFICATION OF MORTGAGE (VOM) process."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-150cc6b2e7ba7007f09ed79ae5042c88</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;CO-SIGNER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A co-signer is considered a borrower and therefore their delinquent credit impacts the overall evaluation of the loan, highlighting their connection."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7240c801a08e04a5a9db69a7879361cf</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;INCOME DOCUMENTATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Borrowers must provide income documentation as part of the qualification process for loans, establishing a direct link between the two."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7240c801a08e04a5a9db69a7879361cf</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;401(K)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Distributions from a 401(K) can be used as qualifying income for the borrower, indicating a direct financial relationship."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ed5c9771e9d7f170cab82a4f6e0fe9c6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;IRA&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"IRA distributions are also considered qualifying income for the borrower, linking the two entities financially."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ed5c9771e9d7f170cab82a4f6e0fe9c6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;SELF-EMPLOYED&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The borrower is classified as self-employed if they have significant ownership in a business, affecting their income verification requirements."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ed5c9771e9d7f170cab82a4f6e0fe9c6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;SIGNED FEDERAL INCOME TAX RETURNS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Signed federal income tax returns are required documentation for the borrower's income verification."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ed5c9771e9d7f170cab82a4f6e0fe9c6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;HOUSING ALLOWANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Housing allowance received by ministers is considered income for qualifying the borrower, establishing a direct relationship."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ed5c9771e9d7f170cab82a4f6e0fe9c6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;TAX RETURNS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Tax returns are crucial for verifying the borrower's income and financial status."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ed5c9771e9d7f170cab82a4f6e0fe9c6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;DISTRIBUTION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Distributions from retirement accounts can provide qualifying income for the borrower, establishing a financial relationship."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ed5c9771e9d7f170cab82a4f6e0fe9c6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;MARKET TRENDS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Market trends can affect the borrower’s financial options and how their assets are assessed."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ed5c9771e9d7f170cab82a4f6e0fe9c6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;VOLATILE ASSETS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Volatile assets can influence the borrower's financial qualifications due to their fluctuating nature."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ed5c9771e9d7f170cab82a4f6e0fe9c6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;ANNUAL EARNINGS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">14.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Borrowers' annual earnings must meet specific thresholds to qualify for loan submission and processing."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower's annual earnings must be stable or increasing to be acceptable for loan qualifications."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8ec9b17609d27a36004f6e85b0cb3ecf</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;W2&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower must provide a W2 along with the most recent pay stub to verify income for qualification purposes."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8ec9b17609d27a36004f6e85b0cb3ecf</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;CPA/TAX PREPARER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A CPA/Tax Preparer may provide confirmation of the Borrower's business existence for loan qualification purposes."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8ec9b17609d27a36004f6e85b0cb3ecf</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;BRIDGE LOANS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Borrowers may utilize bridge loans as a financing option during transitions between property ownerships."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8ec9b17609d27a36004f6e85b0cb3ecf</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;IRS FORM 1040&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower provides IRS FORM 1040 as part of the standard income documentation requirements for loan processing."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8ec9b17609d27a36004f6e85b0cb3ecf</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;WRITTEN VERIFICATION OF EMPLOYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Written Verification of Employment is necessary to confirm the income status of the Borrower in the loan application."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8ec9b17609d27a36004f6e85b0cb3ecf</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;STUDENT LOANS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The borrower must provide documentation of monthly student loan payments to qualify for loans."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5c2f4d692a0955d46073163734c23b26</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;CASH TO BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
