  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Delinquent credit may be considered differently if it belongs to an ex-spouse, indicating a conditional relationship based on documentation."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-cb4e4bbf1091286e7015a8784c37cbc2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DELINQUENT CREDIT&quot;" target="&quot;DELINQUENT CREDIT BELONGING TO CO-SIGNER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Delinquent credit belonging to a co-signer must be evaluated as it impacts the loan with the borrower, showing interdependency."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-cb4e4bbf1091286e7015a8784c37cbc2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DELINQUENT CREDIT&quot;" target="&quot;TITLE TRANSFER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Evidence of title transfer is required when examining delinquent credit linked to a mortgage, showing the connection between them."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-cb4e4bbf1091286e7015a8784c37cbc2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DELINQUENT CREDIT&quot;" target="&quot;LOAN APPLICATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Delinquent credit must be assessed during the loan application process, indicating a direct relationship."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-cb4e4bbf1091286e7015a8784c37cbc2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DELINQUENT CREDIT&quot;" target="&quot;BANKRUPTCY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Delinquent credit evaluations must consider bankruptcy history, showcasing their intertwined nature."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-cb4e4bbf1091286e7015a8784c37cbc2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DELINQUENT CREDIT&quot;" target="&quot;CHARGE-OFFS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Delinquent credit must be paid off before closing a loan, which shows the relationship between these two financial concepts."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7240c801a08e04a5a9db69a7879361cf</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DELINQUENT CREDIT&quot;" target="&quot;JUDGMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Judgments are included in delinquent credit, affecting the credit evaluation and therefore the ability to acquire loans."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7240c801a08e04a5a9db69a7879361cf</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DELINQUENT CREDIT&quot;" target="&quot;LIENS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both liens and delinquent credit must be settled to ensure clear title and eligibility for loans."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7240c801a08e04a5a9db69a7879361cf</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DELINQUENT CREDIT&quot;" target="&quot;MEDICAL COLLECTIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">11.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Medical collections are a type of delinquent credit that can affect a borrower's credit evaluation and loan eligibility."&lt;SEP&gt;"Medical collections are treated differently under specific conditions for loan qualification, which relates them to delinquent credit issues."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7240c801a08e04a5a9db69a7879361cf</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DELINQUENT CREDIT&quot;" target="&quot;EX-SPOUSE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Delinquent credit from an ex-spouse can be excluded from credit evaluations if specific legal documentation is provided, showing a relationship to account evaluations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7240c801a08e04a5a9db69a7879361cf</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
