  <data key="d4">15.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"In a LOAN MODIFICATION scenario, making TIMELY PAYMENTS is critical to maintaining the modified terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Making TIMELY PAYMENTS is essential for borrowers undergoing LOAN MODIFICATION to maintain favorable terms."</data>
