</edge>
<edge source="&quot;JUDGMENTS&quot;" target="&quot;LIENS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">13.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Judgments can create liens against property, directly impacting title and financial transactions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Judgments can lead to liens being placed on property, affecting the financial standing of a borrower and their ability to secure a loan."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-cb4e4bbf1091286e7015a8784c37cbc2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7240c801a08e04a5a9db69a7879361cf</data>
