</edge>
<edge source="&quot;JUDGMENTS&quot;" target="&quot;COLLECTIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">25.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"COLLECTIONS and JUDGMENTS must be resolved before any lending processes are finalized."&lt;SEP&gt;"Collections and judgments are both types of derogatory credit impacting financial assessments."&lt;SEP&gt;"Judgments can lead to collections, indicating their relationship in the context of credit impacts."&lt;SEP&gt;"JUDGMENTS can arise from COLLECTIONS efforts when debt remains unpaid following legal action."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-cb4e4bbf1091286e7015a8784c37cbc2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-150cc6b2e7ba7007f09ed79ae5042c88</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
