  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Mechanics liens are a specific type of lien that must be resolved before closing."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-cb4e4bbf1091286e7015a8784c37cbc2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LIENS&quot;" target="&quot;SCHEDULE B1&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Liens must be satisfied and released as detailed on Schedule B1, establishing a relationship between lien obligations and closing requirements."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9351b24bca225d97ff2d45b46310a878</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LIENS&quot;" target="&quot;INSURABLE TITLE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"LIENS must not exist against the property to ensure the INSURABLE TITLE."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-150cc6b2e7ba7007f09ed79ae5042c88</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LIENS&quot;" target="&quot;JUDICIAL DECISIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"JUDICIAL DECISIONS can establish or resolve LIENS to enforce payment obligations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-150cc6b2e7ba7007f09ed79ae5042c88</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LIENS&quot;" target="&quot;DEBT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Debts may result in liens on properties, indicating a financial obligation that needs to be resolved for loan eligibility."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7240c801a08e04a5a9db69a7879361cf</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LIENS&quot;" target="&quot;TITLE INSURANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Title insurance protects against claims like liens on the property, indicating a relationship in the context of securing loans."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7240c801a08e04a5a9db69a7879361cf</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COLLECTIONS&quot;" target="&quot;CHARGE-OFFS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">11.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Charge-offs are a specific type of collection activity that indicates the lender's loss on a loan, linking them together."&lt;SEP&gt;"Collections and charge-offs both refer to debts that have not been repaid, impacting credit evaluations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-cb4e4bbf1091286e7015a8784c37cbc2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7240c801a08e04a5a9db69a7879361cf</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COLLECTIONS&quot;" target="&quot;IRS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"COLLECTIONS can involve debts owed to the IRS if unpaid taxes lead to legal action."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-150cc6b2e7ba7007f09ed79ae5042c88</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COLLECTIONS&quot;" target="&quot;DEBT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Collections are efforts to recover debt, indicating a strong relationship between the existence of debt and collections actions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7240c801a08e04a5a9db69a7879361cf</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BANKRUPTCY&quot;" target="&quot;THREE CONSECUTIVE TIMELY PAYMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Three consecutive timely payments are required post-bankruptcy to qualify for new loans, linking these two entities."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-cb4e4bbf1091286e7015a8784c37cbc2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BANKRUPTCY&quot;" target="&quot;PROPERTY RESOLUTION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Property resolution relates to bankruptcy discharge dates, indicating a phase of resolving financial obligations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-cb4e4bbf1091286e7015a8784c37cbc2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BANKRUPTCY&quot;" target="&quot;HOUSING EVENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"BANKRUPTCY can affect a borrower's eligibility for loans in conjunction with HOUSING EVENTS."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-150cc6b2e7ba7007f09ed79ae5042c88</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BANKRUPTCY&quot;" target="&quot;DELINGUENCY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"BANKRUPTCY is a type of financial situation that leads to DELINQUENCY in credit payments."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-150cc6b2e7ba7007f09ed79ae5042c88</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BANKRUPTCY&quot;" target="&quot;NOTICE OF DEFAULT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A NOTICE OF DEFAULT can occur when a borrower is in Bankruptcy due to missed payments."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-150cc6b2e7ba7007f09ed79ae5042c88</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BANKRUPTCY&quot;" target="&quot;LOAN APPLICATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Borrowers under a repayment plan of Bankruptcy are ineligible for loan applications, indicating a direct impact of bankruptcy status on loan eligibility."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7240c801a08e04a5a9db69a7879361cf</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CANCELED CHECKS&quot;" target="&quot;BANK RECORDS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both bank records and canceled checks serve as evidence for verifying payments, highlighting their relationship."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-cb4e4bbf1091286e7015a8784c37cbc2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SINGLE HOUSING EVENT&quot;" target="&quot;HOSING EVENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Housing events can be categorized under single housing events, indicating their connection based on timing and impact on credit."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-cb4e4bbf1091286e7015a8784c37cbc2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FORBEARANCE&quot;" target="&quot;FINANCIAL OBLIGATIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Forbearance agreements require that all financial obligations are met, indicating a relationship based on compliance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-cb4e4bbf1091286e7015a8784c37cbc2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FORBEARANCE&quot;" target="&quot;AGENCY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Agency may set guidelines for Forbearance programs that borrowers can utilize during financial difficulties."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b2fbf5161dc5c6670b7fd7548d822a73</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FORBEARANCE&quot;" target="&quot;CLOSING&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Closing procedures may need to consider a Borrower's request for forbearance, which can affect Mortgage Loan terms."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b2fbf5161dc5c6670b7fd7548d822a73</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FORBEARANCE&quot;" target="&quot;SECONDARY MARKET&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Forbearance arrangements can affect the marketability of existing loans within the Secondary Market."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b2fbf5161dc5c6670b7fd7548d822a73</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FORBEARANCE&quot;" target="&quot;FORECLOSURE NOTICE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A FORECLOSURE NOTICE may accompany a FORBEARANCE agreement to alert parties of pending action."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-150cc6b2e7ba7007f09ed79ae5042c88</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FORBEARANCE&quot;" target="&quot;DELINQUENCY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"FORBEARANCE agreements typically arise from situations resulting in DELINQUENCY, allowing borrowers temporary relief."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-150cc6b2e7ba7007f09ed79ae5042c88</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FORBEARANCE&quot;" target="&quot;INCOME-DRIVEN PAYMENT PLAN&quot;">
  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An income-driven payment plan is relevant for managing payments on loans that may be in forbearance."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loans in forbearance need to be calculated under income-driven payment plans for qualification."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5c2f4d692a0955d46073163734c23b26</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FORBEARANCE&quot;" target="&quot;DEFERRED LOANS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Deferred loans indicate loans that may be in forbearance and require specific handling during qualification."&lt;SEP&gt;"Forbearance relates to deferred loans in how payments are managed during the qualification process."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5c2f4d692a0955d46073163734c23b26</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FORBEARANCE&quot;" target="&quot;REPAYMENT AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A repayment agreement is necessary for loans that are in forbearance to establish a payment plan."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5c2f4d692a0955d46073163734c23b26</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LOAN APPLICATION&quot;" target="&quot;RECENT BANK STATEMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Recent bank statements are required as part of the loan application to verify the borrower's financial status."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-cb4e4bbf1091286e7015a8784c37cbc2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LOAN APPLICATION&quot;" target="&quot;SUBMISSION METHOD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">17.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Submission Method is a critical part of the Loan Application process, demonstrating a procedural relationship in securing a loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Submission Method is a key factor in the Loan Application process, indicating a procedural relationship."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1418f5447a956615e29938e7c6f0f71a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LOAN APPLICATION&quot;" target="&quot;COVER LETTER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A COVER LETTER is often included with the LOAN APPLICATION to provide additional context or explanation regarding the borrower's situation."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-150cc6b2e7ba7007f09ed79ae5042c88</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LOAN APPLICATION&quot;" target="&quot;LOAN TERMS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Loan Terms are defined and agreed upon during the Loan Application process, affecting overall acceptance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5b42b071e6198f2a53344eeed3e0dca2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LOAN APPLICATION&quot;" target="&quot;ABC COMPANY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The loan application process may require the involvement of ABC Company for endorsement and compliance."&lt;</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FINANCIAL OBLIGATIONS&quot;" target="&quot;HOSING EVENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Financial obligations are considered when evaluating housing events related to delinquency or bankruptcy."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-cb4e4bbf1091286e7015a8784c37cbc2</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BUSINESS NARRATIVE&quot;" target="&quot;OWNERSHIP VALIDATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Business Narrative must include proof of ownership percentage, which is necessary to validate business existence."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f18d8da3052c73dc1f9fa6e9aef1a14e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BUSINESS NARRATIVE&quot;" target="&quot;COMMERCIAL OR RETAIL CLIENT BASE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Business Narrative must describe the Commercial or Retail client base, which is vital for assessing business health in loan applications."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f18d8da3052c73dc1f9fa6e9aef1a14e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BUSINESS NARRATIVE&quot;" target="&quot;SIZE/SCOPE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The size and scope of the business must be detailed in the Business Narrative, which is crucial for loan evaluation."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f18d8da3052c73dc1f9fa6e9aef1a14e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BUSINESS NARRATIVE&quot;" target="&quot;LOCATIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Locations of the business are part of the Business Narrative required for loan assessment."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f18d8da3052c73dc1f9fa6e9aef1a14e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BUSINESS NARRATIVE&quot;" target="&quot;DESCRIPTION OF GOODS/MATERIALS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Business Narrative requires a description of Goods and Materials offered, influencing business assessments in the loan process."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f18d8da3052c73dc1f9fa6e9aef1a14e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BUSINESS NARRATIVE&quot;" target="&quot;MATERIALS/TRUCKS/EQUIPMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"This component is part of the Business Narrative that helps assess the operational capacity of the business for loan qualifications."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f18d8da3052c73dc1f9fa6e9aef1a14e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PPP FUNDS&quot;" target="&quot;SBA LOANS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both SBA Loans and PPP Funds are considered in the analysis of business accounts, influencing loan qualification parameters."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f18d8da3052c73dc1f9fa6e9aef1a14e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TAX PROFESSIONAL&quot;" target="&quot;SELF EMPLOYED&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Self-Employed individuals often need to work with a Tax Professional to ensure their income is accurately represented for loan applications."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f18d8da3052c73dc1f9fa6e9aef1a14e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TAX PROFESSIONAL&quot;" target="&quot;CERTIFIED PUBLIC ACCOUNTANT (CPA)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"TAX PROFESSIONAL includes individuals such as CERTIFIED PUBLIC ACCOUNTANT (CPA), who are responsible for verifying financial statements."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5d2fd985d041d5eb6aeccbb1d21a81c4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TAX PROFESSIONAL&quot;" target="&quot;PAID TAX PROFESSIONAL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both TAX PROFESSIONAL and PAID TAX PROFESSIONAL are criteria for validating financial documentation necessary for loan applications."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5d2fd985d041d5eb6aeccbb1d21a81c4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TAX PROFESSIONAL&quot;" target="&quot;TAX ATTORNEY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"TAX ATTORNEY is one of the recognized categories associated with a TAX PROFESSIONAL for compliance in finance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5d2fd985d041d5eb6aeccbb1d21a81c4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TAX PROFESSIONAL&quot;" target="&quot;CALIFORNIA TAX EDUCATIONAL COUNCIL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"California Tax Educational Council is a credentialing body that can certify a TAX PROFESSIONAL performing financial evaluations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5d2fd985d041d5eb6aeccbb1d21a81c4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TAX PROFESSIONAL&quot;" target="&quot;ENROLLED AGENT (EA)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"ENROLLED AGENT (EA) qualifies as a type of TAX PROFESSIONAL recognized for providing tax-related services."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-5d2fd985d041d5eb6aeccbb1d21a81c4</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BUSINESS BANK STATEMENTS&quot;" target="&quot;12 MONTHS MOST RECENT BANK STATEMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The requirement for 12 months most recent bank statements is crucial for evaluating Business Bank Statements in loan applications."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f18d8da3052c73dc1f9fa6e9aef1a14e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BUSINESS BANK STATEMENTS&quot;" target="&quot;PERSONAL BANK STATEMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Personal Bank Statements may become Business Bank Statements if personal funds are used, affecting the analysis for loan qualification."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f18d8da3052c73dc1f9fa6e9aef1a14e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PERSONAL BANK STATEMENTS&quot;" target="&quot;CO-MINGLING&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Co-mingling personal and business funds is critically addressed in the guidelines surrounding Personal Bank Statements, affecting loan qualification."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f18d8da3052c73dc1f9fa6e9aef1a14e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMMERCIAL OR RETAIL CLIENT BASE&quot;" target="&quot;CLIENT BASE TYPE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Client Base Type affects whether the Client Base is Commercial or Retail, which influences the business profile for loans."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f18d8da3052c73dc1f9fa6e9aef1a14e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMMERCIAL OR RETAIL CLIENT BASE&quot;" target="&quot;NUMBER OF EMPLOYEES/CONTRACTORS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Number of Employees/Contractors can indicate the scale of the Commercial or Retail Client Base, impacting business assessments for loans."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f18d8da3052c73dc1f9fa6e9aef1a14e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SELF EMPLOYED&quot;" target="&quot;OWNERSHIP PERCENTAGE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Self-Employed borrowers must maintain at least 25% ownership to qualify for loans, linking ownership percentage to loan eligibility."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f18d8da3052c73dc1f9fa6e9aef1a14e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OWNERSHIP PERCENTAGE&quot;" target="&quot;OWNER PERCENTAGE REQUIREMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Owner Percentage Requirement relates to the documented Ownership Percentage, essential for qualifying for a loan."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f18d8da3052c73dc1f9fa6e9aef1a14e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FIXED EXPENSE RATIO METHODOLOGY&quot;" target="&quot;EXPENSE FACTOR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">14.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Expense Factor and Fixed Expense Ratio Methodology are concepts used to evaluate the financial health of a business for loan processing."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Fixed Expense Ratio Methodology relates directly to the Expense Factor assessment, influencing loan risk evaluations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f18d8da3052c73dc1f9fa6e9aef1a14e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BUSINESS PROFILE&quot;" target="&quot;NUMBER OF EMPLOYEES/CONTRACTORS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Business Profile includes the number of employees/contractors, which is relevant for understanding the business scale in loan evaluations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f18d8da3052c73dc1f9fa6e9aef1a14e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BUSINESS PROFILE&quot;" target="&quot;OPERATING PROFILE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Operating Profile is a component of the Business Profile that describes operational aspects crucial for loan evaluations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f18d8da3052c73dc1f9fa6e9aef1a14e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DESCRIPTION OF GOODS/MATERIALS&quot;" target="&quot;MATERIALS/TRUCKS/EQUIPMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Materials, trucks, and equipment must be described under Goods and Materials to give a complete picture of the business's operational capacity."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f18d8da3052c73dc1f9fa6e9aef1a14e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DECLINING INCOME&quot;" target="&quot;LETTER OF EXPLANATION (LOE)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Declining income may necessitate a Letter of Explanation (LOE), linking income stability to loan assessments."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f18d8da3052c73dc1f9fa6e9aef1a14e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DECLINING INCOME&quot;" target="&quot;INCOME WORKSHEET&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A Declining Income status must be analyzed through the Income Worksheet to assess its impact on loan qualification."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f18d8da3052c73dc1f9fa6e9aef1a14e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INCOME WORKSHEET&quot;" target="&quot;VARIABLE INCOME&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Income Worksheet is necessary to evaluate Variable Income accurately for loan qualification based on income stability."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f18d8da3052c73dc1f9fa6e9aef1a14e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OWNERSHIP VALIDATION&quot;" target="&quot;BUSINESS LICENSE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A valid Business License demonstrates Ownership Validation, verifying the legitimacy of the business for loan purposes."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f18d8da3052c73dc1f9fa6e9aef1a14e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
