  <data key="d5">"The legal description must match the property address used in the mortgage loan transaction, indicating a direct link between the two."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9351b24bca225d97ff2d45b46310a878</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MORTGAGE LOAN&quot;" target="&quot;PRIVATE INVESTOR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">14.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A PRIVATE INVESTOR may purchase the MORTGAGE LOAN from FLAGSTAR, affecting loan ownership and terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Private Investors are entities that Flagstar sells Mortgage Loans to, participating in the broader mortgage market."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a40aeeabaca2a4a97b1dd8ad35ab142e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fc9e5323cf1da974f74cdcad0aebf55d</data>
