  <data key="d6">chunk-a40aeeabaca2a4a97b1dd8ad35ab142e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MORTGAGE LOAN&quot;" target="&quot;MORTGAGE LOAN AMOUNT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The MORTGAGE LOAN AMOUNT represents the principal sum borrowed by the BORROWER in the context of the MORTGAGE LOAN."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a40aeeabaca2a4a97b1dd8ad35ab142e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MORTGAGE LOAN&quot;" target="&quot;MORTGAGE LOAN DOCUMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">27.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"MORTGAGE LOAN DOCUMENTS include all necessary paperwork that supports the terms of the MORTGAGE LOAN."&lt;SEP&gt;"The MORTGAGE LOAN is governed by MORTGAGE LOAN DOCUMENTS detailing the terms and conditions of the loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Mortgage Loan Documents are essential for defining the terms and obligations associated with the Mortgage Loan."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8552c190e01cd6c887d540f68372a1a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2292650099ea1cdf5881f79ed28d3cfc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a40aeeabaca2a4a97b1dd8ad35ab142e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MORTGAGE LOAN&quot;" target="&quot;COMMITMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A COMMITMENT indicates Flagstar's agreement to purchase a specific MORTGAGE LOAN under specified conditions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a40aeeabaca2a4a97b1dd8ad35ab142e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MORTGAGE LOAN&quot;" target="&quot;SELLER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">32.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The SELLER is responsible for adherence to the terms and conditions set forth in the Loan Purchase Agreement concerning the MORTGAGE LOAN."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Seller intends to sell one or more Mortgage Loans to Flagstar under the Loan Purchase Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Seller is directly tied to the Mortgage Loan as they are responsible for reimbursements related to it."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Seller is responsible for facilitating the Mortgage Loan through the delivery of necessary documents and meeting obligations to FLAGSTAR."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-132b3969367ecce54c6730fb570430ea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2fbf5161dc5c6670b7fd7548d822a73&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2292650099ea1cdf5881f79ed28d3cfc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fc9e5323cf1da974f74cdcad0aebf55d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MORTGAGE LOAN&quot;" target="&quot;CLOSING&quot;">
  <data key="d4">17.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The CLOSING of a MORTGAGE LOAN involves the finalization of terms and the execution of required documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Mortgage Loan is finalized through the Closing process, which involves payments and documentation."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b2fbf5161dc5c6670b7fd7548d822a73&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fc9e5323cf1da974f74cdcad0aebf55d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MORTGAGE LOAN&quot;" target="&quot;CLOSING DISCLOSURE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">17.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Closing Disclosure is a key document that outlines the details of the Mortgage Loan at closing."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Closing Disclosure provides crucial details about the Mortgage Loan terms at the closing stage."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b2fbf5161dc5c6670b7fd7548d822a73</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MORTGAGE LOAN&quot;" target="&quot;FIRST CONTACT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The First Contact is crucial during the initiation of any Mortgage Loan process, establishing communication."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b2fbf5161dc5c6670b7fd7548d822a73</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MORTGAGE LOAN&quot;" target="&quot;SALES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Sales involve the selling of Mortgage Loans to secondary market investors, overseen by Flagstar."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b2fbf5161dc5c6670b7fd7548d822a73</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MORTGAGE LOAN&quot;" target="&quot;SERVICING RIGHTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Servicing Rights pertain to the administration of the Mortgage Loan, managed by Flagstar after acquisition."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b2fbf5161dc5c6670b7fd7548d822a73</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MORTGAGE LOAN&quot;" target="&quot;UNDERWRITING ERROR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">15.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An Underwriting Error can result in a disqualification of the Mortgage Loan application, affecting the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"An Underwriting Error may impact the approval status of the Mortgage Loan, highlighting the importance of accurate assessments."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b2fbf5161dc5c6670b7fd7548d822a73</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MORTGAGE LOAN&quot;" target="&quot;PRIMARY MARKETS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Primary Markets are where Mortgage Loans are initially offered and sold, including Flagstar's offerings."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b2fbf5161dc5c6670b7fd7548d822a73</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MORTGAGE LOAN&quot;" target="&quot;AGENCY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">15.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Agency makes demands on Flagstar concerning the Mortgage Loan, showcasing its role in the mortgage ecosystem."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Agency oversees compliance and guidelines for the Mortgage Loan to ensure market standards are met."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-132b3969367ecce54c6730fb570430ea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2fbf5161dc5c6670b7fd7548d822a73</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MORTGAGE LOAN&quot;" target="&quot;HOME OWNERSHIP AND EQUITY PROTECTION ACT OF 1994&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Mortgage Loan is subject to regulations established by the Home Ownership and Equity Protection Act of 1994, impacting its classification and terms."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2292650099ea1cdf5881f79ed28d3cfc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MORTGAGE LOAN&quot;" target="&quot;MORTGAGE LOAN PROGRAM&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Mortgage Loan is created under a specific Mortgage Loan Program that dictates its conditions and requirements."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2292650099ea1cdf5881f79ed28d3cfc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MORTGAGE LOAN&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER RIGHTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower's rights are directly tied to the terms of the Mortgage Loan, influencing their obligations and protections as a borrower."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2292650099ea1cdf5881f79ed28d3cfc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MORTGAGE LOAN&quot;" target="&quot;REGULATORS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">13.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Regulators oversee the legal compliance and protect the interests of all parties involved in the Mortgage Loan process."&lt;SEP&gt;"Regulators, including the OCC, oversee the compliance regulations governing the Mortgage Loan, ensuring legal adherence."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2292650099ea1cdf5881f79ed28d3cfc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MORTGAGE LOAN&quot;" target="&quot;TITLE INSURANCE POLICY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Title Insurance Policy secures FLAGSTAR's interest in the mortgage property by providing coverage against title defects that could affect the mortgage investment."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2292650099ea1cdf5881f79ed28d3cfc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MORTGAGE LOAN&quot;" target="&quot;INVESTOR GUIDELINES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Mortgage Loan must comply with established Investor Guidelines, which affect risk assessment and funding."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2292650099ea1cdf5881f79ed28d3cfc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MORTGAGE LOAN&quot;" target="&quot;MORTGAGE PROPERTY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">28.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The MORTGAGE LOAN is secured by the MORTGAGE PROPERTY, which serves as collateral for the loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Mortgage Loan is directly secured by the Mortgaged Property, providing collateral to the lender."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Mortgage Loan is secured by the Mortgaged Property, establishing a direct financial relationship based on collateral."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8552c190e01cd6c887d540f68372a1a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2292650099ea1cdf5881f79ed28d3cfc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MORTGAGE LOAN&quot;" target="&quot;DOCUMENT #4001-C&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Document #4001-C is referenced in connection with the requirements and regulations governing the Mortgage Loan."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2292650099ea1cdf5881f79ed28d3cfc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MORTGAGE LOAN&quot;" target="&quot;ESCROW&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Escrow involves holding funds which may be required for municipal charges or other expenses related to the Mortgage Loan."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2292650099ea1cdf5881f79ed28d3cfc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MORTGAGE LOAN&quot;" target="&quot;MUNICIPAL CHARGES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Municipal charges must be paid in relation to the Mortgage Loan, impacting ownership and rights associated with the Mortgage Property."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2292650099ea1cdf5881f79ed28d3cfc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MORTGAGE LOAN&quot;" target="&quot;TAXES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Taxes are obligations tied to the Mortgaged Property and must be considered in the context of the Mortgage Loan agreement."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2292650099ea1cdf5881f79ed28d3cfc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MORTGAGE LOAN&quot;" target="&quot;LIFE OF LOAN&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The life of the loan establishes the duration of the Borrower's obligation under the Mortgage Loan, affecting payment terms."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2292650099ea1cdf5881f79ed28d3cfc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MORTGAGE LOAN&quot;" target="&quot;PURCHASE DATE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Purchase Date is a critical milestone for the Mortgage Loan, marking when the funds are disbursed or the property is acquired."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2292650099ea1cdf5881f79ed28d3cfc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MORTGAGE LOAN&quot;" target="&quot;UNDERWRITER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Underwriter evaluates and approves the Mortgage Loan, ensuring that it meets all necessary risk and compliance standards."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2292650099ea1cdf5881f79ed28d3cfc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MORTGAGE LOAN&quot;" target="&quot;LENDERS TITLE INSURANCE POLICY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Lender's Title Insurance Policy protects the lender's interest in the property secured by the Mortgage Loan against title defects."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2292650099ea1cdf5881f79ed28d3cfc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MORTGAGE LOAN&quot;" target="&quot;ADDITIONAL FEES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Additional fees may apply during the processing of the Mortgage Loan depending on the Seller's compliance and the nature of the loan."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2292650099ea1cdf5881f79ed28d3cfc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MORTGAGE LOAN&quot;" target="&quot;COMPLIANCE EVIDENCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Compliance evidence is necessary to verify adherence to regulations surrounding the Mortgage Loan, crucial for protecting lender interests."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-2292650099ea1cdf5881f79ed28d3cfc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MORTGAGE LOAN&quot;" target="&quot;DEED OF TRUST&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The DEED OF TRUST is a critical component of the MORTGAGE LOAN structure, securing the loan with the associated property."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8552c190e01cd6c887d540f68372a1a9</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MORTGAGE LOAN&quot;" target="&quot;SAFETY STANDARDS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"MORTGAGE LOAN agreements often require compliance with certain SAFETY STANDARDS to ensure property viability."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8552c190e01cd6c887d540f68372a1a9</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MORTGAGE LOAN&quot;" target="&quot;FUNDING DATE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The FUNDING DATE signifies when the MORTGAGE LOAN is considered active and when funds are disbursed."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fc9e5323cf1da974f74cdcad0aebf55d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MORTGAGE LOAN&quot;" target="&quot;BREACHES OF WARRANTY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"BREACHES OF WARRANTY relate to any failure by the SELLER to meet the guaranteed conditions of the MORTGAGE LOAN."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fc9e5323cf1da974f74cdcad0aebf55d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MORTGAGE LOAN&quot;" target="&quot;CORRESPONDENT LEGAL GUIDE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The CORRESPONDENT LEGAL GUIDE provides a framework for ensuring compliance in the processing of MORTGAGE LOANS."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fc9e5323cf1da974f74cdcad0aebf55d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MORTGAGE LOAN&quot;" target="&quot;REMEDY OBLIGATION CONDITIONS&quot;">
