  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ESCROW WAIVER&quot;" target="&quot;MORTGAGE LOAN PAYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Borrowers must still make mortgage loan payments while complying with escrow waiver guidelines, thereby linking the two financial obligations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9a577e8766cf4f0e1ae599795cd9c6fa</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ESCROW WAIVER&quot;" target="&quot;ESCROW WAIVER FEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">14.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The ESCROW WAIVER directly correlates with the fees associated with an ESCROW WAIVER, indicating requirements for closing without escrow."&lt;SEP&gt;"The escrow waiver fee is a charge related to the waiver, establishing a financial transaction requirement tied to the waiver process."</data>
