</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LOAN PURPOSE TYPE&quot;" target="&quot;FINANCING NOT ALLOWED&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Certain LOAN PURPOSE TYPES may explicitly indicate FINANCING NOT ALLOWED specifications, influencing loan eligibility."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-060d3305d5697520404f94c4fcd2cb85</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FINANCING NOT ALLOWED&quot;" target="&quot;FINANCING&quot;">
  <data key="d4">18.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"FINANCING NOT ALLOWED explicitly states that financing cannot occur, directly opposing the concept of financing itself."&lt;SEP&gt;"Financing NOT ALLOWED indicates a restriction or condition that directly relates to the broader context of Financing."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c2b0ee234c74087767f8bbd0d6c44e7b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FINANCING NOT ALLOWED&quot;" target="&quot;ELIGIBLE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The status of ELIGIBLE may be impacted by conditions stating that FINANCING NOT ALLOWED, indicating a restrictive relationship between the two."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c2b0ee234c74087767f8bbd0d6c44e7b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FINANCING NOT ALLOWED&quot;" target="&quot;FINANCING APPROVAL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">10.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"FINANCING NOT ALLOWED essentially negates any potential for FINANCING APPROVAL to occur, showing a strong conflicting relationship."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c2b0ee234c74087767f8bbd0d6c44e7b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FINANCING NOT ALLOWED&quot;" target="&quot;APPROVE/ELIGIBLE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
