  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"SUBJECT OF LOAN is critical for defining which REAL ESTATE OWNED (REO) properties are pertinent to loan applications."&lt;SEP&gt;"The REAL ESTATE OWNED (REO) section focuses on properties that are the SUBJECT OF LOAN for financing purposes."</data>
