<edge source="&quot;INTEREST-ONLY PAYMENTS&quot;" target="&quot;PRINCIPAL, INTEREST, TAXES, AND INSURANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"During construction, Borrowers make Interest-Only Payments which later transition to payments covering Principal, Interest, Taxes, and Insurance, indicating a dynamic relationship in loan terms."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1418f5447a956615e29938e7c6f0f71a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INTEREST-ONLY PAYMENTS&quot;" target="&quot;INTEREST RESERVE ACCOUNTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">14.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Interest Reserve Accounts are related to managing Interest-Only Payments during the construction phase, illustrating a financial strategy connection."&lt;SEP&gt;"Interest reserve accounts are typically used to manage interest-only payments during a construction period, making them closely related."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1418f5447a956615e29938e7c6f0f71a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0908ef3e42a9d0bcd40742960e19dbf2</data>
