  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Closing involves the collection of Escrows for Taxes and Insurance, showing a procedural connection between these two elements."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1418f5447a956615e29938e7c6f0f71a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
