  <data key="d4">17.5</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Closing Package provides necessary documents for the Closing process in real estate transactions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The closing process involves assembling a closing package that contains all necessary documents for finalizing a real estate transaction."</data>
  <data key="d6">&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9351b24bca225d97ff2d45b46310a878</data>
