  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CLOSING&quot;" target="&quot;PROPERTY SELLER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The closing process typically involves the property seller, indicating their critical role in the transaction."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6f08c1849f1a1e52584c06fc2286667f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CLOSING&quot;" target="&quot;DISBURSEMENT DATE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">17.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The CLOSING event occurs before the DISBURSEMENT DATE, which is when funds are distributed to finalize the transaction."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Closing marks the point at which funds are disbursed on the Disbursement Date as part of the mortgage process."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a40aeeabaca2a4a97b1dd8ad35ab142e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CLOSING&quot;" target="&quot;REAL ESTATE SETTLEMENT PROCEDURES ACT AND REGULATION X (RESPA)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
