  <data key="d6">chunk-ea9eec682fb4dbe92270f8b8c48a9354</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CLOSING DISCLOSURE&quot;" target="&quot;RIGHT OF RESCISSION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Closing Disclosure is required to be provided in conjunction with the Right of Rescission to inform borrowers of their rights."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-dc8b7db5bf49f6eb8f1e8daa83b6b361</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CLOSING DISCLOSURE&quot;" target="&quot;ACKNOWLEDGMENT LINES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Acknowledgment Lines are part of the documentation process for the Closing Disclosure that borrowers must sign to confirm receipt."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-dc8b7db5bf49f6eb8f1e8daa83b6b361</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CLOSING DISCLOSURE&quot;" target="&quot;LEGAL HOLIDAYS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Legal Holidays impact the timing of the Closing Disclosure and the calculation of the rescission period as they are not included in business days."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-dc8b7db5bf49f6eb8f1e8daa83b6b361</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CLOSING DISCLOSURE&quot;" target="&quot;RESCISSION PERIOD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Closing Disclosure must be provided to the borrower within the Rescission Period and includes important information about their right to rescind."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-dc8b7db5bf49f6eb8f1e8daa83b6b361</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CLOSING DISCLOSURE&quot;" target="&quot;CLOSING DISCLOSURE (CD)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Closing Disclosure (CD) serves as a key document for informing the borrower about their rights under the Right of Rescission."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-dc8b7db5bf49f6eb8f1e8daa83b6b361</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CLOSING DISCLOSURE&quot;" target="&quot;CLOSING INSTRUCTIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
