  <data key="d5">"The Creditor's Rights Exclusion language adopted by ALTA must not appear in title policies, linking standard practices in title insurance to creditor concerns."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9351b24bca225d97ff2d45b46310a878</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ALTA&quot;" target="&quot;AMERICAN LAND TITLE ASSOCIATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"ALTA is the acronym for the American Land Title Association, which it represents."&lt;</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LENDER'S POLICY&quot;" target="&quot;TITLE INSURANCE COMPANY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.5</data>
  <data key="d5">"A Lender's policy is a specific product offered by a Title Insurance Company to protect lenders against title defects."|&gt;</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;OWNER'S POLICY&quot;" target="&quot;TITLE INSURANCE COMPANY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.5</data>
  <data key="d5">"An Owner's policy is also issued by a Title Insurance Company, protecting the homeowner's equity against title issues."|&gt;</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SCHEDULE A&quot;" target="&quot;SCHEDULE B1&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Schedule A provides transaction information while Schedule B1 details requirements that must be met to close, linking both schedules in the title review process."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9351b24bca225d97ff2d45b46310a878</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SCHEDULE A&quot;" target="&quot;REVOCABLE LIVING TRUST&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Vesting in a Revocable Living Trust is mentioned in Schedule A which connects estate planning with title transactions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9351b24bca225d97ff2d45b46310a878</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SCHEDULE A&quot;" target="&quot;APPLICATION AND SYSTEM&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The application and system used must correspond accurately with the names listed in Schedule A, connecting application data with transaction details."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9351b24bca225d97ff2d45b46310a878</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SCHEDULE A&quot;" target="&quot;COVERAGE AMOUNT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The coverage amount listed on Schedule A is essential for determining how much protection the title insurance policy provides."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9351b24bca225d97ff2d45b46310a878</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SCHEDULE B1&quot;" target="&quot;DELIVERY PACKAGE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Schedule B1 details the requirements that must be satisfied before closing, which are vital components of the closing or funding manager's duties."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9351b24bca225d97ff2d45b46310a878</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SCHEDULE B1&quot;" target="&quot;DEEDS OF TRUSTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Deeds of Trusts are detailed in Schedule B1 as requirements that must be met before closing, linking the trust documents to the closing process."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9351b24bca225d97ff2d45b46310a878</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SCHEDULE B1&quot;" target="&quot;DELINQUENT TAX BILLS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Delinquent tax bills must be satisfied as specified in Schedule B1, connecting the obligation of paying taxes with the closing process."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9351b24bca225d97ff2d45b46310a878</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SCHEDULE B2&quot;" target="&quot;EXCEPTIONS TO TITLE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Schedule B2 lists exceptions to title, outlining specific items excluded from coverage, directly relating to exceptions to title."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9351b24bca225d97ff2d45b46310a878</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SCHEDULE B2&quot;" target="&quot;STANDARD EXCEPTIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Standard exceptions are a part of Schedule B2 and describe the specific exclusions that apply to title insurance policies."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9351b24bca225d97ff2d45b46310a878</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SCHEDULE B2&quot;" target="&quot;EXCEPTION ITEM&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Exception items are specifically listed in Schedule B2, showcasing the exceptions that need to be reviewed in title insurance policies."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-9351b24bca225d97ff2d45b46310a878</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
