  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The settlement agent works closely with the title vendor to ensure compliance and processing of closing documents for HELOC transactions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The title vendor and settlement agent collaboratively ensure that necessary documentation and procedures are followed during closing."</data>
