  <data key="d5">"Settlement agents charge Title Fees as part of the closing process for HELOCs."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Settlement Agent handles the allocation and payment of Title Fees related to the HELOC transaction."&lt;SEP&gt;"Title fees must be accurately listed and managed by the Settlement Agent as part of the closing process."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-4a8254e91bb361353c2efd5fd41f17e0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a39b79f6d626310fd702e88ad4acda2b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a6589af60d5cd7b7c6c55232071772b8</data>
