  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SETTLEMENT AGENT&quot;" target="&quot;SETTLEMENT FEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The settlement agent facilitates the closing process, and the settlement fee is payable to them."&lt;SEP&gt;"The settlement agent typically manages the settlement fee associated with closing the loan."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f639d102461efe890e188cbc182dba52</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SETTLEMENT AGENT&quot;" target="&quot;CLOSING PROTECTION LETTER (CPL)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The CPL is required to be issued by an eligible Settlement Agent, linking the two entities in loan transactions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-25a82bf13c8c6a8ef98d1a15a5361ea9</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
