  <data key="d4">15.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Closing Date must coordinate with the Disbursement Date to ensure that funds are released in a timely manner."&lt;SEP&gt;"The closing date relates to when documents are signed, while the disbursement date is when funds are released, showcasing the sequence of transactions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-717a880d45de770514dc0429a3dc79f8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
