  <data key="d5">"The CLOSING DATE influences the POST FUNDING ESCROW WAIVER FEE, as it determines eligibility and timing for waiver assessments."&lt;SEP&gt;"The POST FUNDING ESCROW WAIVER FEE is related to the timing of the CLOSING DATE, with implications for loan servicing post-closing."</data>
