  <data key="d4">16.2</data>
  <data key="d5">"Easements are often defined in mutual easement agreements, dictating the rights of property owners regarding shared spaces."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mutual Easement Agreements are legal frameworks surrounding the shared use of easements, directly relating to easements for property access."</data>
  <data key="d6">&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e4823f54b9e7afeaec0c69de7747fd4e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
