  <data key="d6">chunk-e4823f54b9e7afeaec0c69de7747fd4e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SURVEY EXCEPTIONS&quot;" target="&quot;SURVEY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Survey exceptions are issues identified in the survey that affect the title insurance policy and must be addressed prior to closing."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e91d1878db3c593f090cf301ec4048a9</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SURVEY EXCEPTIONS&quot;" target="&quot;INSURANCE REQUIRED&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Insurance is required when exceptions are identified in a survey that need to be addressed for a title insurance policy."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e91d1878db3c593f090cf301ec4048a9</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;HOME MORTGAGE&quot;" target="&quot;EASEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Easements must not interfere with the terms of the home mortgage, ensuring the use and enjoyment of the property for the borrower."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e4823f54b9e7afeaec0c69de7747fd4e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;HOLD HARMLESS LETTER&quot;" target="&quot;ENCROACHMENTS ON PUBLIC UTILITY EASEMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Hold Harmless Letter is required from borrowers in connection with encroachments on public utility easements to mitigate liability."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e4823f54b9e7afeaec0c69de7747fd4e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;HOLD HARMLESS LETTER&quot;" target="&quot;INDEMNITY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A Hold Harmless Letter typically includes indemnity provisions to protect against claims arising from encroachments or liabilities."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e4823f54b9e7afeaec0c69de7747fd4e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
