  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Easement owners usually share responsibilities for joint maintenance, ensuring collaborative upkeep of shared areas."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e4823f54b9e7afeaec0c69de7747fd4e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;JOINT DRIVEWAY&quot;" target="&quot;EASEMENT AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Easement agreements are essential for joint driveways, outlining the rights and responsibilities of all parties involved."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e4823f54b9e7afeaec0c69de7747fd4e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INDEMNITY&quot;" target="&quot;HOLD HARMLESS AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Indemnity is often a foundational aspect of a hold harmless agreement, protecting parties from potential losses or claims."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e4823f54b9e7afeaec0c69de7747fd4e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LIEN&quot;" target="&quot;SHARED APPRECIATION/SHARED EQUITY&quot;">
