<edge source="&quot;GIFT/GRANT PROGRAMS&quot;" target="&quot;DOWN PAYMENT ASSISTANCE PROGRAMS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"GIFT/GRANT PROGRAMS are a form of DOWN PAYMENT ASSISTANCE PROGRAMS that provide financial aid without the requirement of repayment."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-437272f81cc4575a4fa57f55ce8d121c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;GIFT/GRANT PROGRAMS&quot;" target="&quot;INELIGIBLE PROGRAM PROVIDERS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"INELIGIBLE PROGRAM PROVIDERS are specifically outlined to prevent misuse of GIFT/GRANT PROGRAMS for down payment assistance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-437272f81cc4575a4fa57f55ce8d121c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;GIFT/GRANT PROGRAMS&quot;" target="&quot;INDIVIDUAL DEVELOPMENT ACCOUNT (IDA)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"INDIVIDUAL DEVELOPMENT ACCOUNT (IDA) is a type of GIFT/GRANT PROGRAM that provides financial support without requiring repayment."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-437272f81cc4575a4fa57f55ce8d121c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;GIFT/GRANT PROGRAMS&quot;" target="&quot;AGENCY PROVIDING ASSISTANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"AGENCY PROVIDING ASSISTANCE is essential for the functioning of GIFT/GRANT PROGRAMS and often includes government and nonprofit organizations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-437272f81cc4575a4fa57f55ce8d121c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DOWN PAYMENT ASSISTANCE PROGRAMS&quot;" target="&quot;DPA&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"DPA is an acronym for DOWN PAYMENT ASSISTANCE programs, indicating a direct relationship."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-437272f81cc4575a4fa57f55ce8d121c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DOWN PAYMENT ASSISTANCE PROGRAMS&quot;" target="&quot;AWARD/APPROVAL LETTER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"DOWN PAYMENT ASSISTANCE PROGRAMS require an AWARD/APPROVAL LETTER from the agency providing assistance, linking the two entities in the funding process."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-437272f81cc4575a4fa57f55ce8d121c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DOWN PAYMENT ASSISTANCE PROGRAMS&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER'S COMMITMENT FEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A financial contribution such as a commitment fee may be required under Down Payment Assistance Programs."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fdba698a5ff7dd259797f2300b8f4759</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DOWN PAYMENT ASSISTANCE PROGRAMS&quot;" target="&quot;COMMUNITY SECOND LIEN&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Community Second Liens are often tied to specific down payment assistance programs affecting loan terms."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fdba698a5ff7dd259797f2300b8f4759</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DOWN PAYMENT ASSISTANCE PROGRAMS&quot;" target="&quot;APPROVAL LETTER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Approval letters are necessary for down payment assistance programs, confirming eligibility and terms of aid."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fdba698a5ff7dd259797f2300b8f4759</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DOWN PAYMENT ASSISTANCE PROGRAMS&quot;" target="&quot;CALIFORNIA HOUSING &amp; FINANCE AGENCY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"California Housing &amp; Finance Agency oversees and provides funding for various Down Payment Assistance Programs."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7de83587d951a7ec74fcb94d81a7df71</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DPA&quot;" target="&quot;LENDER PARTICIPATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"LENDER PARTICIPATION is a requirement for lenders to participate in the DOWN PAYMENT ASSISTANCE programs, indicating a collaborative relationship."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-437272f81cc4575a4fa57f55ce8d121c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DPA&quot;" target="&quot;CALHFA&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"CALHFA disburses funds to various agencies, which includes down-payment assistance programs (DPA)."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-75126918f0820581a7405cbda1984bbe</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DPA&quot;" target="&quot;GAP&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Down-payment Assistance Programs (DPA) help bridge the GAP between what borrowers can afford and what lenders require."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-75126918f0820581a7405cbda1984bbe</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DPA&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYER ASSISTED HOUSING&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Employer Assisted Housing programs often provide down-payment assistance to eligible employees to promote homeownership."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-75126918f0820581a7405cbda1984bbe</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DPA&quot;" target="&quot;GRANT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Grants can be a form of down-payment assistance (DPA) to help eligible homebuyers without requiring a mortgage lien."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-75126918f0820581a7405cbda1984bbe</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DPA&quot;" target="&quot;FEDERAL HOME LOAN BANK&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Federal Home Loan Bank often provides financing solutions, including down-payment assistance programs."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-75126918f0820581a7405cbda1984bbe</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DPA&quot;" target="&quot;DEFERRED PAYMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Deferred payments can be a part of down-payment assistance programs (DPA), allowing borrowers to postpone payments under certain conditions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-12641cd1a4c93cf93c1aa31082da47b7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DPA&quot;" target="&quot;FHA LOANS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"FHA loans often utilize down-payment assistance (DPA) programs to help borrowers meet initial cost requirements."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-12641cd1a4c93cf93c1aa31082da47b7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DPA&quot;" target="&quot;GIFT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"DPA programs may involve gifting funds to help with down payments, creating a close relationship with gift programs."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-12641cd1a4c93cf93c1aa31082da47b7</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DPA&quot;" target="&quot;SELLER FUNDED DPA&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"DPA (Down Payment Assistance) policies are related to Seller Funded DPA programs that assist buyers with the financial aspects of home purchases."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-30274d85a38f031223e249148db13d86</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LENDER PARTICIPATION&quot;" target="&quot;FINANCIAL CONTRIBUTION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"FINANCIAL CONTRIBUTION may be required as part of LENDER PARTICIPATION in down payment assistance programs, emphasizing the relationship between lenders and programs."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-437272f81cc4575a4fa57f55ce8d121c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LENDER PARTICIPATION&quot;" target="&quot;PROGRAM UNDERWRITING GUIDELINES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"LENDER PARTICIPATION is often governed by PROGRAM UNDERWRITING GUIDELINES, making it essential for lenders involved in down payment assistance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-437272f81cc4575a4fa57f55ce8d121c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LENDER PARTICIPATION&quot;" target="&quot;BROKER/CORRESPONDENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Lender participation requires broker/correspondent approval to participate in housing programs."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-82a675c08f3177636cb84734aead2aea</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LENDER PARTICIPATION&quot;" target="&quot;MALP&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Lender participation is necessary for the Mortgage Assistance Loan Program to function effectively."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-82a675c08f3177636cb84734aead2aea</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LENDER PARTICIPATION&quot;" target="&quot;MAP&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Lender participation is critical for the Mortgage Assistance Program to assist eligible families."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-82a675c08f3177636cb84734aead2aea</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LENDER PARTICIPATION&quot;" target="&quot;RENTENTION AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Lender participation can involve retention agreements as a means to ensure borrower compliance with program terms."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-82a675c08f3177636cb84734aead2aea</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LENDER PARTICIPATION&quot;" target="&quot;INDIAN TRIBE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Indian tribes may engage in lender participation programs under specific governmental regulations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-82a675c08f3177636cb84734aead2aea</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;GOVERNMENT ENTITIES&quot;" target="&quot;ELIGIBLE PROGRAM PROVIDERS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"GOVERNMENT ENTITIES are named as sources of eligible program providers for down payment assistance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-437272f81cc4575a4fa57f55ce8d121c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;GOVERNMENT ENTITIES&quot;" target="&quot;QUALIFIED LOAN PROVIDERS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"QUALIFIED LOAN PROVIDERS often include GOVERNMENT ENTITIES as acceptable sources for down payment assistance funding."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-437272f81cc4575a4fa57f55ce8d121c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LOAN AGREEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;DOCUMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The DOCUMENTs associated with the LOAN AGREEMENT outline the specifics and agreements made in the context of down payment assistance."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-437272f81cc4575a4fa57f55ce8d121c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DEED OF TRUST/MORTGAGE&quot;" target="&quot;SECURED LOANS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"DEED OF TRUST/MORTGAGE is the security instrument for SECURED LOANS associated with down payment assistance programs."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-437272f81cc4575a4fa57f55ce8d121c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DEED OF TRUST/MORTGAGE&quot;" target="&quot;SILENT SECOND&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Silent Second refers to a type of lien that may not have a repayment provision and can be tied to the Deed of Trust/Mortgage."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-30274d85a38f031223e249148db13d86</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RETENTION AGREEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;FINANCIAL CONTRIBUTION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"RETENTION AGREEMENTS may stipulate conditions regarding the FINANCIAL CONTRIBUTION required from borrowers or lenders in assisted transactions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-437272f81cc4575a4fa57f55ce8d121c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DOCUMENT&quot;" target="&quot;MAX ELIGIBLE LOAN PROGRAMS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The documentation includes maximum eligible loan programs, linking them logically within lending criteria."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6de80860713bbcd40afb3b3b69d1945f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DOCUMENT&quot;" target="&quot;DOC. #5301&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The specific document numbers (e.g., DOC. #5301) refer to particular guidelines or criteria associated with lending, creating a descriptive relationship."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6de80860713bbcd40afb3b3b69d1945f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DOCUMENT&quot;" target="&quot;SINGLE FINANCED MORTGAGE INSURANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.5</data>
  <data key="d5">"The document contains information specific to the Single Financed Mortgage Insurance product and its guidelines."</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DOCUMENT&quot;" target="&quot;LOAN REGISTRATION AND LOCK REQUEST&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The DOCUMENT provides necessary information to complete the LOAN REGISTRATION AND LOCK REQUEST, indicating their interdependence."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b722d926669aa7676c36ecbb75a4a233</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DOCUMENT&quot;" target="&quot;LOAN PROGRAM&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The DOCUMENT provides necessary details regarding the LOAN PROGRAM applied for and processed, indicating their dependency in the registration process."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b722d926669aa7676c36ecbb75a4a233</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DOCUMENT&quot;" target="&quot;ERROR REPORTING&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"ERROR REPORTING may involve communicating issues documented in the relevant DOCUMENT about the loan process, indicating their interdependent roles."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b722d926669aa7676c36ecbb75a4a233</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;GUIDELINES FOR DOWN PAYMENT ASSISTANCE PROGRAMS&quot;" target="&quot;UNDERWRITER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The UNDERWRITER is responsible for ensuring that the loans comply with the GUIDELINES set for DOWN PAYMENT ASSISTANCE PROGRAMS."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-437272f81cc4575a4fa57f55ce8d121c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;GUIDELINES FOR DOWN PAYMENT ASSISTANCE PROGRAMS&quot;" target="&quot;COMPLIANCE WITH FANNIE MAE, FREDDIE MAC AND HUD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"GUIDELINES FOR DOWN PAYMENT ASSISTANCE PROGRAMS must comply with FANNIE MAE, FREDDIE MAC, and HUD standards, ensuring regulatory adherence."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-437272f81cc4575a4fa57f55ce8d121c</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECURED LOANS&quot;" target="&quot;DEED RESTRICTION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"SECURED LOANS in the context of down payment assistance may involve a DEED RESTRICTION that controls the terms of borrowing."</data>
