</edge>
<edge source="&quot;HOPE&quot;" target="&quot;HOP HOMEOWNERS OPPORTUNITY PROGRAM&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"HOPE is a program related to homeowner assistance, specifically for delinquent mortgagees, while HOP is a Homeowners Opportunity Program."</data>
