  <data key="d4">21.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Community Second and Soft Second both refer to alternative financing options aimed at assisting homebuyers in purchasing properties."&lt;SEP&gt;"Community seconds are often equated with soft seconds, both providing assistance with mortgages."&lt;SEP&gt;"Soft Second is used interchangeably with Community Second, indicating they serve similar purposes in financing."</data>
