  <data key="d5">"The DEED OF TRUST is executed to secure the MORTGAGE PROPERTY, ensuring legal enforceability for the lender."&lt;SEP&gt;"The DEED OF TRUST secures the MORTGAGE PROPERTY as collateral for the loan."&lt;</data>
