  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A NOTICE OF CREDIT DENIAL is issued when the BORROWER WITHDRAWS APPLICATION and does not close with Correspondent."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8c6c6dd97681ba9caa6c83d8ddf9ec59</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER WITHDRAWS APPLICATION&quot;" target="&quot;DISCREPANCIES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"If the BORROWER WITHDRAWS APPLICATION, it can lead to DISCREPANCIES that need to be addressed by the LOCK DESK."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8c6c6dd97681ba9caa6c83d8ddf9ec59</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
