  <data key="d4">20.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"FundingAdjustment@Flagstar.com is a specific email used for communications related to the funding department, establishing a direct contact relationship."&lt;SEP&gt;"The email address FundingAdjustment@Flagstar.com is specific to the Funding Adjustment process, indicating a direct contact relationship."</data>
