  <data key="d6">chunk-c8b4e28d440c820b5ce2e89c08cd1b75</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LOAN DELIVERY&quot;" target="&quot;PAIR-OFF&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Failure to meet Loan Delivery deadlines can trigger pair-off fees for the Correspondent involved."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c8b4e28d440c820b5ce2e89c08cd1b75</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LOAN DELIVERY&quot;" target="&quot;RATE CHANGE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Rate Change requests must be resolved before final Loan Delivery takes place to avoid complications."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c8b4e28d440c820b5ce2e89c08cd1b75</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LOAN DELIVERY&quot;" target="&quot;LOAN LOCK&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Loan Delivery must occur after the Loan has been properly locked to secure the interest rate."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c8b4e28d440c820b5ce2e89c08cd1b75</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LOAN DELIVERY&quot;" target="&quot;CURE PERIOD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Delayed LOAN DELIVERY beyond expiration necessitates a CURE PERIOD for error resolution, impacting loan status."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fff6b81ef8a66ecc49bb49ef81869a5f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LOAN DELIVERY&quot;" target="&quot;EXPIRATION DATE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"LOAN DELIVERY must occur before the EXPIRATION DATE to avoid penalties or worse case pricing."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fff6b81ef8a66ecc49bb49ef81869a5f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PAIR-OFF&quot;" target="&quot;WORSE CASE PRICING&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Worse Case Pricing applies when loans are not delivered according to Lock terms, influencing pair-off fees."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c8b4e28d440c820b5ce2e89c08cd1b75</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUBSTITUTION&quot;" target="&quot;MARKET CONDITIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Market Conditions can affect the feasibility and pricing of a Loan Substitution."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c8b4e28d440c820b5ce2e89c08cd1b75</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUBSTITUTION&quot;" target="&quot;BEST EFFORTS DELIVERY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The substitution of a loan can impact the terms of Best Efforts Delivery if not managed correctly."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c8b4e28d440c820b5ce2e89c08cd1b75</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LOCK EXPIRATION DATE&quot;" target="&quot;EXTENSION GUIDELINES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">13.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Extension Guidelines become crucial as the Lock Expiration Date approaches for any pending Loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"Extension Guidelines provide options for Loans approaching Lock Expiration Date if not closed."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c8b4e28d440c820b5ce2e89c08cd1b75</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LOCK EXPIRATION DATE&quot;" target="&quot;LOAN LOCK&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Lock Expiration Date determines the timeframe in which a Loan remains locked at a given rate."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c8b4e28d440c820b5ce2e89c08cd1b75</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MARKET CONDITIONS&quot;" target="&quot;PRICE INDICTAION SHEETS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"MARKET CONDITIONS influence the updates provided in PRICE INDICATION SHEETS, showing a direct correlation between market dynamics and pricing information."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b722d926669aa7676c36ecbb75a4a233</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MARKET CONDITIONS&quot;" target="&quot;VOLATILE ASSETS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The value of volatile assets is influenced by market conditions, reflecting the relationship between financial stability and investment types."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ed5c9771e9d7f170cab82a4f6e0fe9c6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MARKET CONDITIONS&quot;" target="&quot;MARKET TRENDS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Market trends can influence overall market conditions, impacting investment values and financial qualification assessments."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-ed5c9771e9d7f170cab82a4f6e0fe9c6</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
