  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"EXTENSION GUIDELINES dictate how a loan can be extended, including recalibrating to WORSE CASE PRICING when necessary, indicating a procedural relationship."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b722d926669aa7676c36ecbb75a4a233</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EXTENSION GUIDELINES&quot;" target="&quot;MARKET BASED EXTENSION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"EXTENSION GUIDELINES provide the framework through which MARKET BASED EXTENSIONS can be executed, making their relationship procedural."&lt;SEP&gt;"MARKET BASED EXTENSION is governed by the EXTENSION GUIDELINES, establishing a procedural relationship for managing loan terms."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b722d926669aa7676c36ecbb75a4a233</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BEST EFFORTS DELIVERY&quot;" target="&quot;MANDATORY COMMITMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
