  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The THIRD EXTENSION is similarly tied to the EXPIRATION DATE, indicating it can be utilized before this date."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-780584b6e27004b17c25020078807812</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EXPIRATION DATE&quot;" target="&quot;MAXIMUM NUMBER OF LOCK EXTENSIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The MAXIMUM NUMBER OF LOCK EXTENSIONS is determined based on the total time before the EXPIRATION DATE, indicating a time-dependent relationship."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-780584b6e27004b17c25020078807812</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EXPIRATION DATE&quot;" target="&quot;RELOCK&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"When a lock exceeds the EXPIRATION DATE, a RELOCK is needed, connecting these elements through the timeline of the lock status."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-780584b6e27004b17c25020078807812</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EXPIRATION DATE&quot;" target="&quot;INITIAL LOCK DATE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The EXPIRATION DATE is directly derived from the INITIAL LOCK DATE, establishing a chronological relationship between the start and end of a loan lock period."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-780584b6e27004b17c25020078807812</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EXPIRATION DATE&quot;" target="&quot;CURE PERIOD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The CURE PERIOD is applicable after the expiration date of a lock, allowing time to resolve issues."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fff6b81ef8a66ecc49bb49ef81869a5f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EXPIRATION DATE&quot;" target="&quot;FLOAT-DOWN&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"FLOAT-DOWN processes include setting a new EXPIRATION DATE, which is a key element of the renegotiation."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-af318020d8f16430d1a60515a789d41d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PRICING&quot;" target="&quot;LOCK EXTENSION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"PRICING is detailed per LOCK EXTENSION, indicating direct relevance in cost management."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-780584b6e27004b17c25020078807812</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PRICING&quot;" target="&quot;PRICING SCHEDULE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The PRICING SCHEDULE outlines the specific PRICING for different loan lock extensions, directly linking rates to their applicable schedules."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-780584b6e27004b17c25020078807812</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PRICING&quot;" target="&quot;FLOAT-DOWN&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"FLOAT-DOWN processes involve calculating new PRICING based on current rates and caps outlined in the FLOAT-DOWN RENEGOTIATION POLICY."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-af318020d8f16430d1a60515a789d41d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FIRST EXTENSION&quot;" target="&quot;GRACE PERIOD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The GRACE PERIOD applies specifically to the FIRST EXTENSION, providing cost-free days before charges apply."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-780584b6e27004b17c25020078807812</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FIRST EXTENSION&quot;" target="&quot;MAXIMUM NUMBER OF LOCK EXTENSIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The FIRST EXTENSION is limited by the MAXIMUM NUMBER OF LOCK EXTENSIONS that can be exercised."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-780584b6e27004b17c25020078807812</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FIRST EXTENSION&quot;" target="&quot;1-30 DAYS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The FIRST EXTENSION can be requested for durations of 1-30 DAYS, clarifying the terms associated with this particular extension."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-780584b6e27004b17c25020078807812</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FIRST EXTENSION&quot;" target="&quot;LOCK EXTENSION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The FIRST EXTENSION is a specific type of LOCK EXTENSION that allows for a defined increase in lock duration, directly linking these concepts."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-780584b6e27004b17c25020078807812</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECOND EXTENSION&quot;" target="&quot;5-30 DAYS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The SECOND EXTENSION allows for extensions in increments of 5-30 DAYS, which defines the parameters for that extension period."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-780584b6e27004b17c25020078807812</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECOND EXTENSION&quot;" target="&quot;GRACE PERIOD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The concept of GRACE PERIOD is applied specifically to the SECOND EXTENSION for conditions under which fees begin, delineating financial boundaries."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-780584b6e27004b17c25020078807812</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECOND EXTENSION&quot;" target="&quot;THIRD EXTENSION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The SECOND EXTENSION and THIRD EXTENSION are both types of LOCK EXTENSIONS outlined in the policy, categorizing them under the same procedural rules."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-780584b6e27004b17c25020078807812</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECOND EXTENSION&quot;" target="&quot;ADDITIONAL FEES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Using a SECOND EXTENSION may incur ADDITIONAL FEES as outlined in the policy, showing a financial link between these terms."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-780584b6e27004b17c25020078807812</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;GRACE PERIOD&quot;" target="&quot;REPAYMENT PLAN&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A grace period is often part of a repayment plan, indicating terms under which payments can be made without penalties."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-7240c801a08e04a5a9db69a7879361cf</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RELOCK&quot;" target="&quot;ADDITIONAL FEES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"RELOCK may incur ADDITIONAL FEES, thus linking these financial aspects closely."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-780584b6e27004b17c25020078807812</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RELOCK&quot;" target="&quot;MAXIMUM NUMBER OF LOCK EXTENSIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The MAXIMUM NUMBER OF LOCK EXTENSIONS directly influences when a RELOCK is necessary, establishing a dependency framework in policy procedures."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-780584b6e27004b17c25020078807812</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RELOCK&quot;" target="&quot;INITIAL LOCK DATE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"RELOCK policies indicate that relocks may not exceed 30 days from the INITIAL LOCK DATE, which connects the two timeframes in terms of policy management."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-780584b6e27004b17c25020078807812</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RELOCK&quot;" target="&quot;CURRENT MARKET PRICE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The calculation for RELOCK pricing is based on the CURRENT MARKET PRICE in comparison to the expired lock price."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fff6b81ef8a66ecc49bb49ef81869a5f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RELOCK&quot;" target="&quot;MAXIMUM NUMBER OF EXTENSIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"RELOCK is needed once the MAXIMUM NUMBER OF EXTENSIONS has been reached for a loan."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fff6b81ef8a66ecc49bb49ef81869a5f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RELOCK&quot;" target="&quot;MARKETING FEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A MARKETING FEE may be assessed when a loan is relocked, indicating additional costs incurred during the loan process."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fff6b81ef8a66ecc49bb49ef81869a5f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RELOCK&quot;" target="&quot;30-DAY MARK&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The 30-DAY MARK specifies the time frame for eligibility of loans for re-locking without additional adjustments post-expiration."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fff6b81ef8a66ecc49bb49ef81869a5f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RELOCK&quot;" target="&quot;45-DAY MARK&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The 45-DAY MARK provides guidelines about the status of loans and their eligibility for relocks after extended expiration periods."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fff6b81ef8a66ecc49bb49ef81869a5f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RELOCK&quot;" target="&quot;NEGATIVE ADJUSTMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A NEGATIVE ADJUSTMENT may be applied during a RELOCK, affecting the interest rates based on current market conditions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fff6b81ef8a66ecc49bb49ef81869a5f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ACTIVE STATUS&quot;" target="&quot;LOCK EXTENSION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A loan must be in ACTIVE STATUS to exercise a LOCK EXTENSION, connecting these two terms directly."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-780584b6e27004b17c25020078807812</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ACTIVE STATUS&quot;" target="&quot;LOAN STATUS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The LOAN STATUS must be ACTIVE for any LOCK EXTENSION process, linking these terms within the operational framework of the policy."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-780584b6e27004b17c25020078807812</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LOAN STATUS&quot;" target="&quot;LOCK STATUS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"LOCK STATUS must be concurrent with LOAN STATUS to facilitate extensions under the policy, establishing interdependency."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-780584b6e27004b17c25020078807812</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LOAN STATUS&quot;" target="&quot;FUNDING DEPARTMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Funding Department is responsible for tracking and managing the loan status, indicating a functional relationship."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Funding Department tracks loan status, linking the department to the current state of the loan processes."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-33b3eb25dce726e663be548f3764d0e0</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LOAN STATUS&quot;" target="&quot;CANCELLATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Loan status must be communicated to manage cancellations effectively, indicating their functional interdependence."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-33b3eb25dce726e663be548f3764d0e0</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MAXIMUM NUMBER OF LOCK EXTENSIONS&quot;" target="&quot;30 TOTAL DAYS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The policy limits total lock extensions to 30 TOTAL DAYS, establishing a relationship between this time frame and the number of extensions allowed."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-780584b6e27004b17c25020078807812</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MONDAY - FRIDAY&quot;" target="&quot;BUSINESS DAY EXPIRATION DATES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The policy states that max extensions can be exercised only during MONDAY - FRIDAY business days, linking operational hours to expiration dates."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-780584b6e27004b17c25020078807812</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LAST PUBLISHED PRICING&quot;" target="&quot;PRICING SCHEDULE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"LAST PUBLISHED PRICING greatly influences the PRICING SCHEDULE for lock extensions, establishing a cyclical relationship."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-780584b6e27004b17c25020078807812</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PRICING SCHEDULE&quot;" target="&quot;EXPIRATION DATE PRICING&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"EXPIRATION DATE PRICING is part of the broader PRICING SCHEDULE, linking the specific pricing calculations to the schedule of rates for extensions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-780584b6e27004b17c25020078807812</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BUSINESS DAY EXPIRATION DATES&quot;" target="&quot;LOCK EXTENSION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"LOCK EXTENSIONS are subject to BUSINESS DAY EXPIRATION DATES, establishing a relationship that influences the timing and availability of extensions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-780584b6e27004b17c25020078807812</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FEES&quot;" target="&quot;SETTLEMENT FEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Settlement fees are a type of fee assessed during the closing of a loan transaction."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f639d102461efe890e188cbc182dba52</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;E&amp;O REPORT&quot;" target="&quot;CURE PERIOD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The E&amp;O REPORT is referenced to assist in resolving issues within the CURE PERIOD to comply with delivery timelines."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fff6b81ef8a66ecc49bb49ef81869a5f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;E&amp;O REPORT&quot;" target="&quot;OUTSTANDING ERRORS AND OMISSIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The E&amp;O REPORT is utilized to track OUTSTANDING ERRORS AND OMISSIONS that need resolution during the CURE PERIOD."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fff6b81ef8a66ecc49bb49ef81869a5f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CURE PERIOD&quot;" target="&quot;FUNDING EXTENSION FEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A FUNDING EXTENSION FEE applies if the conditions of the CURE PERIOD are not met within the stipulated timeframes."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fff6b81ef8a66ecc49bb49ef81869a5f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CURE PERIOD&quot;" target="&quot;DELIVERY REQUIREMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"DELIVERY REQUIREMENTS must be met to avoid needing a CURE PERIOD after the lock expiration date."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fff6b81ef8a66ecc49bb49ef81869a5f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CURE PERIOD&quot;" target="&quot;OUTSTANDING ERRORS AND OMISSIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The CURE PERIOD allows lenders to resolve OUTSTANDING ERRORS AND OMISSIONS that may affect loan processing."&lt;SEP&gt;"The resolution of OUTSTANDING ERRORS AND OMISSIONS must occur during the CURE PERIOD following expiration."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fff6b81ef8a66ecc49bb49ef81869a5f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CURE PERIOD&quot;" target="&quot;5 BUSINESS DAYS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">14.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A 5 BUSINESS DAYS timeframe is specified for addressing issues during the CURE PERIOD after a post-closing problem date."&lt;SEP&gt;"The 5 BUSINESS DAYS is the timeframe allowed for resolving issues during the CURE PERIOD after a loan's expiration."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fff6b81ef8a66ecc49bb49ef81869a5f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FUNDING EXTENSION FEE&quot;" target="&quot;EXTENSION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An EXTENSION may incur a FUNDING EXTENSION FEE if certain conditions regarding loan delivery are not met."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fff6b81ef8a66ecc49bb49ef81869a5f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MARKETING FEE&quot;" target="&quot;LOCK COMMITMENT EXPIRED&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A MARKETING FEE may be assessed for loans returned after being LOCK COMMITMENT EXPIRED."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fff6b81ef8a66ecc49bb49ef81869a5f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MARKETING FEE&quot;" target="&quot;LOAN PARAMETERS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Marketing fees are adjusted based on discrepancies within the accepted loan parameters for approval."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f639d102461efe890e188cbc182dba52</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MARKETING FEE&quot;" target="&quot;BUYER’S MARKET&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Marketing fees can be influenced by the current buyer’s market and its impact on loan conditions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f639d102461efe890e188cbc182dba52</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MARKETING FEE&quot;" target="&quot;FINAL DOC E&amp;O / TITLE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">4.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Marketing fees may be assessed in relation to discrepancies in title documents, showing a connection between document accuracy and promotional efforts."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c0a48a482a40438f89f44e8758608310</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MARKETING FEE&quot;" target="&quot;PROCESSING FEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Marketing and processing fees may arise concurrently in the loan approval process when discrepancies in documentation occur."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c0a48a482a40438f89f44e8758608310</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MARKETING FEE&quot;" target="&quot;CREDIT AMOUNT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The marketing fee may be linked to the credit amount provided, as it reflects the promotional activities surrounding the loan offer."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c0a48a482a40438f89f44e8758608310</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MARKETING FEE&quot;" target="&quot;MARKETING FEE DIFFERENCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The MARKETING FEE aims to address discrepancies reflected in the MARKETING FEE DIFFERENCE, linking cost assessment to pricing adjustments."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-73179b73b8a774ced8d562931d514540</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MARKETING FEE&quot;" target="&quot;DISCREPANCIES IN LOAN PARAMETERS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The MARKETING FEE is assessed to correct DISCREPANCIES IN LOAN PARAMETERS, indicating a relationship based on loan compliance and delivery accuracy."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-73179b73b8a774ced8d562931d514540</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MARKETING FEE&quot;" target="&quot;TITLE CURATIVE ISSUES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The MARKETING FEE may relate to resolving TITLE CURATIVE ISSUES that affect marketing parameters during the loan process."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-73179b73b8a774ced8d562931d514540</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EXTENSION&quot;" target="&quot;INITIAL LOCK PERIOD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An EXTENSION is only applicable within the constraints of the INITIAL LOCK PERIOD for a loan."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fff6b81ef8a66ecc49bb49ef81869a5f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;30-DAY MARK&quot;" target="&quot;LOCK COMMITMENT EXPIRED&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A lock that has been expired for 30 days or more is eligible for a new market lock without adjustment, influencing its status post LOCK COMMITMENT EXPIRED."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fff6b81ef8a66ecc49bb49ef81869a5f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;30-DAY MARK&quot;" target="&quot;45-DAY MARK&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The 30-DAY MARK and 45-DAY MARK are crucial reference points affecting the re-lock options for loans that have exceeded their initial commitment."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fff6b81ef8a66ecc49bb49ef81869a5f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;30-DAY MARK&quot;" target="&quot;MARKET LOCK&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The 30-DAY MARK is used as a reference point for determining eligibility for a MARKET LOCK after a loan's expiration."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fff6b81ef8a66ecc49bb49ef81869a5f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;45-DAY MARK&quot;" target="&quot;LOCK COMMITMENT EXPIRED&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"If a lock has been expired for 45 days or more, it allows for new locking conditions, thus affecting the LOCK COMMITMENT EXPIRED scenario."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fff6b81ef8a66ecc49bb49ef81869a5f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
