  <data key="d4">26.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The credit profile must meet the credit requirements necessary for the first mortgage and HELOC, signifying their interdependence."&lt;SEP&gt;"The credit profile must satisfy the credit requirements for approving the HELOC, thus establishing their interdependence."&lt;SEP&gt;"The evaluation of a credit profile directly informs whether a borrower meets the credit requirements, establishing a functional relationship."</data>
