<edge source="&quot;RIGHT OF RESCISSION&quot;" target="&quot;REGULATION Z&quot;">
  <data key="d4">46.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"REGULATION Z is the regulatory foundation that governs the Right of Rescission, outlining how it should be implemented."&lt;SEP&gt;"REGULATION Z outlines the provisions of the Right of Rescission which gives borrowers certain rights in credit transactions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Regulation Z outlines the legal framework under which the Right of Rescission operates, defining consumer rights in mortgage loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"Regulation Z outlines the Right of Rescission, which gives borrowers the right to cancel certain credit transactions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Regulation Z outlines the guidelines for the Right of Rescission applicable to borrowers, connecting these two legal concepts."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-42d99ce4642f1e6e8c39678043a90b1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-faf7af26dea16d8bcfcc9a3324ded2bc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-25a82bf13c8c6a8ef98d1a15a5361ea9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc8b7db5bf49f6eb8f1e8daa83b6b361</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
