  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"RIGHT OF RESCISSION applies to both closed-end and open-end transactions that involve security interest in a borrower's primary dwelling."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-dc8b7db5bf49f6eb8f1e8daa83b6b361</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RIGHT OF RESCISSION&quot;" target="&quot;RESIDENTIAL MORTGAGE TRANSACTIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Right of Rescission applies specifically to Residential Mortgage Transactions, giving consumers protection regarding their primary residence."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-dc8b7db5bf49f6eb8f1e8daa83b6b361</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RIGHT OF RESCISSION&quot;" target="&quot;LIABILITY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Right of Rescission affects a lender's Liability by providing legal grounds for consumers to cancel certain credit transactions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-dc8b7db5bf49f6eb8f1e8daa83b6b361</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RIGHT OF RESCISSION&quot;" target="&quot;ACKNOWLEDGMENT LINES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Acknowledgment Lines are necessary to confirm that the borrower understands their Right of Rescission."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-dc8b7db5bf49f6eb8f1e8daa83b6b361</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RIGHT OF RESCISSION&quot;" target="&quot;NOTICE OF RIGHT TO CANCEL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">19.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Notice of Right to Cancel is a formal notification that informs borrowers of their Right of Rescission, thus directly related."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Notice of Right to Cancel serves as an official document informing the borrower of their Right of Rescission."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-faf7af26dea16d8bcfcc9a3324ded2bc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RIGHT OF RESCISSION&quot;" target="&quot;WAIVER OF RESCISSION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Right of Rescission can be waived under certain conditions, indicating a direct relationship between the two concepts."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-faf7af26dea16d8bcfcc9a3324ded2bc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RIGHT OF RESCISSION&quot;" target="&quot;PERSONAL FINANCIAL EMERGENCY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A personal financial emergency can justify the borrower’s request for a waiver of the Right of Rescission, linking both terms closely."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-faf7af26dea16d8bcfcc9a3324ded2bc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
