  <data key="d4">10.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Right of Rescission specifically applies to residential mortgage loans, establishing a clear relationship between them."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-faf7af26dea16d8bcfcc9a3324ded2bc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RIGHT OF RESCISSION&quot;" target="&quot;LOAN ESTIMATE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Loan Estimate must include the Right of Rescission, which serves to protect borrowers by informing them of their rights, linking these two important documents."</data>
