  <data key="d4">8.5</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Notice of Right to Cancel is a document that is part of the disclosures outlined in Regulation Z for borrowers."</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REGULATION Z&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER WAIVER OF RIGHT TO RESCIND&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower Waiver of Right to Rescind is influenced by the regulations set forth in Regulation Z regarding how and when a borrower can cancel a loan."</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REGULATION Z&quot;" target="&quot;RESCISSION PERIOD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Rescission Period is a concept incorporated into Regulation Z which defines the timeline borrowers have to exercise their Right of Rescission."</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REGULATION Z&quot;" target="&quot;CONSUMER'S PRINCIPAL RESIDENCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.5</data>
  <data key="d5">"Regulation Z applies specifically to loans secured by the Consumer's Principal Residence as part of protecting consumer rights."</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REGULATION Z&quot;" target="&quot;EXECUTED NOTICE OF RIGHT TO CANCEL&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Executed Notice of Right to Cancel is a document that falls under the compliance requirements set by Regulation Z."</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REGULATION Z&quot;" target="&quot;RESIDENTIAL MORTGAGE LOAN RESCISSIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.8</data>
  <data key="d5">"Residential Mortgage Loan Rescissions are specifically governed by the provisions outlined in Regulation Z, ensuring borrower rights are upheld."</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REGULATION Z&quot;" target="&quot;NOTICE OF RIGHT TO RESCIND&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Notice of Right to Rescind is specifically required by Regulation Z to inform consumers of their rights in loan transactions."</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;REGULATION Z&quot;" target="&quot;RESCINDED LOAN FEE&quot;">
