  <data key="d4">18.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Document #4622 refers to the Right of Rescission under Regulation Z, creating a legal relationship."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Right of Rescission outlined in Doc. #4622 is guided by Regulation Z obligations, linking both entities legally."</data>
