</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RESCISSION PERIOD&quot;" target="&quot;TRIGGERING EVENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Rescission Period begins after the occurrence of specified triggering events related to loan transactions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-dc8b7db5bf49f6eb8f1e8daa83b6b361</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RESCISSION PERIOD&quot;" target="&quot;CONSUMER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Rescission Period is specifically designed to protect consumers by providing them time to reconsider their loan obligations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-dc8b7db5bf49f6eb8f1e8daa83b6b361</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RESCISSION PERIOD&quot;" target="&quot;TRIGGERING EVENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The occurrence of a triggering event marks the beginning of the Rescission Period, indicating a critical phase in the loan process."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-dc8b7db5bf49f6eb8f1e8daa83b6b361</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RESCISSION PERIOD&quot;" target="&quot;THREE BUSINESS DAYS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Rescission Period lasts for Three Business Days after the occurrence of defined Triggering Events."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-dc8b7db5bf49f6eb8f1e8daa83b6b361</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LEGAL HOLIDAYS&quot;" target="&quot;BUSINESS UNIT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Business Unit must account for Legal Holidays when managing the timeline for the Right of Rescission."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-dc8b7db5bf49f6eb8f1e8daa83b6b361</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LEGAL HOLIDAYS&quot;" target="&quot;CANCELLED LOANS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Cancelled loans may require compliance with legal holidays, affecting processing timelines and borrower expectations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1afd5d25f6f318da0cbe2e55f0a46af0</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER WAIVER OF RIGHT TO RESCIND&quot;" target="&quot;PERSONAL FINANCIAL EMERGENCY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A waiver of the right to rescind can only be accepted under urgent financial circumstances, as defined by Regulation Z requirements."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-dc8b7db5bf49f6eb8f1e8daa83b6b361</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER WAIVER OF RIGHT TO RESCIND&quot;" target="&quot;NON-OBLIGATED BORROWERS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"NON-OBLIGATED BORROWERS may also have rights under the Borrower Waiver of Right to Rescind, regarding their acknowledgment in loan transactions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-dc8b7db5bf49f6eb8f1e8daa83b6b361</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER WAIVER OF RIGHT TO RESCIND&quot;" target="&quot;FINANCIAL EMERGENCY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower Waiver of Right to Rescind is based on the existence of a financial emergency that requires immediate action."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-dc8b7db5bf49f6eb8f1e8daa83b6b361</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER WAIVER OF RIGHT TO RESCIND&quot;" target="&quot;LENDER REQUIREMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Lender Requirements outline the conditions under which a Borrower may waive their right to rescind a transaction based on Financial Emergencies."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-dc8b7db5bf49f6eb8f1e8daa83b6b361</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONSUMER&quot;" target="&quot;SECURITY INTEREST&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The relationship between Consumers and Security Interest is critical, as the security interest is retained or acquired in the consumer's primary dwelling during credit transactions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-dc8b7db5bf49f6eb8f1e8daa83b6b361</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TRIGGERING EVENTS&quot;" target="&quot;ACKNOWLEDGMENT LINES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Acknowledgment Lines on the Notice of Right to Cancel may be tied to the occurrence of Triggering Events that dictate when the rescission period begins."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-dc8b7db5bf49f6eb8f1e8daa83b6b361</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TRIGGERING EVENTS&quot;" target="&quot;CONSUMER'S PRINCIPAL RESIDENCE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Triggering Events are specifically related to the Consumer's Principal Residence and impact the Right of Rescission for borrower transactions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-dc8b7db5bf49f6eb8f1e8daa83b6b361</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECTION 1026.23&quot;" target="&quot;PROCEDURAL REQUIREMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Section 1026.23 of Regulation Z includes specific Procedural Requirements that lenders must follow in relation to the Right of Rescission."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-dc8b7db5bf49f6eb8f1e8daa83b6b361</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CLOSED-END TRANSACTIONS&quot;" target="&quot;OPEN-END TRANSACTIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both Closed-End and Open-End Transactions are defined under Regulation Z and subject to similar consumer rights regarding rescission."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-dc8b7db5bf49f6eb8f1e8daa83b6b361</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CLOSED-END TRANSACTIONS&quot;" target="&quot;NON-OBLIGATED BORROWERS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Non-Obligated Borrowers are included in the considerations under Closed-End Transactions when assessing rights to rescind."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-dc8b7db5bf49f6eb8f1e8daa83b6b361</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LIABILITY&quot;" target="&quot;LENDER REQUIREMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Lender Requirements impose certain liabilities on lenders regarding the provision of the Right of Rescission and related disclosures."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-dc8b7db5bf49f6eb8f1e8daa83b6b361</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LIABILITY&quot;" target="&quot;FINANCIAL EMERGENCY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Liability of the lender can be affected if a financial emergency waiver is not handled correctly or if the borrower is not adequately informed."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-dc8b7db5bf49f6eb8f1e8daa83b6b361</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LIABILITY&quot;" target="&quot;ACKNOWLEDGMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"An Acknowledgment by the borrower of receipt of the Notice of Right to Rescind can influence the Lender's Liability if the required disclosures are not made."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-dc8b7db5bf49f6eb8f1e8daa83b6b361</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LIABILITY&quot;" target="&quot;MANAGING EXECUTIVES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Managing Executives are responsible for mitigating Liability issues associated with the Right of Rescission in their lending practices."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-dc8b7db5bf49f6eb8f1e8daa83b6b361</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BUSINESS UNIT&quot;" target="&quot;MANAGING EXECUTIVES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Managing Executives oversee the Business Unit that is responsible for ensuring compliance with regulatory requirements regarding the Right of Rescission."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-dc8b7db5bf49f6eb8f1e8daa83b6b361</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NOTICE OF RIGHT TO RESCIND&quot;" target="&quot;ACKNOWLEDGMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"BORROWERS must sign an acknowledgment that they received the Notice of Right to Rescind, confirming their understanding of their rights."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-dc8b7db5bf49f6eb8f1e8daa83b6b361</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NOTICE OF RIGHT TO RESCIND&quot;" target="&quot;CLOSING PACKAGES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Closing packages must include a Notice of Right to Rescind, ensuring legal compliance during loan finalizations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-faf7af26dea16d8bcfcc9a3324ded2bc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TRIGGERING EVENT&quot;" target="&quot;FINANCIAL EMERGENCY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A financial emergency may influence a borrower's decision regarding a triggering event and their potential waiver of rescission rights."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-dc8b7db5bf49f6eb8f1e8daa83b6b361</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RESIDENTIAL MORTGAGE TRANSACTIONS&quot;" target="&quot;NON-OBLIGATED BORROWERS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Non-Obligated Borrowers may also participate in Residential Mortgage Transactions, impacting their rights under the Right of Rescission."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-dc8b7db5bf49f6eb8f1e8daa83b6b361</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ACKNOWLEDGMENT&quot;" target="&quot;FINANCIAL EMERGENCY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The borrower must provide an acknowledgment if they wish to waive their right to rescind based on a Financial Emergency."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-dc8b7db5bf49f6eb8f1e8daa83b6b361</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
