<edge source="&quot;FUNDING DEPARTMENT&quot;" target="&quot;POST-CLOSING&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Funding Department must review documents before disbursement, linking its operations with Post-Closing activities."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-faf7af26dea16d8bcfcc9a3324ded2bc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FUNDING DEPARTMENT&quot;" target="&quot;LEGAL DEPARTMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Funding Department notifies the Legal Department for document reviews related to rescission requests, showing procedural interconnection."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-faf7af26dea16d8bcfcc9a3324ded2bc</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FUNDING DEPARTMENT&quot;" target="&quot;RESCISSION DEPARTMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Funding Department collaborates with the Rescission Department to handle aspects of loan rescissions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-faf7af26dea16d8bcfcc9a3324ded2bc</data>
