  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Delinquent Tax Penalty relates to penalties imposed by the Taxing Authority for unpaid taxes."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Taxing Authority is responsible for the penalties, which link them directly to the financial implications Flagstar Bank faces regarding taxes."&lt;</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fe4b9e8302b8de2d8d692106e4e284ae&lt;SEP&gt;</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
