  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Tax Service Fee for conforming and non-conforming loans is relevant to obligations to the Taxing Authority."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-fe4b9e8302b8de2d8d692106e4e284ae</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TAXING AUTHORITY&quot;" target="&quot;DELINQUENT TAX PENALTY FEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">17.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Delinquent Tax Penalty Fee reflects the authority's role in financial penalties for unpaid taxes, indicating regulatory oversight."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Taxing Authority imposes the Delinquent Tax Penalty Fee, which Flagstar Bank incurs for late payments."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bf2d9f6b5b471373ca78f75c11d02725&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-662a2c10d200da7291e0212d33749544</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TAXING AUTHORITY&quot;" target="&quot;PENALTIES FOR TAXES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Taxing Authority imposes Penalties for Taxes, directly linking them to tax-related financial consequences."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-662a2c10d200da7291e0212d33749544</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TAXING AUTHORITY&quot;" target="&quot;PENALTY AUTHORITY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both authorities impose penalties but focus on different aspects—financial penalties and tax-related penalties, indicating a broader regulatory framework."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bf2d9f6b5b471373ca78f75c11d02725</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
