  <data key="d4">17.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The APPRAISAL RELEASE FORM is necessary for processing the APPRAISAL RELEASE FEE in cases of withdrawn or denied loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Appraisal Release Form is connected to the Appraisal Release Fee charged on loans, establishing a direct relationship between documentation and fees."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bf2d9f6b5b471373ca78f75c11d02725&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da6a7f245e88177bac6b85d5f808ebd3</data>
