  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Loans denied with an adverse action letter also do not incur an appraisal release fee, highlighting procedures in loan denial impacts on fees."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bf2d9f6b5b471373ca78f75c11d02725</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;APPRAISAL PORTABILITY&quot;" target="&quot;APPRAISAL RELEASE FORM&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Appraisal Release Form and Appraisal Portability are two related concepts in property appraisals that may influence loan agreements."</data>
