  <data key="d4">17.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Penalties for Taxes relates to the Delinquent Tax Penalty Fee as a consequence of late payments to the Taxing Authority."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Delinquent Tax Penalty Fee directly derives from the Penalties for Taxes imposed by the Taxing Authority."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-662a2c10d200da7291e0212d33749544</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
