  <data key="d4">18.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Penalty Authority imposes the Delinquent Tax Penalty Fee for late tax payments, indicating their authority in financial penalties."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Penalty Authority enforces the Delinquent Tax Penalty Fee for late tax payments, indicating a regulatory oversight function."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bf2d9f6b5b471373ca78f75c11d02725</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
