  <data key="d4">15.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Early Loan Payoff Fee applied to Government Loans illustrates a relationship in loan structuring and financial penalties."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Early Loan Payoff Fee is also detailed for Government Loans, indicating its relevance to this loan type as well."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-bf2d9f6b5b471373ca78f75c11d02725&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-662a2c10d200da7291e0212d33749544</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
