  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"DOCUMENT #4617 provides details regarding the Early Loan Payoff Fee, connecting the documentation with the fee structure."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c0a48a482a40438f89f44e8758608310</data>
