  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Government Loans are subject to specific Loan Underwriting Guidelines that dictate their qualification criteria."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-662a2c10d200da7291e0212d33749544</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;GOVERNMENT LOANS&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER'S PAYMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower's Payments on Government Loans must adhere to specified repayment schedules, reflecting their responsibility."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-662a2c10d200da7291e0212d33749544</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EARLY PAYMENT DEFAULT&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER'S PAYMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Early Payment Default indicates a failure in meeting the Borrower's Payments, relating disciplinary actions to their financial responsibilities."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-662a2c10d200da7291e0212d33749544</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EARLY PAYMENT DEFAULT&quot;" target="&quot;CORRESPONDENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Correspondents must pay fees to FLAGSTAR if a Borrower's payments become delinquent, directly linking them to Early Payment Default scenarios."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c0a48a482a40438f89f44e8758608310</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EARLY PAYMENT DEFAULT&quot;" target="&quot;FINAL DOCUMENT FEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"If there are errors in documents related to loans that experience early payment default, it could result in final document fees, linking these two conditions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c0a48a482a40438f89f44e8758608310</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EARLY PAYMENT DEFAULT&quot;" target="&quot;TIME PERIOD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The time period relevant to the early payment default governs the timeline for penalties and fees, establishing a direct link between these concepts."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c0a48a482a40438f89f44e8758608310</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;WIRE TRANSFER FEE&quot;" target="&quot;SETTLEMENT AGENT FEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Wire Transfer Fee may be incurred during transactions handled by the Settlement Agent, linking these fees to each other."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-662a2c10d200da7291e0212d33749544</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
