<edge source="&quot;LOAN DEFICIENCY&quot;" target="&quot;SINGLE LOAN WAIVER FEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">15.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A loan deficiency can trigger a single loan waiver fee, indicating how one condition affects another."&lt;SEP&gt;"The SINGLE LOAN WAIVER FEE can be approved due to LOAN DEFICIENCY, thus establishing a connection based on loan performance standards."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-42d99ce4642f1e6e8c39678043a90b1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-73179b73b8a774ced8d562931d514540</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LOAN DEFICIENCY&quot;" target="&quot;LOAN WAIVER EXCEPTION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Loan deficiencies can lead to a loan waiver exception, establishing a cause-and-effect relationship."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-42d99ce4642f1e6e8c39678043a90b1e</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EXCESSIVE CASH RECEIVED BY BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;PAYMENT DEFAULT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"If excessive cash is disbursed to the borrower, it could lead to difficulties in repayment, linking these two conditions closely."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c0a48a482a40438f89f44e8758608310</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;HOLDBACK PROCESSING FEE&quot;" target="&quot;FINAL DOCUMENT FEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Final Document Fee may lead to processing fees due to missing or incorrect documents, linking these fees together in the settlement process."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c0a48a482a40438f89f44e8758608310</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;HOLDBACK PROCESSING FEE&quot;" target="&quot;HOLD BACK&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"HOLD BACK directly relates to the processing fees required for managing funds withheld during closing."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c0a48a482a40438f89f44e8758608310</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;HOLDBACK PROCESSING FEE&quot;" target="&quot;ERRORS &amp; OMISSIONS FEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Errors &amp; omissions that lead to holdups in processing may result in additional fees, linking these two financial aspects closely."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c0a48a482a40438f89f44e8758608310</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INITIAL PMI FEE&quot;" target="&quot;FHA/VA LOANS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">17.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The INITIAL PMI FEE is associated with FHA/VA LOANS, as it relates to mortgage insurance coverage required for these loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"The INITIAL PMI FEE is specifically applicable to FHA/VA LOANS, indicating a required cost for insurance coverage associated with these loan types."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-73179b73b8a774ced8d562931d514540</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MERS SYSTEM&quot;" target="&quot;MERS NON-REGISTRATION FEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The MERS non-registration fee is required for loans not registered on the MERS system."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f639d102461efe890e188cbc182dba52</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MERS SYSTEM&quot;" target="&quot;NON-MERS LOAN FEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">21.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A non-MERS loan fee applies to loans that were not drawn on MERS documentation."&lt;SEP&gt;"The NON-MERS LOAN FEE indicates charges for loans not registered in the MERS SYSTEM, suggesting a relationship based on registration requirements."&lt;SEP&gt;"The NON-MERS LOAN FEE is charged for loans not registered on the MERS SYSTEM, indicating a direct relationship with registration processes."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f639d102461efe890e188cbc182dba52&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-73179b73b8a774ced8d562931d514540</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MERS SYSTEM&quot;" target="&quot;NON-MERS MEMBERSHIP FEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">13.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The NON-MERS MEMBERSHIP FEE involves fees paid to maintain membership in the MERS SYSTEM, linking the two directly."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Non-MERS membership fee pertains to accounts that have not renewed their MERS membership for loan registration."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f639d102461efe890e188cbc182dba52&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-73179b73b8a774ced8d562931d514540</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ADDITIONAL UNDERWRITING FEE&quot;" target="&quot;UNAPPROVED CO-BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Additional Underwriting Fee is assessed specifically on loans with unapproved co-borrowers, indicating a financial impact."&lt;SEP&gt;"The additional underwriting fee is assessed when an unapproved co-borrower is present, linking the fee with borrower status."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-42d99ce4642f1e6e8c39678043a90b1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f1451e00f0a33296b7172a8a2f00a036</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ADDITIONAL UNDERWRITING FEE&quot;" target="&quot;MIP FEE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Additional Underwriting Fee may be influenced by MIP Fee requirements, particularly for specific loan types."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f1451e00f0a33296b7172a8a2f00a036</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INVOICE&quot;" target="&quot;FEE SCHEDULE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">13.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Invoices provide a breakdown of the fees as outlined in the fee schedule provided by the lender."&lt;SEP&gt;"The invoice details fees according to the fee schedule agreed upon for a specific loan."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f639d102461efe890e188cbc182dba52</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
