  <data key="d6">chunk-f639d102461efe890e188cbc182dba52</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FEE NAME&quot;" target="&quot;AMOUNT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">23.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Amount refers to the financial aspect of the fee name related to various charges within the loan process."&lt;SEP&gt;"Each fee name is associated with a specific amount due as per the loan's fee structure."&lt;SEP&gt;"The relationship between FEE NAME and AMOUNT is that each fee name is associated with a specific amount listed in the document."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-42d99ce4642f1e6e8c39678043a90b1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f639d102461efe890e188cbc182dba52&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da6a7f245e88177bac6b85d5f808ebd3</data>
