</edge>
<edge source="&quot;FEE NAME&quot;" target="&quot;DESCRIPTION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">25.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Each FEE NAME is accompanied by a DESCRIPTION that explains the nature and purpose of the fee."&lt;SEP&gt;"Each fee name is associated with a specific description outlining its applicability and conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The description provides details related to each fee name, creating a direct informational relationship."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-42d99ce4642f1e6e8c39678043a90b1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f639d102461efe890e188cbc182dba52&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da6a7f245e88177bac6b85d5f808ebd3</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
