  <data key="d4">15.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Federal Housing Administration's role is to provide mortgage insurance, complementing the role of the Guaranteed Rural Housing Program in supporting affordable housing."|&gt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Guaranteed Rural Housing Program is a government initiative that includes FHA guidelines for rural housing."|&gt;</data>
